window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3801,"title":"Chapter 3801: You Can Even Do an S-Grade Experiment. Are You Afraid of This?","paragraphs":["At this moment, Ye Wangchuan knocked on the door and entered.","\"Come in.\"","Qiao Nian was having a headache from reading the reports. She looked at him while pressing the bridge of her nose.","Ye Wangchuan walked over and handed her a thin piece of paper. \"She wrote the list you wanted.\"","\"So soon?\" Qiao Nian was stunned and reached out to take it.","Ye Wangchuan took the opportunity when she was looking down at the name list to look at the report on the screen. He recalled the fatigue in Qiao Nian’s eyes when he entered and asked, \"This... do you want me to help you?\"","\"What?\"","Qiao Nian looked up.","Noticing his gaze, she followed it to the complicated financial statements on the screen and immediately understood what he meant.","She handed him the laptop without a second thought, with a sigh of relief. \"You do it.\"","\"Tsk.\"","Ye Wangchuan took the laptop from her and walked to the desk. He hooked a chair and sat down, with a hint of helplessness and doting between his brows. \"You can even do an S-level experiment at the First Research Institute. Why are you afraid of handling these reports?\"","Someone had helped her solve her big problem. Qiao Nian was fully focused on the list written by Old Madam Xie. She couldn’t even be bothered to look up as she said, \"That’s different. The experiment is interesting. The report looks too boring.\"","Ye Wangchuan placed her black laptop on the table and pulled up the reports that she said were boring. His slender finger tapped on the Enter key, and he looked at the list of emails.","From the looks of it, there were at least 20 emails. He wondered how long it had been since Qiao Nian had read all of them.","\"You want me to look at all of them?\"","\"Ah.\"","Silence.","Ye Wangchuan pressed a finger between his eyebrows as a strong sense of helplessness appeared on his noble and handsome face. Then, he opened a blank form and filled in the data according to the contents of the email.","\"I’ll make a summary for you. You can just look at the summary forms later. You don’t have to read them one by one.\"","\"Okay.\"","The girl’s body and mind relaxed, and her frustration dissipated. She crossed her legs and tapped a finger on the paper thoughtfully.","The room fell into silence.","The warm light shone on the two of them, but they were doing their own things unusually harmoniously, like a warm painting.","**","Downstairs.","After Old Madam Xie handed the list to Ye Wangchuan, she waited uneasily in the living room for someone to come down.","She waited and waited.","After waiting for almost an hour, no one came down from upstairs.","At first, Old Madam Xie was uneasy, but later on, she became more or less angry. She couldn’t suppress the anger of being looked down upon.","It wasn’t easy for her to wait until Guan Yan came out of the room. She couldn’t care less at this point. \"That—\"","Guan Yan came out to get water. At her shout, she turned around and pointed at herself. \"You called me?\"","\"Yes, you.\"","Old Madam Xie didn’t know her identity and thought she was just one of Qiao Nian’s subordinates. She said impolitely, \"Help me look for someone upstairs. Ask Qiao Nian when she will come down. I’m still waiting for her here.\"","\"Oh?\" Guan Yan asked with a faint smile, \"Find Sun? Why don’t you go up and find her yourself?\"","Even Qiao Nian’s subordinates had such an attitude?","Old Madam Xie was a little dissatisfied but did not flare up. She suppressed her anger and said with a straight face, \"You’re here. Why should I look for her myself?\""]},{"number":3802,"title":"Chapter 3802: If I Were You, It Would Be Good If I Were Still Alive","paragraphs":["She asked Guan Yan matter-of-factly, \"Go up and call her down for me. Tell her that I’ve already given her the name list. When can I leave?\"","Before Guan Yan entered, she had heard them talking about the name list. Now that she understood the cause and effect of the matter, she raised her eyebrows. \"Leave?\"","\"She’s not going to let me go?!\" Old Madam Xie was shocked and afraid.","Qiao Nian had indeed not agreed to her conditions previously. She had not promised to write off everything as long as she wrote out the name list.","However, she had already written down the name list. What else did she want?","Guan Yan didn’t know how Qiao Nian planned to deal with Old Madam Xie. Qiao Nian still had not come down yet, and she couldn’t make the decision on her behalf.","However, she couldn’t stand Old Madam Xie’s domineering attitude at this juncture. She fetched a glass of water and deliberately leaned against the wall to scare her.","\"Since Matriarch is already here, you can stay at our Red Alliance’s HQ for two more days. Why are you in a hurry to leave? Anyway, you won’t be able to leave the illegal district even if you go back, right?\"","\"Is she really not planning to let me go?!\"","Old Madam Xie caught the main point. Her face turned as pale as paper. She stood there with her palms clenched, her entire body enveloped in shock and anger.","Guan Yan looked at her shocked and afraid expression in satisfaction and replied with a smile, \"I’ve already said that it’s too unfriendly to leave just like that. Sun wants Matriarch to stay in our Red Alliance’s HQ for a few more days. Wait a moment. I’ll get someone to arrange a room for you. You can stay in peace!\"","That little wolf cub wanted to keep an eye on her!","Seeing that Guan Yan didn’t seem to be scaring her, Old Madam Xie staggered weakly. Fortunately, she grabbed the sofa’s armrest to prevent herself from losing her composure.","Her lips trembled. She wanted to cause trouble, but thinking of the girl’s eyes, which were colder than Lake Baikal, she swallowed the anger that had just risen in her heart.","Guan Yan mocked with a faint smile. \"However, we have limited guest rooms. I can only get someone to clean up the storeroom.\"","The storeroom...","Old Madam Xie suddenly raised her head and glared at her fiercely. She was so angry that her hands were trembling.","Guan Yan met her angry gaze and lowered her head to sip the water. Then, she smiled provocatively and said meaningfully, \"If I were you, Matriarch, I’d be glad that I’m still alive, and not conflicted about whether I should stay in the guest room or the storeroom.\"","Old Madam Xie’s eyes flickered. She understood that she had no choice but to lower her head. In the end, she lowered her head. \"I... understand.\"","**","The next day.","Qiao Nian only woke up at nine in the morning. After going downstairs for breakfast and hearing Guan Yan’s summary, she finally remembered leaving Old Madam Xie downstairs yesterday.","Guan Yan saw her eating a piece of bread and softly asked, \"Sun, what do you plan to do with that old woman?\"","Qiao Nian took a bite of the bread and sipped the milk. Then, she frowned, seemingly with a headache. \"... I don’t know.\"","\"Why don’t we just...\" Guan Yan made a neck-slicing gesture.","Qiao Nian looked at her and took another bite of the bread. Suddenly losing her appetite, she leaned back in her chair, feeling lazy and cold.","\"I haven’t thought about it.","\"Keep her there for now. I’ll deal with her when I’ve thought it through.\"","\"Okay.\"","Qiao Nian sat up straight, picked up her bread slice from the porcelain plate, and silently ate her breakfast.","Guan Yan stopped speaking upon seeing that she was in a bad mood. Just as she was about to go to the kitchen to grab her breakfast, the girl calmly asked, \"Did those guys at the hotel do anything?\""]},{"number":3803,"title":"Chapter 3803: We Can Only Be Played by the Red Alliance","paragraphs":["\"Oh, them.\"","Speaking of this, Guan Yan became interested. She forgot about breakfast and told her everything that had happened since Old Madam Xie was taken away yesterday.","When she finished, her peach blossom eyes sparkled, and a trace of charm and coldness appeared in them. \"Now, besides Di Xicheng, who can keep his composure, the others have more or less tried to escape.\"","Speaking of this, she couldn’t help but sigh. \"But that Di Xicheng is really patient. You’ve already taken one of them away, but he’s still acting as if nothing happened. He’s not afraid that you’ll go for him next. I wonder where he got his confidence from...\"","Sun had a personal feud with him.","With all the old and new grudges added together, there was a high chance he would be the next one targeted!","However, the others trapped in the hotel were all frantically trying to escape. He was the only one staying in his room in peace.","This kind of person was either too ambitious or... crazy.","He wasn’t afraid of even this. If he wasn’t crazy, what was he?","\"Continent M haven’t even made a move yet. What’s there to be afraid of?\" Qiao Nian said without batting an eyelid.","Guan Yan looked at her. \"Sun, are you talking about that...\"","\"She got the message two days ago but hasn’t reacted until now. Don’t you think that’s unusual?\"","\"Now that you mention it, it’s really...\" It was really a little abnormal!","Qiao Nian smirked arrogantly. \"Let’s wait and see what they do.\"","**","In fact, ever since Old Madam Xie was taken away by Ye Wangchuan yesterday, everyone in the hotel had deeply felt the Red Alliance’s threat.","Previously, they could still pretend to be at peace and treat the current situation as a confrontation between the two sides, maintaining a delicate balance.","But what happened yesterday made them deeply understand that there was no so-called confrontation or balance at all.","Qiao Nian just ignored them.","They had no ability to resist if the other party came for them!","To these descendants from big families, none of them had truly experienced such a situation where their lives were controlled by others before.","Last night, everyone, including Singh, began to think of ways to leave this ’cage’.","Some bold people tried to leave the hotel yesterday. Without exception, the moment they stepped out, an infrared sniper point appeared on their chests.","A small red dot was enough to warn them.","Once they retreated into the lobby, the infrared sniper point disappeared.","This attempt made them completely understand the Red Alliance’s bottom line.","No matter how the Red Alliance contacted the outside world, none of them were allowed to leave the hotel!","This feeling of being locked in a cage was very uncomfortable, especially when one’s life was not guaranteed. Every minute and second was getting more and more unbearable...","Most of them did not manage to get a wink of sleep the entire night.","In the morning, everyone had heavy, dark circles under their eyes and looked listless. They didn’t even have the energy to greet each other.","Singh also came down with a pair of big panda eyes. Not bothering to wear a skirt, she just casually put on a coat and pants.","Seeing that everyone’s expression was gloomy and the atmosphere was heavy, she couldn’t help but lean against the stairs and curse. \"We can only be f*cking played by the Red Alliance like fools?!\"","\"What do you want?\"","No one felt good after their failed attempt last night."]},{"number":3804,"title":"Chapter 3804: I’m Going to Ask Di Xicheng","paragraphs":["Seeing Singh throwing a tantrum, someone couldn’t help but mock coldly, \"You can leave if you’re not satisfied, as long as you can make it out alive!\"","\"You...\" Singh’s expression was terrible. She held her breath and squeezed it out, \"I can’t leave, but what’s with the one from the reclusive families?! We’re being suppressed and bullied in his territory. He claims to be the reclusive families, but in the end, he only has this strength... How many days has it been? He hasn’t even thought of a way. What’s the point of hiding in his room every day?! Acting like a turtle?\"","Di Xicheng stayed in his room all this time. Everyone was somewhat disappointed.","After all, the reclusive families as an entity were the strongest among them, and he was representing the Empress.","In the end, after so many days, even after they got together to think of a solution, Di Xicheng didn’t even show his face.","The reclusive families’ attitude naturally caused most people to be dissatisfied.","Although Singh’s scolding was unpleasant, it hit the nail on the head.","\"Don’t say that. The reclusive families might be thinking of a way...\" Someone reluctantly tried to smooth things over, but the reason was not convincing.","As expected, Singh mocked him even more. \"That’s right. We still don’t know when the Red Alliance will come and take someone else away. When all of us are taken away, they will think of a way!\"","At that time, all of them would be dead, and the reclusive families would come to collect their corpses. Wouldn’t that be perfect!","Singh didn’t say what she was thinking, but the meaning between the lines was obvious. Everyone could tell what she meant.","In this way, everyone’s originally dispirited expressions became even uglier.","The lobby was shrouded in gloom...","Unable to stand the miserable atmosphere, after thinking for a while, Singh gritted her teeth and said, \"I’ll go ask Di Xicheng if he has a solution!\"","If there was really no other way, she might as well stand up and surrender to the Red Alliance to see if they were willing to let her off.","After all, that old woman from the Xie family’s account about what happened decades ago had nothing to do with her. Perhaps if she showed a good attitude, Sun from the Red Alliance would be willing to let her off.","Singh came up with a plan and immediately went upstairs to look for Di Xicheng.","...","Upstairs.","Di Xicheng’s door was tightly shut, and there was only a guard from the reclusive families guarding it.","Singh went straight to the door to confront the guard with raised eyebrows. \"I want to see Young Master Di.\"","What?","\"I have something to ask him.\" Singh didn’t give in. She raised her chin, and her attitude was obvious. She had to see Di Xicheng today, no matter what!","\"Young Master Di is not free,\" the guard responded expressionlessly. His muscular body blocked her way, as if he would not let Singh disturb the person inside.","Singh did not expect such an attitude from the other party and couldn’t help but try to move him. She raised her voice and said, \"Move!\"","The guard grabbed her wrist and warned coldly, \"Miss Singh, I advise you not to cause trouble here.\"","Singh’s wrist bones were about to shatter. She gritted her teeth in pain, and her voice became louder. \"I must see him today. Kill me if you dare!\"","Angered, the guard was about to teach her a lesson when the person inside said coldly, \"Let her in.\""]},{"number":3805,"title":"Chapter 3805: They Have to Make a Move Tonight","paragraphs":["Singh knocked away the burly man and proudly said, \"Did you hear that? He asked me to go in.\"","The guard’s face twitched. Then, he silently made way with a straight face.","Singh arrogantly pushed the door open and entered, but inside, she was actually not confident. She closed the door softly as she entered.","The moment she did, she saw a young man standing by the window with his back facing her. She covered her lips with her hand and coughed dryly. \" Ahem .\"","The young man turned around and looked at her.","Meeting the other party’s seemingly gentle but cold eyes, Singh felt inexplicably guilty. She subconsciously avoided his gaze and explained herself. \"That... Young Master Di, I didn’t mean to make a fuss outside.","\"Everyone has been trapped here for a few days and is not confident, so they asked me to come up and ask you... When will the reclusive families make a move?\"","She had wanted to argue with Di Xicheng aggressively. However, as she really stood there, her aura immediately weakened.","Singh didn’t know why she didn’t dare to clash with Di Xicheng. She just instinctively felt that the man in front of her was very dangerous.","The kind of danger that once provoked, one might be targeted by a venomous snake.","Hence, even though she had come to question the other party for not making a move, she did not have the confidence to speak. \"Young Master Di, everyone is worried. You see...\"","As Singh spoke, she peeked at the man’s expression to see if it had changed.","Di Xicheng smirked, not looking angry. \"Is that what you wanted to talk about?\"","\"Ah, um...\" Singh was embarrassed.","Di Xicheng couldn’t be bothered to argue about her rudeness toward the reclusive families outside. He only said, \"We’re leaving tonight.\"","Singh came back to her senses. \"Tonight?!\"","Di Xicheng looked into her eyes and said unhurriedly, \"The plane has already landed at the nearest airport. As long as nothing goes wrong, we can leave tonight.\"","\"Then, the Red Alliance...\" After the surprise, Singh immediately became worried.","The illegal district was the Red Alliance’s territory.","How could Qiao Nian not know that they were taking a plane?","Di Xicheng seemed to know what she was thinking. \"Don’t worry, everything has been arranged. You guys just have to keep up when the time comes...\"","Singh’s heart was still in turmoil.","Di Xicheng half-smiled as he continued, \"... If anyone can’t keep up, they can only stay here forever from tonight onwards!\"","Singh shivered as a chill ran down her spine. She immediately said, \"Young Master Di, don’t worry. I will definitely follow you.\"","Di Xicheng did not say anything. He just sneered at her.","Singh wasn’t blind. She smiled awkwardly and quickly turned to leave. \"Then, I won’t disturb Young Master Di anymore.\"","She turned to flee.","Just as she reached the door, Di Xicheng ’kindly’ reminded her, \"If I were you, I wouldn’t think to make any phone calls here. If word gets out...\"","Singh suddenly turned around and said solemnly, \"I understand, Young Master Di.\"","\"That’s good.\" Di Xicheng retracted his gaze and looked out the window again, as if everything had nothing to do with him.","Singh felt oppressed just by being by his side.","She didn’t dare to stay any longer and quietly left.","As she went down, she decided to inform everyone not to leak the news.","They wouldn’t be able to leave if the Red Alliance found out!"]},{"number":3806,"title":"Chapter 3806: Master Wang Already Knows","paragraphs":["At the same time.","Red Alliance’s HQ.","\"Master Wang, they’re making a move.\"","\"Oh?\"","\"The K Organization’s people have started to gather in that area. Besides them, an Airbus plane also landed on a private tarmac nearby. It looks like they can’t wait any longer.\"","Ye Wangchuan’s hand paused midair. His thin lips curled up slightly, revealing a knowing expression. Then, he said casually to the person on the other end of the call, \"Got it. Keep an eye on them!\"","\"Yes, Master Wang,\" replied the person on the other end.","Ye Wangchuan turned off the call, took out his Bluetooth earpiece, and left the bar. Passing by the living room, he happened to see Guan Yan talking to Qiao Nian.","Guan Yan had just finished speaking when he walked over.","She was asking, \"Sun, are we going to interfere?\"","The girl was wearing a dark blue sweater and curled up on the sofa. A black laptop was on her lap, and she was wearing a baseball cap. She exuded a faint aura.","At Guan Yan’s question, the girl looked up, her eyes dark. She thought for a moment before saying in a slightly hoarse voice, \"I won’t make a move for the time being.\"","Ye Wangchuan walked over and placed the water in front of her. Only now did he realize she was using 3D simulation technology to build a model on her laptop.","It seemed to be a high-precision weapon model. It already had a basic prototype.","Qiao Nian was lazily playing with it like a game model.","He retracted his gaze and did not ask Qiao Nian if it was the ultimate weapon left behind by Ji Qing. Instead, he clinked the glass and reminded her, \"Your dark circles are out. Didn’t you sleep well last night? Rest more.\"","\"Oh.\" Qiao Nian had been building models on the computer for the past few days. All she could think of was how to materialize Ji Qing’s research.","She slept only a couple of hours for a few nights before waking up. Thus, she decided she might as well work on the model. Given that behavior, the dark circles under her eyes must be heavy.","If someone else had asked her to rest, she would definitely not take it to heart. However, this was Ye Wangchuan. Qiao Nian obediently put the laptop on the table and reached for the water. She took a sip and relaxed her mind for a moment before casually saying, \"Guan Yan said that Nie Qingru has made a move.\"","Ye Wangchuan pulled a candy from somewhere, peeled the wrapper, and brought it to her lips with his slender fingers, saying in a bewitching tone, \"Open your mouth.\"","Qiao Nian smiled upon seeing the candy and opened her mouth to bite it. She even licked his fingertips casually.","She looked innocent just for a moment.","Ye Wangchuan’s Adam’s apple bobbed. He narrowed his eyes on the girl.","The girl was as lazy as a cat and did not even look at him. She was savoring the candy, and her voice was blurry. \"Where did you get the candy?\"","\"I bought it for you.\"","What?","Qiao Nian glanced at him in disbelief.","Considering there was a third person in the living room, Ye Wangchuan looked away from her lips and changed the topic. \"The reclusive families are indeed making a move. Are you talking about the K Organization?\"","\"You know about it?\" Guan Yan was a little surprised.","She had reduced her presence and was sneaking back to her room, but was startled by the mention of the K Organization."]},{"number":3807,"title":"Chapter 3807: Should I Get Lu Zhi’s Help?","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan did not show much emotion as he threw the candy wrapper into the trash can and wiped his fingertips with a tissue. \"They even prepared a plane. It looks like they’ll make a move in the next two days.\"","\"Today.\" Qiao Nian’s dark eyelashes hid her emotions.","When Guan Yan and Ye Wangchuan looked at her, she seemed to think of something and sneered. She leaned slightly against the sofa frivolously. \"Nie Qingru is a person of action. Since she made a commotion, it doesn’t matter if I notice her actions or not.","\"She’ll definitely act as soon as possible to prevent any accidents from happening!\"","Qiao Nian paused, seeming to be in low spirits. \"I just didn’t think of something...\"","She did not continue.","However, Ye Wangchuan immediately understood.","She did not expect Nie Qingru to go so far for Di Xicheng. Back then, Nie Qingru had given up on her biological brother without hesitation when faced with this choice.","However, this time, she chose to ’rescue’ Di Xicheng without hesitation, despite her situation still being unclear.","Qiao Nian couldn’t help but think of Ji Qing again...","\"You wanted to use this opportunity to find out more about her dealings in the illegal district. It just so happens that she came knocking on our door. It’s a good thing for us.\"","\"Indeed.\"","Qiao Nian wasn’t the type to remain sad. Even if there was unhappiness, it was only for a moment. That moment had passed.","She thought for a moment and did not hide her thoughts. She raised her head and looked at the two of them. \"I’ve long considered the fact that Nie Qingru still has some remaining forces in the K Organization. If she only mobilized these people, she shouldn’t have delayed for two to three days before taking action... I just feel that things aren’t that simple!\"","K Organization used to listen to Nie Qingru, but Lu Zhi took control of it later on.","Nie Qingru was cunning and good at scheming. It was normal for her to still have people in the organization. These people couldn’t be eliminated by Lu Zhi in a day or two.","But why did Nie Qingru take three days to make a move?","This was not Nie Qingru’s usual style.","Unless she had a backup plan.","\"If she has arranged for other people besides the K Organization... The Red Alliance is not good at armed conflict. We might not have enough manpower,\" Qiao Nian said directly.","She had always spoken her mind.","Although it was a slap in the face for the Red Alliance to say that they did not have enough manpower as one of the two major forces in the illegal district, that was indeed the truth.","The Red Alliance was not an organization that risked its members’ lives.","After all, they were a hacker alliance.","However, to cooperate with Continent F’s business, they were also involved in a portion of the diamond trade. Sometimes, they needed people to escort the goods, so they nurtured a group.","But if they really fought head-on, the Red Alliance was not confident in winning.","Nie Qingru definitely knew this, so she must be prepared.","\"Why don’t...\" Guan Yan did not want to say this. She glanced at the handsome man and then at Qiao Nian before closing her eyes and saying, \"Sun, why don’t you ask Lu Zhi for a favor?\"","Guan Yan felt a faint smile directed at her. She cursed in her heart, but she still had to explain with an apologetic smile, \"Young Master Ye, I’m not targeting you. It’s just because of the situation. Isn’t this... an emergency?\"","She said seriously, \"Tian Chen has a certain amount of power in the illegal district. We usually cooperate with them. Even if we ask them for help, it’s considered friendly help. They should agree.\""]},{"number":3808,"title":"Chapter 3808: Master Wang Is A Walking Cheat","paragraphs":["She did not say why Tian Chen would agree, the most important question, but most people in the illegal district knew—Lu Zhi was interested in Sun.","However, the two parties involved did not seem to have done anything.","Of course, Guan Yan did not have to say this out loud. That would be too... suicidal.","\"Young Master Ye, look...\" She held back her embarrassment and spoke with an awkward expression.","Ye Wangchuan glanced at her, but he had no intention of getting angry. He told the girl with a splitting headache, \"Mo Xi is in the illegal district.\"","Qiao Nian massaged her temples in surprise. \"When did he arrive?\"","\"On the night you decided to come to the illegal district to save them, I arranged for him and Ji Lin to come in batches. I also brought some people from other places.\"","He already had some power in the illegal district, but it was not as robust as in Continent F and the independent continent.","However, with Ye Wangchuan’s personality, he would not let go of the illegal district. He had been nurturing them in the dark all these years.","If not because Qiao Nian suddenly needed manpower, he might not have exposed them. However, since Qiao Nian needed them, he did not mind letting his efforts over the past few years go to waste...","\"With the people Mo Xi and Ji Lin are bringing and the Red Alliance’s manpower, even if Nie Qingru still has a backup plan, we should have enough people.\"","In other words, they did not need to trouble Lu Zhi.","Qiao Nian didn’t notice the implication. She was mainly immersed in the news that he had people in the illegal district.","Moreover, Mo Xi and Ji Lin were both here...","How many more things about Ye Wangchuan did she not know?","Qiao Nian’s temples throbbed again. She looked at him again with a hint of scrutiny in her eyes.","She felt that someone was a little too much of a bug.","After a short moment of distraction, Qiao Nian tapped her knees lightly with her knuckles and narrowed her eyes. Her exquisite face was a little arrogant. \"Then let her do it. We can uproot her power in the illegal district!\"","**","At night.","A cold wind blew in the town, and few people were on the streets. The originally desolate streets seemed shrouded in an unknown and dangerous atmosphere tonight.","Not even a shadow could be seen on the streets.","This strange atmosphere started with the setting sun, and by the time night fell, the gloom was already so heavy that it was difficult to ignore.","\"Are the people from the Red Alliance still outside?\"","\"Why do my eyelids keep twitching? Will there be an accident tonight?\"","Singh was very annoyed by the mutterings. She lowered her voice and chided them, \"Keep your voices down! Are you afraid they won’t know that we’re leaving?\"","The others had all heard from her that the reclusive families were coming to pick them up. Even if Singh wasn’t their leader, everyone tacitly agreed to listen to her commands for the time being.","Now that Singh had lost her temper, the person she scolded didn’t retort like before.","Instead, he silently rubbed his nose and endured this anger.","\"I realized that the people watching us have disappeared since this afternoon,\" someone said in a low voice.","Of course, Singh had also noticed this. That’s why she felt uneasy. However, she couldn’t show it to the others, so she deliberately turned disdainful.","\"Since Young Master Di said that the reclusive families will pick us up tonight, let’s just wait obediently and not jinx it. No matter how powerful the Red Alliance is, they’re just a hacker organization. Do you think they can eat us up?!\""]},{"number":3809,"title":"Chapter 3809: How Was It? Did You Bring Them Out?","paragraphs":["Everyone was speechless.","Singh was right. The Red Alliance was indeed just a hacker organization. However, they were in their territory, and the Red Alliance had acted so domineeringly. No matter what, they couldn’t underestimate the Red Alliance.","...","9:30 P.M.","It was already dark outside.","The December wind blew past, with no one in sight on the deserted street.","Outside the town.","The K Organization’s people had already arrived.","They first sent some people to investigate the situation on the street controlled by the Red Alliance. They originally thought it would be very troublesome to step into the other party’s territory.","Unexpectedly, the scouts returned soon.","\"Boss, there’s no one there.\"","\"No one?\"","The K Organization’s bald leader stood up from his motorcycle and looked down at his subordinate.","The lackey was as thin as a chick. Upon being sized up by his boss’s fierce gaze, he was so frightened that he shrank his neck.","\"Boss, there’s really... really no one.\"","This time, the bald man frowned, and his expression became serious. He touched his weapon, feeling uncertain. \"Didn’t that person tell us that everyone outside is from the Red Alliance? How can they not be there?\"","The lackey shook his head. \"I don’t know either, but I’ve looked around. There’s really no one outside.\"","The bald man remained silent.","He could vaguely smell danger.","He might not have felt uneasy if the other party’s people strictly guarded that street. At most, he would fight them head-on.","K Organization was not to be trifled with in the illegal district. As long as Tian Chen did not get involved, he was confident he could snatch Sun from the Red Alliance.","Even if they couldn’t rescue the people the reclusive families wanted, they could at least take Young Master Di away.","But now...","The bald man couldn’t help but become cautious. \"Watch here. I’ll make a call.\"","\"Yes, boss.\"","Dozens of people carefully watched the surroundings so tightly that not even a drop of water could pass through.","...","The bald man did not go far.","He walked to a quiet corner and called someone in Continent M.","The person on the other end was still awake. She should be waiting for news from them.","She picked up the call a second later. \"Hello, how is it? Did you get them out?\"","\"Empress.\" The bald man was careful.","Even though he knew the Empress couldn’t see him, his expression still turned fawning as he carefully said, \"We haven’t made a move yet. It’s like this... I sent my men to investigate the situation over there. The people from the Red Alliance are not around. I suspect something fishy is going on. Has the Red Alliance been tipped off...?\"","* * *","Far away on another continent.","Nie Qingru was putting on a sleeping robe after having showered. Next, she picked up a wine glass and walked to the window. Outside was the city’s night view.","From where she stood, she could see the bustling scenery of Continent M. It was as if she were stepping on this magnificent scenery.","With the glass of red wine in one hand and the phone in the other, she listened to the bald man carefully report the current tension in the illegal district.","At what he said, she only took a sip of wine and sneered. \"So what if she knows?\"","The bald man was stunned by the question. \"Empress?\"","Nie Qingru said unhurriedly, \"The illegal district is her territory. It’s normal for her to receive some news. Follow the original plan! We must evacuate the people from the illegal district tonight.\""]},{"number":3810,"title":"Chapter 3810: One Step Ahead","paragraphs":["\"But the Red Alliance might have set up an ambush...\"","Nie Qingru could tell the other party did not want to take the risk. She narrowed her eyes, revealing a dangerous vibe as she half cajoled and half threatened, \"As long as you do as I say, I naturally won’t let you suffer.\"","\"...Yes.\"","\"Also, let me remind you.\"","\"Please speak, Empress.\"","Nie Qingru ignored the flattery in the other party’s voice, and her tone gradually became fierce. \"I don’t care if the others can safely evacuate, but you have to protect my person. If my person loses a strand of hair... You know my style of doing things.\"","The families that had gone to the illegal district to capture the last survivor of the Nance Alliance had a good relationship with her in private. In the past few days, several of them had called her.","Especially the Singh family from Country Y. They asked her to find a way to save their daughter.","None of this was important to Nie Qingru.","The reason she was willing to meddle in this matter was that Di Xicheng was among them.","Otherwise, with her current entanglement with Beijing, she really could not spare time to interfere in such matters.","At most, she would give these people to that evil creature and watch coldly as that evil creature angered their families... She could even sit back and reap the benefits!","When Nie Qingru thought of this, she squeezed the wine glass and tried to suppress her uneasiness. \"Remember, I want you to bring him out at all costs!\"","\"Yes, Your Majesty.\"","\"Go on.\"","Nie Qingru put the phone down, and a determined look flashed across her eyes as she downed the red wine in one go.","She walked to the window again and looked at the night scenery, waiting for the good news!","The Red Alliance knew that it would be best if she attacked tonight. It would be best if that little wolf cub fought her head-on as arrogantly as before. This way... she could personally break this little wolf cub’s \"hand\" and let him have a taste of failure.","Nie Qingru couldn’t wait for tonight’s show to begin!","**","The illegal district.","The bald man hung up and returned to the crowd.","Everyone turned to look at him.","Someone mustered his courage and asked, \"Boss, what do you think? Are we still going to attack tonight?\"","\"Since you’re already here, what do you think?\" The bald man’s expression was ugly. It was obvious that he was not in a good mood.","No one dared to make things difficult for him. They held their breaths and listened to his orders.","The bald man put away his phone and looked up at the dark street. He felt that the road, which was so dark that they could not see the way ahead, was like a huge mouth waiting for them to walk into it.","He was not willing to take the risk.","However, the person’s attitude just now was already clear—they had to make a move tonight, no matter what!","The bald man gritted his teeth and ordered his subordinates with a cold and solemn expression, \"A small team is to go in and investigate. If there’s no problem, the rest of you will follow me.\"","He paused for a moment, then turned around and pointed to a few people before saying in a deep voice, \"The rest of you stay here to receive us. If you feel that something is wrong, immediately give us a signal flare. Do you understand?\"","The few people he called out quickly replied, \"Understood!\"","The bald man nodded. He was still not confident. He was afraid that he would be ambushed. However, he had no choice. At this point, he truly had no alternative.","He lowered his eyes and waved his hand, gesturing to move forward silently. \"Let’s go!\""]},{"number":3811,"title":"Chapter 3811: Sister Nian Shot the Signal Flare at Her Face","paragraphs":["On the top floor of an old residential building, a few kilometers away from them.","Guan Yan put down the binoculars, and a hint of interest appeared on her peach blossom-like face. She excitedly said to the girl standing before the remote telescope, \"Sun, the fish has taken the bait.\"","Qiao Nian also saw the people in night clothes entering their ambush range. She only straightened her back and pulled her baseball cap. With no expression on her exquisite face, she appeared quite lazy. \"What’s the hurry? Let’s wait a little longer. Not everyone is here yet.\"","She narrowed her eyes. \"We’ll do it after they bring out the people inside.\"","Guan Yan picked up the small binoculars again and sized them up again. She couldn’t help but click her tongue and sigh. \"I just didn’t expect them to send people over. They clearly didn’t discover our people, but they still dared to come pick them up. Aren’t they being too gutsy? Or are their brains not working well?\"","Ordinary people would become vigilant upon seeing the area suspiciously empty. They wouldn’t easily step in. However, these people did not seem afraid of death. It was really as Sun had said.","No matter what, they would make a move tonight!","Qiao Nian did not react to her chattering. She raised her eyebrows slightly, her dark eyes shining like the king of the night, as she casually stuffed her hands into her pockets and replied to Guan Yan, \"Because someone wants them to take the risk.\"","Guan Yan turned back to look at her.","Qiao Nian felt her gaze and sneered as she stood on the rooftop, surrounded by an unruly aura that was not to be trifled with. She said ambiguously, \"She thinks she’s the one with the trump card. Of course, she can’t wait to sprinkle the ’bait’ and wait for me to take it.\"","Guan Yan did not understand. \"Sun, are you talking about Nie Qingru?\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian looked into the night and did not answer her.","They waited about half an hour before finally seeing some movement from the hotel.","The people from K Organization had already met with Di Xicheng, Singh, and the others. After meeting them, they immediately turned to leave.","Through the remote-looking glass on the rooftop, Qiao Nian saw everyone leaving the hotel. Smiling, she took out a flare from her pocket.","She calmly aimed the flare at the group of people nervously retreating on the road and pulled the tab. There was a sizzling sound.","The signal flare shot straight at the people on the road like a bullet. In an instant, a dazzling light lit up the entire road, illuminating the night as bright as day!","At the same time, it also broke the balance in the darkness, allowing everyone to discover their existence!","**","The signal flare heading straight for everyone’s faces cut through the wind as it whistled over. This arrogant provocation undoubtedly attracted everyone’s attention.","\"Someone’s here!\" Singh was the first to notice her on the rooftop not far from them.","There was no need for her to point. At this moment, everyone with eyes had discovered the person on the rooftop.","Everyone immediately panicked.","\"F*ck, we’ve been ambushed!\"","\"The people from the Red Alliance really didn’t leave.\"","\"What are they trying to do!\"","The bald man looked at the chaotic crowd and tried his best to comfort them, telling them not to panic.","However, his efforts were ineffective.","These people had been trapped in the hotel for a few days and had long been mentally tortured by Qiao Nian."]},{"number":3812,"title":"Chapter 3812: Sister Nian Didn’t Find Di Xicheng","paragraphs":["In addition, these people had gathered to go after the last person of the Nance Alliance. They didn’t have a single backbone in their bodies.","Such people were prone to losing control when encountering sudden events.","At this moment, many people took out their weapons. They were so nervous that even without the Red Alliance’s help, they were already in chaos.","Singh was the calmest among them. She also held a loaded weapon, but she still knew how to help the bald man stop the panic.","Seeing that the effect was mediocre, not caring anymore, she gritted her teeth and asked the bald man, \"What should we do now?\"","The moment the bald man saw the signal flare, he regretted so easily stepping into the other party’s trap. At this moment, he could only force himself to calm down and say, \"Arrange for everyone to retreat immediately. I’ve arranged for people to receive us outside. The cars are also outside. We’ll be fine as long as we get to the cars.\"","\"Okay.\"","Singh relaxed a little upon hearing people were waiting for them outside. She couldn’t care less. She grabbed someone and explained the arrangements.","In the end, Singh loudly said, \"Those who want to leave, quickly retreat with us. Those who want to die, continue standing here foolishly and be a live target!\"","Her forehead was covered in sweat, and her clothes were drenched. Every minute and second here was incomparably long.","She was especially worried that the Red Alliance had already arranged for snipers nearby, that as long as they gave the order, Singh and the rest would become live targets.","\"Go!\" Singh gritted her teeth and shouted.","The others seemed to have suddenly found their backbone and began to retreat in an orderly manner.","* * *","On the rooftop.","Guan Yan watched as they retreated like frightened birds before smiling at the girl. \"The rest is up to the Tattoo Arm.\"","Tattoo Arm was the one who picked up Qiao Nian and the others the day they arrived at the illegal district.","Because his arms were covered in tattoos, she and Slim Waist Control privately nicknamed him Tattoo Arm.","Tattoo Arm was mainly in charge of the Red Alliance’s docking and Continent F’s diamond line.","Of course, because he was in charge of transporting diamonds, he was considered the Red Alliance’s leader of the gray area.","He was in charge of keeping these people here tonight.","\"Is he ready?\" Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes at the people gradually running away in the night.","She wasn’t sure if Di Xicheng was among them.","It was too dark.","She didn’t see that familiar face through the binoculars just now, so she couldn’t confirm Di Xicheng’s location for the time being.","Guan Yan didn’t know what Qiao Nian was thinking. She looked in the same direction and said calmly, \"Sun, don’t worry. Tattoo Arm is prepared. Our men are also lying in ambush. We’re just waiting for them to pass.\"","\"That’s good.\"","Qiao Nian did not say anything else. She walked to the side and took out her phone to contact someone.","Guan Yan looked at her cold back view. She didn’t need to follow her to know who she was calling. It must be Young Master Ye from Beijing.","They didn’t have enough manpower this time. Fortunately, Young Master Ye was already prepared. Otherwise, according to the information they had received tonight, if they had acted rashly according to her previous thoughts, they would have fallen into that old witch’s trap.","The people from the reclusive families were indeed not to be trifled with.","Guan Yan smiled confidently.","It just so happened that they were not to be trifled with either.","Then let’s see who’s tonight’s winner!"]},{"number":3813,"title":"Chapter 3813: Their People and Cars Were Gone","paragraphs":["The cold wind in the illegal district was bleak.","It was too dark.","One couldn’t even see the road ahead clearly.","The bald man also had to bring more than ten young masters and young ladies from different families to escape. The psychological pressure was huge.","They finally arrived at the rendezvous point after passing through the block.","Unexpectedly, there was not a single person in the entire square.","The people he had left behind to provide support had disappeared into thin air!","It was unknown what the bald man realized, but his expression changed drastically.","Before he could say anything, Singh anxiously walked over and questioned him, \"Didn’t you say people were waiting for us outside? Where are they?\"","The bald man opened his mouth. \"They...\"","Singh couldn’t care less. She gritted her teeth and asked, \"Forget it, let’s not talk about them. Where are the cars? You must have prepared at least one, right? Why don’t I see it?\"","Even if no one was there to receive them, they could still leave as long as they had a car.","How could the bald man not know this? Seeing that the people he had left outside had disappeared with the cars, and having been in the illegal district for so long, how could he not know what had happened?","His expression visibly deflated.","\"We’ve been... tricked!\"","\"What?\"","\"Everything was a trap the Red Alliance had prepared long ago. We fell into their trap.\" The bald man briefly told Singh how he had sent people to investigate, but did not find anyone from the Red Alliance.","This was undoubtedly a bombshell for everyone who had escaped with great difficulty.","Singh’s head buzzed, and her hands holding the weapon trembled. She became a little nervous and hysterical. \"Aren’t you from the reclusive families? Is this all you have? Think of something!\"","What kind of reclusive families were they?","The bald man was also extremely regretful.","He wouldn’t have taken this risk if not because he wanted to repay Nie Qingru’s kindness.","However, Nie Qingru’s kindness back then was not to the extent that he would exchange his life for it! Now, he wished there was a medicine for regret for him to take and turn back time.","He was definitely involved in this mess!","\"What should we do now?\" Singh was still asking him.","The bald man tried to contact Nie Qingru, but no one picked up.","\"F*ck!\" He cursed. He did not understand why the other party did not answer his call.","In this situation, they definitely could not stay here and surrender.","He clenched his teeth and waved at the rest. \"Let’s charge out!\"","There was endless darkness all around. The entire street was so quiet that it was as if no one lived here.","None of them knew what was lurking in the darkness.","However, the situation did not allow them to continue struggling. If they rushed out, they might have a chance of survival. If they stayed here, they would only become prisoners.","Singh looked at the unknown darkness, tightened her grip on the weapon, and made up her mind. \"Let’s follow!\"","Just as they all adjusted their conditions and prepared to fight to the death...","The daytime spotlights around the square lit up one after another, the dazzling light instantly shone in everyone’s eyes.","The people in the square were caught off guard by the strong light and covered their eyes with their arms.","\"F*ck, what’s going on?\"","\"Who is it?\"","After getting used to the light and dropping their arms from their eyes, they noticed a jeep in front of them."]},{"number":3814,"title":"Chapter 3814: Sister Nian: Where Is Di Xicheng?","paragraphs":["The jeep’s roof opened the skylight. A man with tattooed arms was standing at the skylight with a cigarette in his mouth and looking at them.","\"Sun invites you to the Red Alliance.\"","Arrogant, how arrogant!","The Red Alliance’s usual style of doing things!","The bald man was from the K Organization and had seen a lot of things.","This was the first time he had gone against the Red Alliance. Now, not only were his eyes illuminated by strong lights, but he was also being \"forcefully invited\" to be a guest.","He cursed under his breath and pointed his gun at the man’s temple. \"Tell Sun to come out and talk to me!\"","Tattoo Arm held the cigarette butt with one hand and stared at him with a pair of hawk-like eyes. It was as if he did not care about the gun being pointed at him.","The atmosphere was tense.","Tattoo Arm threw the cigarette butt on the ground and sneered. Then, he jumped down and stepped on the cigarette butt still emitting scarlet smoke.","He walked before everyone with his hands in his pockets. He was clearly alone, but his aura was enough to intimidate everyone.","\"You think you’re qualified to negotiate with me?\"","\"Damn!\"","The bald man spat, and his eyes turned fierce.","He was about to give it a try when, all of a sudden, countless red infrared light spots were aimed at their heads, chests, and other fatal spots.","This change came too suddenly.","But it was not surprising.","The bald man became as stiff as a rock. His fierce and unreasonable expression turned fearful. \"Where’s Sun?\"","Tattoo Arm raised his chin, gesturing for him to turn back. \"Didn’t you see the flare from before? She’s behind you.\"","The bald man only saw someone on the rooftop, but did not know it was Qiao Nian.","He jerked his head back.","Only now did he notice two people walking out of the darkness from the other end of the square. One of them was young and wearing a baseball cap. Under the light, their faces could not be seen clearly.","The other person was flirtatious and flamboyant, wearing a tight leather dress that outlined her impressive figure. She was tidying her chestnut-colored curly hair as she greeted him, \"Yo, isn’t this our Brother KT?\"","The bald man was the K Organization’s leader and was somewhat noteworthy in the illegal district.","However, when his name came out of Guan Yan’s mouth, he felt like he was being teased.","The bald man’s expression changed. Guan Yan was clearly the one who provoked him, but his gaze kept going back to the silent girl.","His eyes were filled with fear.","\"Sun, this is just work. We’re all from the illegal district. We’ll see each other often. Look...\"","Singh noticed who he was talking to and also looked over instinctively.","Originally, she had thought that the woman in the seductive outfit would be the boss, but looking at the baldie, it turned out that the girl in the sweater was Sun?","She couldn’t hide her surprise and blurted out, \"You’re Sun?\"","Guan Yan sneered. She turned to the girl and said, \"Boss, I told you you dress too plainly. Look, they don’t even believe you’re Sun.\"","Qiao Nian tugged at the brim of her cap and impatiently searched for someone among the crowd.","Due to the strong light, she could only see a group of people huddled together, but not anyone clearly.","She did not waste her breath and lowered her eyes. \"Where is Di Xicheng?\"","It was the first thing she’d said that night.","Her voice was not loud, but it was very imposing."]},{"number":3815,"title":"Chapter 3815: Signal Flare Lit Up in the Sky","paragraphs":["Everyone, including the bald man, revealed complicated expressions. Everyone looked at each other, but no one answered her question.","Qiao Nian’s heart sank at their reaction.","At this moment, signal flares lit up outside the square.","A red flare shot into the sky.","Tattoo Arm looked up and said to the girl solemnly, \"Sun, you were right. There was another group.\"","\"Mm.\"","The girl’s expression was still nonchalant, as if she was not affected. She stepped on a cement pipe, took out a lighter, and lit it, emitting a blue flame.","She glanced at the people below and said impatiently, \"I’ll give you five minutes to consider. Tell me where Di Xicheng is.","\"Of course, you can choose not to say anything.\"","She pointed at the bald man and asked casually, \"Are you their leader?\"","The bald man was caught in a spot. \"Sun, I’ve said it before. I was just asked to do something for someone. Don’t make things difficult for me.\"","He was not too flustered now.","Because Tattoo Arm did not stop him when he spoke to Qiao Nian just now, he could roughly guess the situation.","Combined with the information from the call he made to the person from the reclusive families, the Empress must have prepared a backup plan. The other group had started the attack!","This way, while the situation between them and the Red Alliance could not be considered reversed, at least he was not in so much danger right now.","He had just licked his lips and was about to negotiate with this rarely-seen leader of the Red Alliance. \"Actually, Sun, you also know the power of these people’s families. Why must the Red Alliance make things difficult for them and make enemies for themselves?","\"Why don’t we each take a step back, and you let us go? We’ll put in a good word for you. Let’s pretend that nothing happened and part on good terms.\"","Guan Yan looked at the bald man’s confident expression and laughed. Then, she teased the girl, \"Boss, he’s looking down on you.\"","Qiao Nian ignored her and said to the bald man indifferently, \"If they don’t say anything in five minutes, I’ll start with you.\"","The bald man’s face instantly turned green.","For a moment, he could not figure out how confident the girl was in dealing with the people outside.","He could only pray that the reclusive families’ people were capable enough to get rid of the Red Alliance’s people in the periphery in a few minutes.","This way, he could still count on Sun to be wary and not go too far!","**","This time, Nie Qingru had prepared two batches of people.","The bald man was just the bait she had thrown in. Her goal was to lure out Qiao Nian’s Red Alliance members lying in ambush outside.","The second batch of people she had arranged was still some distance away from the square. After confirming that the Red Alliance’s people had all appeared at the square, they began to counterattack!","In the beginning, things went smoothly. Just as the Empress had expected, the Red Alliance did not have a second plan. They were completely unprepared, and they broke through the first opening.","Then, they saw someone fire the signal flare, reminding the people inside that it was dangerous.","They did not take it to heart and mocked the Red Alliance’s people for being desperate.","So what if the people at the square knew about them? They were already in their encirclement.","As long as they continued to shrink the encirclement, the Red Alliance would be theirs sooner or later!"]},{"number":3816,"title":"Chapter 3816: Someone Not From Tian Chen","paragraphs":["After the leader resolved the first breakthrough point, he gestured for his subordinates to continue forward before reporting the good news to Continent M.","...","Continent M.","Elder Xue’s car had already arrived at Nie Qingru’s private castle. Nie Qingru changed into her home clothes before going down to welcome the esteemed guest.","The two of them sat in the living room, and the servant quickly brewed the latest black tea.","The fragrance of the black tea filled the living room. The burgundy tea leaves floated in the tea, looking very beautiful.","At this moment, Nie Qingru received a call.","When she returned, her face was filled with rare joy. She picked up her teacup and gestured to the old man in green. \"Elder Xue, let’s toast.\"","The green-robed old man looked at her in confusion.","Nie Qingru took a sip before unhurriedly saying, \"I arranged for us to do it tonight. Qiao Nian has already been tricked.","\"In less than half an hour, we will disintegrate her forces in the illegal district. Even if a few people from the Red Alliance are lucky enough to escape, they will be severely injured.\"","Her gaze was like a python, waiting for the prey to be hanged to enjoy the struggle and pain before the prey was on the verge of death.","\"Without the Red Alliance, she only has that bit of power in Continent F. She’s too inexperienced to fight me with just a weapons merchant!\"","Elder Xue’s tense expression relaxed slightly upon hearing the good news from her. He picked up the teacup and took a sip before meeting Nie Qingru’s eyes and saying gently, \"I didn’t help this time for your personal grudge. I only helped for the reclusive families’ sake... so I hope things will go smoothly.\"","\"Of course.\"","Elder Xue put down his teacup and hesitated before saying, \"If the Empress can capture Qiao Nian this time, I hope you can give her another chance.\"","He seemed regretful and sympathetic. \"Actually, she’s very talented. She’s a rare genius. I admire her very much. It would be a pity to lose her at such a young age!\"","Nie Qingru’s eyes had already turned cold. However, facing one of the three heads of the Privy Council who still supported her, she couldn’t fall out with him at this moment. She forced the corners of her mouth to curl up and said uninterestedly, \"As long as she’s willing to lower her head to me, of course I’ll give her a chance!\"","Elder Xue shook his head in his heart. He knew very well that with Qiao Nian’s personality, she would never bow down to anyone.","He knew that Nie Qingru’s words meant she would not let Qiao Nian off.","He felt a little regretful that such a young life was about to end like this. However, he only sighed before returning to his black tea. He did not speak up for Qiao Nian anymore.","In his heart, although it was a pity for the genius, the benefits of the reclusive families were above everything else.","Qiao Nian’s style was too unyielding. She resembled Ji Wusun back then, and she was always going against the reclusive families... It would be a disaster if such a person stayed alive.","...","The two of them decided a person’s fate while chatting and laughing.","However, they did not know that not long after, they would receive bad news from their subordinates.","\"Boss, bad news! Our brothers on the periphery are all gone!\"","\"What’s going on?!\"","The man on the phone couldn’t care less. His scalp was numb as he looked into the darkness behind him. His throat seemed restrained.","\"It’s Tian Chen?\"","He knew that the relationship between the Red Alliance and Tian Chen was not ordinary. Tian Chen were probably the only ones who dared to interfere in this matter!","However, his subordinate denied it. \"They’re not from Tian Chen. I-I don’t know where those people came from.\""]},{"number":3817,"title":"Chapter 3817: Master Wang Strikes; Fast, Accurate, and Ruthless","paragraphs":["The man on the phone was stunned. His eyes darkened.","Not Tian Chen?","Then, who would meddle in other people’s business at this time?","His subordinate did not give him much time to think. He gritted his teeth and said anxiously, \"Boss, the other party is coming aggressively. Our brothers are about to collapse!\"","The man in the lead was also from the Xue family, but not from the main family. Instead, he was from the side branch, called Xue Qing.","Xue Qing heard his subordinate’s serious tone and felt a headache coming on. He immediately strode over. \"Let’s go take a look!\"","\"Boss, come with me.\"","His subordinate quickly brought him to the location of the accident.","**","Their encirclement expanded 10 kilometers with the town square as the center, forming a complete encirclement of the Red Alliance’s forces!","The entire plan was perfect.","They hid their whereabouts before coming. They almost did not encounter any troublesome matters during the process and progressed very smoothly.","According to the original plan, they would break through the periphery and capture everyone inside the Red Alliance.","If anyone resisted... he would be executed on the spot according to the Privy Council and the Empress’ instructions.","Everything was going smoothly. Xue Qing couldn’t understand why something had happened in the blink of an eye when he had just ended the call with Continent M.","He followed his subordinate and rushed to the scene of the accident. Only when he saw the devastation did he learn of the other party’s ferociousness.","More than 10 people were lying on the ground. They were all their men.","It was basically a one-shot kill.","The attack was fast, accurate, and ruthless.","There was no room for defense!","Xue Qing walked over and squatted down to check the breathing of the nearest man. When his fingers touched him, he noticed the man was already dead.","His face turned ashen, his expression solemn and ugly. He looked up at his subordinate and ordered, \"Tell me what happened.\"","His subordinate did not expect that their entire team would be wiped out in the blink of an eye.","If he had not been sent to deliver the news, he would have been one of the people lying dead on the ground.","Fear gripped him. Cold sweat trickled down his back and soaked his clothes. He clenched his fists and spoke, \"I... I don’t know what exactly happened. It’s just that we were preparing to shrink the encirclement when a car suddenly appeared. People came out of the car and attacked us without saying anything.","\"They were elite. They’re not simple. We didn’t have time to react and were forced to exchange fire with the other party. Boss saw that the situation was not good and asked me to look for you...","\"After that—after that, it’s what you see.\"","Their people were all gone!","Not a single one was left.","They had been dealt with quickly, accurately, and ruthlessly, and the other party had not left any traces for them to track.","They didn’t even know the other party’s identity. Where was he now?","What was this?","A game of cat and mouse?","Even though Xue Qing had seen much of the world, he was still about to explode from the other party’s cat-and-mouse-like tricks.","He suppressed the anger in his chest and gritted his teeth as he questioned the survivor. \"You said you could tell the other party’s background was not ordinary. Then you don’t know who they are?\"","The subordinate turned pale and looked at his brothers lying on the ground in a daze.","Xue Qing took a deep breath and changed his words. \"There are only a few forces in the illegal district. We’ve all seen them. The people from the K Organization are still inside, and so is the Red Alliance. If you say it’s not Tian Chen, then who are they?!\""]},{"number":3818,"title":"Chapter 3818: Things Have Turned Around, They’ve Been Played","paragraphs":["\"I-I don’t know.\" His subordinate’s face was as pale as paper. His eyes were filled with panic as he shook his head.","Xue Qing did not feel safe not knowing these people’s identities.","He couldn’t care less. He anxiously took his phone from his pocket and dialed Continent M’s number.","...","Continent M.","A call from the illegal district disturbed them before Nie Qingru and the old man could finish their black tea.","\"Looks like the matter is almost done.\" Nie Qingru smiled victoriously. She put down her teacup and picked up her phone.","\"Hello?\"","She had just answered the call.","The person on the other end told her about their encounter concisely and succinctly. In the end, he asked righteously, \"Your Majesty, we’re helping you. You did not tell us about this situation. I can’t find any information about these people. I need you to help me find out their background...","\"I have to talk to those people. We’ll double the conditions the Red Alliance gave them! Otherwise, with the current situation, we might fall into the Red Alliance’s trap.","\"We’re surrounded!\"","...","Nie Qingru could understand every word he said, but when put together, her entire understanding was reversed.","She gripped the cell phone tightly. After a long time, she squeezed out, \"What did you say?!\"","Xue Qing saw his subordinate looking for him anxiously and had a bad feeling.","He couldn’t be bothered to pretend anymore. \"I said, we’ve been played by the Red Alliance.","\"If I’m not wrong, the Red Alliance has long expected us to have a backup plan. They’ve also made two preparations. Those people are their reinforcements.","\"From the beginning, they only used the people from the K Organization as bait. They beat us at our own game to lure us out.","\"Now that they’ve achieved their goal, they’re starting to reel in the net!\"","Xue Qing gritted his teeth. \"I remember you saying that Tian Chen didn’t know about tonight’s operation and didn’t take any action. My people also said that they’re not from Tian Chen. Since their helpers aren’t from Tian Chen, they might be outsiders. I need to contact their boss and talk to him.","\"Otherwise, our Xue family’s decades of hard work in the illegal district will be gone!\"","The illegal district was not a place any Tom, Dick, or Harry could play in. The time and money they had spent nurturing so many forces were immeasurable.","This time, he had accompanied the Empress to play the game. They had kept a trump card and linked up with the entire Xue family in the illegal district.","Even the Patriarch couldn’t bear the consequences!","After this was over, the family would definitely be in chaos.","He was a strong supporter of Elder Xue, so he naturally did not want things to escalate to this point.","Most importantly, he had worked hard in the illegal district for many years to achieve his current achievements. If all these people died here today, the price would be too high!","\"Empress, I’m not joking with you. Please give me the results as soon as possible! I’ll wait for your news!\" Xue Qing hurriedly hung up before Nie Qingru could reply.","At the same time, his subordinate walked up to him."]},{"number":3819,"title":"Chapter 3819: Found It. It’s Ye Wangchuan’s People","paragraphs":["He looked like he had lost his parents and stammered, \"Boss, something happened in the southeast, too.\"","Xue Qing gritted his teeth so hard that they were about to shatter.","He seemed to see a huge net surrounding them, but the person in control of the net did not immediately catch them all.","Instead, he deliberately attacked from one way or another, toying with them, watching coldly as they ran back and forth under the net, panicking all the way!","This method of toying with people’s hearts... was the most terrifying!","...","Continent M.","Nie Qingru and the old man’s smiles gradually disappeared, and Elder Xue began to realize that something was wrong.","He couldn’t be bothered to drink tea anymore. He placed the teacup on the table, stood up, and asked her, \"Was it Xue Qing? What did he say?\"","Nie Qingru looked at him in a daze. After a long while, she replied, \"He said... Qiao Nian had long expected us to have a backup plan. We fell for it.\"","Elder Xue’s usually unflappable expression cracked a little. He held his breath and leaned forward with both hands on the table. \"We’ve deployed all the Xue family’s forces in the illegal district this time. If we fail...\"","He could not bear the consequences!","How could Nie Qingru not know he used the Xue family’s decades of foundation in the illegal district?","To teach Qiao Nian a deep lesson this time, she had also used the last of her forces in the illegal district... The Xue family couldn’t afford to lose, and neither could she.","After all, Nie Qingru was the Empress of the reclusive families. She quickly calmed down. \"Wait a moment, I’ll think of a way.\"","She remembered Xue Qing telling about Qiao Nian’s \"helper\". She couldn’t care less and called Shadow to investigate.","Shadow was very efficient.","He quickly replied.","However, his reply did not make things better.","\"Empress, it’s Ye Wangchuan’s people.","\"He transferred his men from Continent M ten days ago. We’ve been paying attention to Tian Chen and Lu Zhi’s movements, so we didn’t notice them.\"","They had always thought that the illegal district was Tian Chen’s territory.","As long as Lu Zhi didn’t interfere, Qiao Nian was fighting alone.","No one expected Ye Wangchuan to enter this fight, nor to have planned for this day when their plan had just begun.","This man was too scary.","The corners of Nie Qingru’s mouth twitched, and her face contorted uncontrollably. \"The Ji family is always so lucky! One Ji Wusun, and now Qiao Nian. Were they my nemesis in my previous life?!\"","Shadow didn’t know how to comfort her. \"Empress... It’s not the time for us to be angry. We should think about how to solve our current predicament.\"","How could Nie Qingru not know her priorities?","She took a deep breath to suppress her surging emotion and asked, \"Where’s Xicheng? Is he alright?\"","Shadow did not expect that she would still be worried about Di Xicheng’s safety at this point. Although he did not understand, he still told Nie Qingru the latest information he had.","\"Young Master Di did not leave with the others. His whereabouts are unknown.\"","His whereabouts were unknown!","Nie Qingru sucked in a breath of cold air. \"If she does anything to Xicheng, I’ll make her pay with her life!\"","Shadow had guessed she would say that and kept quiet.","Nie Qingru calmly made arrangements. \"Prepare the plane. I want to go to the illegal district immediately.\"","\"Empress?\"","Shadow did not understand why she wanted to go to the illegal district."]},{"number":3820,"title":"Chapter 3820: I’m Going to the Illegal District Personally","paragraphs":["Just the bank alone had a pile of mess that needed dealing with. The Privy Council’s archbishop was still insisting on the matter of Beijing and wanted an explanation from the Empress.","The Empress had a lot of things that needed to be dealt with.","At this critical juncture, the Empress wanted to go to the illegal district. One could imagine how the Privy Council’s people would blow up.","This was because they had failed in their plan to hurt Beijing.","Many of the reclusive families’ members were already dissatisfied with the Empress’s decision. If this continued, the Empress would not be able to keep her position.","Without waiting for him to persuade her, Nie Qingru spoke. \"I know what you want to say, but those people won’t help me save them if I don’t go.","\"Only when I put myself in danger will they be willing to put pressure on the enemy for the reclusive families’ honor.\"","\"But this way, Empress, you...\" Shadow really could not say it.","The Privy Council would definitely not let this matter rest after the Empress caused such a commotion. Those families already dissatisfied with the Empress would be even more against her.","Was the Empress going to put her position in jeopardy because of Young Master Di?","However, Nie Qingru did not waver. \"I’ve made up my mind. Prepare the plane.\"","Shadow always obeyed orders. \"Yes.\"","...","After the call, Nie Qingru told Elder Xue about her decision to personally go to the illegal district.","Although the green-robed old man cared about the Xue family’s decades of foundation in the illegal district, he still reacted strongly to Nie Qingru’s announcement. He objected without thinking.","\"No way!\"","\"Your Majesty, you can’t go.\"","He suppressed his depression and voiced his reason with a cold and solemn expression, \"I know you’re worried about the situation in the illegal district, but your safety is the most important!\"","\"I’ve already made up my mind.\" Nie Qingru waved her hand, signaling him to stop talking.","The veins on the green-robed old man’s forehead bulged. He wanted to insist, but he suppressed himself. Finally, he couldn’t help but ask, \"Empress, are you making a trip for your power in the illegal district, or for... Di Xicheng?\"","Things related to Nie Qingru back then had long become taboo.","It was just that Elder Xue had a high status and could talk about Di Xicheng.","His eyes burned as he fiercely said, \"Back then, when you faced the choice between Ji Qing and the reclusive families, you sacrificed yourself without hesitation. I’ve always admired you for this! However, you’ve disappointed me too much on Di Xicheng’s matter.\"","There were three big shots in the Privy Council.","The conservative faction controlled by Elder Xue was the only faction still clearly on her side. Logically speaking, Nie Qingru should have appeased him no matter what.","However, she knew very well that if she did not make a trip to the illegal district, Di Xicheng might very well die there.","Hence, seeing Elder Xue’s sincere attitude and intense words, her eyes flickered, but she did not answer him directly.","She only said, \"The Xue family mobilized its forces in the illegal district because of me. Now that something like this has happened, I can’t just let it go.\"","These were just empty words.","Nie Qingru smiled and patted him on the shoulder. \"I’m not just doing it for Xicheng. I’m doing it for all of us. You have to understand me.\"","Elder Xue felt the weight on his shoulder and pursed his lips without saying anything else. However, his eyes were filled with disappointment... Nie Qingru’s insistence on going to the illegal district would definitely cause a backlash from the Privy Council’s major families.","And this time, he would probably not stand up for her again."]},{"number":3821,"title":"Chapter 3821: Activating the Privy Council’s Impeachment Mechanism","paragraphs":["The news that Nie Qingru was personally going to the illegal district indeed caused a strong backlash from the reclusive families.","Several families came to the Privy Council and asked for an explanation.","Nie Qingru resolutely left. She had not discussed it with the Privy Council, only informing them before leaving. Under such circumstances, the Privy Council could only try their best to appease the major families and could not give them a reasonable explanation.","\"Bang!\"","In the council hall of the Privy Council.","Quentin, wearing a red church robe, rushed in without caring about the obstruction.","\"Archbishop.\"","\"Archbishop, you can’t enter.\"","\"Archbishop, Elder Xue and Elder Leo are discussing something inside. Please wait a moment.\"","\"Get lost!\"","Quentin ignored the person trying to stop him and pushed the door open.","...","Inside.","Elder Xue had returned from Nie Qingru’s private residence.","Luke was there too.","In addition, a few key members of the conservative and radical factions were all there. Both sides seemed to be arguing about important matters.","The two factions argued until their faces turned red.","It was at this moment that Quentin suddenly entered, attracting everyone’s attention.","\"The archbishop is here.\" Luke suppressed his anger and tried to squeeze out a smile. He stood up and politely gave up his seat to the middle-aged man.","He was the youngest.","Even the radical faction that represented the Leonard family and controlled one of the three factions of the Privy Council had to be polite to the other two in a place like the Privy Council, where seniority was important.","Luke gave up his seat, and the archbishop did not stand on ceremony.","Quentin waved away the red-robed man and sat down, turning straight to Elder Xue. \"What’s wrong with the Empress? Why did she suddenly go to the illegal district? What did you do in the illegal district?\"","In the Privy Council, he was probably the only one who could speak to Elder Xue so directly.","Faced with his merciless questioning, the green-robed old man felt a little embarrassed. He barely controlled his expression. \"It’s the Empress’s own decision to go to the illegal district. I tried to persuade her, but I couldn’t stop her.\"","\"Heh, you couldn’t stop her?\"","Quentin did not show any mercy. \"You didn’t stop her, and you want all of us to pay for her willful behavior?! I don’t know what you’re doing in the illegal district, but from the news I received, you’re also involved.\"","Elder Xue’s sore spot was hit. He was in the wrong and could not argue.","Quentin was even more certain of his guess now. \"You really got involved.\"","Elder Xue looked up and met his eyes, then said in a deep voice, \"Everything I did was for the reclusive families’ sake.\"","\"Yes, I don’t doubt this. You’ve worked hard for the reclusive families your entire life. I believe you won’t do anything to harm us.\"","Elder Xue’s expression softened and was no longer as ugly.","Quentin continued, \"But the truth is that the reclusive families have been in constant trouble since the new year. Our farce with Beijing hasn’t ended yet, and now it has shifted to the illegal district... Our neutral party has suffered so many losses. We can’t just rely on you saying ’for the sake of the family’. Don’t you think so?\"","Elder Xue massaged his swollen temples. He knew that this matter could not be resolved peacefully, so he spoke directly to the person.","\"What do you want?\"","\"I want to activate the Privy Council’s impeachment mechanism against imperial power.\"","Quentin calmly looked as everyone’s expression turned shocked. He had no intention of joking and was very determined."]},{"number":3822,"title":"Chapter 3822: This Punishment is Too Heavy","paragraphs":["\"The Empress exists to prove the reclusive families’ glory and splendor. If this Empress is not only unable to act as a good mascot, but also brings trouble and disaster to us, as one of the elders of the Privy Council, I must stand up and speak up for the families below.","\"I demand that the impeachment mechanism of the Privy Council be activated to impeach the Empress.","\"If she doesn’t know how to be a leader, she has to step down from her position.\"","He could be said to have crossed the line.","Elder Xue was shocked. However, he did not immediately object like before.","Elder Xue was silent before he said weakly, \"Impeaching the Empress is not a small matter. Let me think about it.\"","Quentin squinted at him. \"I’m not discussing this with the conservatives. If you disagree, our neutral party will initiate the impeachment procedure.\"","Elder Xue suddenly glared at him. \"You’re bent on impeaching the Empress.\"","\"Of course.\"","Quentin had always been valiant and did not hide his thoughts. He met his gaze, and sparks flew in the air.","\"She doesn’t deserve this position. She should give it up!\"","\"You...\"","Elder Xue’s heart was in a mess.","He also felt that Nie Qingru had gone too far this time by willfully placing herself in danger and forcing everyone from the reclusive families to interfere in the dispute in the illegal district.","However, impeaching the Empress was not a small matter.","Back then, Nie Qingru had made a huge sacrifice for the reclusive families, sacrificing her marriage and only daughter...","As long as these contributions were still there...","Elder Xue would feel that this punishment was too severe!","Just as he deliberated whether to speak up for Nie Qingru...","Luke, who had been silent the entire time, suddenly interrupted and looked at him apologetically. \"I agree with the archbishop’s suggestion.\"","At this point, two of the three factions of the Privy Council had stood up.","Elder Xue understood that his own opinion was no longer important. According to the Privy Council’s rule, where the minority obeyed the majority, he had no right to refuse.","He calmed down and gave Nie Qingru one last try. \"No matter what, let’s wait for the Empress to return from the illegal district.\"","\"Sure.\"","Quentin also understood that since the Empress was not in Continent M, it would be meaningless even if they immediately started the impeachment process.","He agreed readily.","Elder Xue felt a little disappointed and frustrated upon seeing that the matter had been settled just like that. It was not good to show it in front of others.","He stood up and said with a sickly voice, \"I’m not feeling well, I’ll take my leave first.\"","The conservatives stood up to see him off.","\"Elder Xue, let me accompany you.\"","\"Elder Xue, let me go call a taxi.\"","The green-robed old man did not speak the entire time. He maintained his last bit of dignity as he left the council hall.","When his back view disappeared, Luke retracted his gaze and looked at the uninvited guest who had barged in. He straightened his attitude and asked respectfully, \"Archbishop, I want to ask you something. Is it convenient?\"","\"Speak.\" Quentin stopped tidying up his robe and turned to look at him.","Luke hesitated before asking, \"Does she have anything to do with what you said about the illegal district?\""]},{"number":3823,"title":"Chapter 3823: Five Minutes Are Up","paragraphs":["Quentin didn’t answer immediately. Instead, he narrowed his eyes and said ambiguously, \"Her?\"","Pausing for a moment, Luke met his gaze. \"Sun.\"","Actually, it was Qiao Nian.","However, Qiao Nian’s name was one of the taboos in the Privy Council.","He represented the whole Leonard family and the radical faction. Some things were not convenient to say in public.","But he believed the archbishop understood what he meant.","Sure enough.","Quentin looked at him with interest and answered the question directly. \"According to the information I received, this is the case.\"","Luke understood. \"Thank you, Archbishop, for clearing my doubts.\"","\"What are you thanking me for? I’m just telling you what I know.\" Quentin tidied his clothes and waved his hand. \"Let’s go.\"","Luke watched him leave.","It wasn’t until the backs of the conservatives and Quentin had left the council hall that the radicals gathered around and began to discuss the important matter of the Empress’s impeachment.","Luke did not hear a word they said. All he could think about was what kind of conflict had happened in the illegal district to the point that someone like the Empress would make such an irrational decision...","\"I still have something on. You guys chat.\"","He pushed the crowd aside and hurriedly prepared to go back and send someone to investigate.","**","At the same time, the illegal district.","Bright red blood flowed to the ground around the bald man in the square.","He was on his knees on the plaza’s runway, his hands pressed to his chest where he’d been shot, but he couldn’t stop the blood flowing out.","The bald man’s face was as pale as paper, and he could only make puffing sounds. It was obvious that he had lost too much blood and was starting to lose his mind.","The shot was fired without warning.","Everyone in the square was stunned by the Red Alliance’s clean shot.","Previously, these people had thought that they could wait for the reclusive families to arrive, or that Qiao Nian was just scaring them with her words and would not really attack... Until they saw the bald man kneeling on the ground with his hands on his chest, bleeding all over the ground.","Only then did they understand that... Be it the Red Alliance or Qiao Nian herself, no one was joking with them!","Now, their lives were in the hands of the other party. As long as Qiao Nian gave the order, all of them might die here tonight.","Death was so close.","Singh and the others were stunned.","The people from the K Organization still knew how to grab their weapons in the tense confrontation. The people from the other families were already so frightened that their legs went weak.","They stared at the fallen bald man and the sloppy girl stepping on the cement pipe.","Qiao Nian jumped down with her hands in her pockets and landed steadily on the ground. Her dark eyes looked around at the people in the square and saw they had gone from noisy to silent.","She raised her eyebrows and said hoarsely, \"I said I would give you five minutes. It’s time now.\"","She glanced at the spasming bald man emotionlessly, then at the others. \"He lost his chance, so his chance will go to the next person.\"","Qiao Nian pulled her hand out of her pocket. Her fair fingers looked even more beautiful under the incandescent light of the square.","\"You.\"","At this moment, no one was in the mood to appreciate how beautiful this famous Sun’s hand was. They only saw the finger that determined life and death slightly curl up and point at Singh."]},{"number":3824,"title":"Chapter 3824: Di Xicheng Didn’t Leave With Others Indeed","paragraphs":["\"You have five minutes to think about it.\"","Silence.","Singh opened her mouth in shock and pointed at herself, then watched as the people around her moved away like a tide, as if afraid they would be hit in the next second.","Singh was so angry that her face alternated between green and white. Her expression kept changing. She wanted to lose her temper, but she didn’t dare to in this situation.","The bald man was still trembling on the ground after losing too much blood. He looked terrifying.","Singh clenched her fists, her nails digging into her flesh.","She did not know how much time had passed.","She could only feel her heart beating so fast that it was about to rush out of her mouth. Every second that passed felt like her life was flowing away.","Guan Yan looked at her watch and turned to Qiao Nian. \"Sun, it’s been a minute.\"","Her original intention was to ask if Singh would be as stubborn as that bald man from the K Organization and would rather eat bullets than explain anything.","Who knew that before she could say anything, Singh seemed to sense something and looked in their direction in panic. She noticed that Guan Yan had spoken. Her pupils constricted, and she looked very afraid.","\"I’ll tell you!\"","\"Uh—\" Guan Yan frowned. She vaguely felt that Singh had misunderstood something. Did she think she was telling Sun the five minutes were up?","\"I’ll speak.\"","Singh mistakenly thought that Guan Yan had said it was time. She hurriedly raised her hand to indicate she had not missed the time.","\"I’ve already agreed. Don’t mess around!\"","Qiao Nian ignored her fancy actions, crossed her arms, and narrowed her eyes. \"Tell me, where is Di Xicheng?\"","Singh gritted her teeth and said, \"He didn’t come with us.\"","Guan Yan pricked up her ears and looked a little stunned. \"What do you mean? Aren’t you together?\"","\"We were together.\" Singh was afraid that Qiao Nian wouldn’t believe her and anxiously explained, \"He refused to leave with us when the reclusive families’ people arrived. He insisted on acting alone and asked us to leave first. At that time... it was the person lying on the ground who kept urging us. He said it was dangerous outside and that we couldn’t delay any longer. We saw he wasn’t willing to leave with us, so we left him and his men behind and followed them out.\"","She did not finish her sentence, but the truth was right before her.","They had followed the people from the K Organization rashly and rushed into Qiao Nian’s trap.","On the other hand, Di Xicheng did not leave with them and was lucky enough to escape.","At this point, Singh wondered if Di Xicheng had guessed what would happen to them beforehand. That was why he was so determined not to leave.","Thinking of this, she felt a little vexed and resentful.","She looked at the legendary figure of the Red Alliance, gritted her teeth, and said firmly, \"S-Sun, if you want to find him, he’s still in that hotel!\"","Qiao Nian nodded expressionlessly, her eyes dark and deep.","Guan Yan was surprised at this unexpected situation. She narrowed her peach blossom eyes and sighed softly. \"This person still has some brains. Interesting~\"","She tilted her head and asked the girl, \"Boss, aren’t we going to find him quickly?\"","Qiao Nian smirked and turned to walk towards the hotel. \"If he’s smart, he would have escaped amidst the chaos.\"","Even so, she still wanted to take a look.","Guan Yan jumped down from the cement pipe and followed her, not forgetting to instruct the others from the Red Alliance, \"Watch them!\""]},{"number":3825,"title":"Chapter 3825: Sun, Aren’t You Going After Her?","paragraphs":["The hotel’s entrance, where the families had previously stayed, was now wide open. The lights were brightly lit, and it was unclear if anyone was inside.","Guan Yan grabbed the girl as she was about to enter and said cautiously, \"Sun, be careful. I’ll go in first.\"","\"No need.\" Qiao Nian pushed her hand away and walked straight into the hotel.","The lobby was a mess, with many abandoned luggage on the ground. Obviously, Singh hadn’t been lying. They had left in a hurry.","Qiao Nian walked further inside and looked at the stairs leading to the second floor.","If nothing went wrong, Di Xicheng would be up there.","\"I’ll go up first.\" Guan Yan took the lead this time. She pulled out her gun and nimbly loaded it before slowly walking up.","Qiao Nian couldn’t dissuade her, so she could only follow behind her.","Compared to Guan Yan’s vigilant expression, she looked relaxed, almost as if she was not afraid...","Guan Yan noticed that Qiao Nian was not the least bit afraid and sucked in a breath of cold air. However, since they still had to find that person, she couldn’t say anything at this moment.","She only signaled Qiao Nian with her eyes to be ’careful’ and get armed.","However, the girl kept her hands in her pockets, as if she did not get Guan Yan’s hint, and followed behind her as if everything was normal.","Guan Yan had no choice but to pay full attention as she went upstairs, ready to kill anyone who appeared.","There were only two short flights of stairs.","In Guan Yan’s careful steps, they took three minutes.","Finally, on the second floor, Qiao Nian realized that it was quiet.","It was just as she had expected.","Di Xicheng should have taken advantage of the chaos to escape.","\"Bang!\"","Guan Yan kicked the door open, but saw not a single soul inside.","She relaxed and turned around. \"No one.\"","Qiao Nian still had her hands in her pockets, showing no surprise at this.","\"I got it.\"","Guan Yan smashed the wall angrily. \"F*ck, I didn’t expect him to react so quickly. It’s dark outside. I wonder where he went!\"","Their biggest goal this time was to capture Di Xicheng and talk to Nie Qingru further.","Now, the secondary goal was achieved.","They were in full control of Nie Qingru and the reclusive families’ forces in the illegal district, but Di Xicheng had run away!","And he had run away under so many people’s gazes.","Guan Yan had never suffered such a defeat before. She turned around to leave. \"I’ll get Tattoo Arm and the others to chase after him!\"","\"Come back.\" Qiao Nian grabbed her arm.","Guan Yan met her gaze in confusion. \"Sun, aren’t you going to chase after him?\"","Di Xicheng would be a scourge sooner or later if left alone.","They had spent so much effort this time. They couldn’t return empty-handed.","Qiao Nian also felt like she had been played. However, she looked at the sky outside and said calmly, \"It’s almost dawn.\"","So?","Qiao Nian let go of her hand, pressed a hand between her eyebrows, and pursed her lips. \"It’s too late to chase after him now. Since he was smart enough to sense the danger early on, he must have planned his escape route. We don’t have any clues at this moment. It’s undoubtedly like looking for a needle in a haystack. A waste of time.\"","\"Then, are we letting him go just like that?\" Guan Yan raised her eyebrows."]},{"number":3826,"title":"Chapter 3826: How Does the Red Alliance Plan to Deal With Us?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian pulled down her baseball cap and rotated her aching left wrist. Frowning, she said, \"Let’s deal with the people outside first, then send another team to search the nearby mountains.\"","Di Xicheng was a smart person.","Such a smart person would not be stupid enough to go to a dangerous place like the airport or the docks at this time.","Furthermore, he wasn’t from the illegal district, so there was a high chance he wouldn’t go to places with dense crowds.","In that case, the most likely place to hide and be safe for the time being was the pitch-black mountain outside.","Guan Yan followed her gaze to the dark mountain peak. Her face twitched, and she felt a headache.","Searching the mountain was no less difficult than fishing people out of the sea last time.","Sun had already said so, she could only brace herself and arrange the subordinates.","\"I got it.\"","**","Outside.","The people from the Red Alliance began to wrap things up.","Under Guan Yan’s command, everyone carried out their duties in an orderly manner.","\"Take him away.\" Guan Yan pointed at the still-breathing bald man on the ground.","Two subordinates immediately lifted and carried him to the jeep. The vehicle turned on its headlights and quickly drove away.","Singh and the others looked at the jeep driving away, their hearts in turmoil. They couldn’t tell how the Red Alliance and Qiao Nian planned to deal with them.","They stood in the middle of the square like a group of wooden stakes and watched as the tattooed man searched the K Organization’s people and took them away, leaving them alone.","A man from Country R watched all of this with a pale face. He couldn’t help but push Singh, saying softly, \"Why don’t you ask them what they plan to do with us? They won’t want to execute us on the spot, right?\"","Singh was pushed so hard that she almost separated from the crowd. She slapped his hand away and retorted, \"You asked me to ask, why don’t you ask yourself?\"","\"You... Didn’t you talk to Sun from the Red Alliance?\" The Country R man was a little embarrassed.","Singh’s beautiful eyes widened as she sneered at him. \"You’re a man, but I don’t see you showing any spirit. You push women out when you encounter trouble. Why? Is this your country’s tradition?\"","The Country R man’s sore spot was hit. His face immediately turned red, and he raised his voice. \"We’re all on the same side. Do you have to be so harsh?!\"","\"Hehe.\" Singh did not give in and argued with him face to face. \"No matter how bad I say it, it’s not as ugly as what you did.\"","...","Not far away, someone reminded Guan Yan of the commotion.","Guan Yan looked at the noisy crowd and raised her chin speechlessly. \"What are they arguing about now?\"","The subordinate shook their head with uncertainty. \"I don’t know. I think they’re discussing Sun...\"","\"Discussing the big boss?\"","\"I think so.\"","Silence.","Guan Yan closed the tablet and casually handed it to the person beside her, then said, \"I’ll go take a look.\"","...","When she walked over, she heard Singh and a short man arguing with red faces, neither giving face to the other.","Every word was worse than the last.","If she had not come, they would have probably started fighting in the next five minutes.","Singh and the short man didn’t notice Guan Yan, but everyone else noticed the popular person always following the Red Alliance’s Sun."]},{"number":3827,"title":"Chapter 3827: We’re Not an Assassin Organization","paragraphs":["The crowd tacitly made way for her, and their expressions changed from irritation to fearful silence.","\"I just wanted you to ask.\"","\"Why don’t you ask?\"","Seeing they were still arguing, Guan Yan found a corner and crossed her arms to watch the commotion. She wanted to see how long they were going to argue.","Perhaps the atmosphere was too strange, and Singh and the man finally realized something was wrong. They temporarily stopped and paid attention to their surroundings.","Guan Yan’s appearance was outstanding, and her temperament was arrogant. It was difficult not to notice her.","Singh immediately saw Guan Yan, who had arrived at some point, and her originally pale face instantly turned as white as paper.","\"You... you...\"","At least she could maintain her dignity.","The man from Country R was so frightened that he couldn’t even speak.","Guan Yan looked at Singh and raised her chin. \"Why aren’t you arguing anymore? Continue.\"","Singh had never been humiliated like this. Her face alternated between green and red as she clenched her fists.","At least she knew she had to lower her head when under someone else’s roof. After a short moment of embarrassment, she thought of her situation and stopped being pretentious.","Their eyes met as they looked at Guan Yan. They let out a shaky breath and tried their best not to look so pathetic and ridiculous. \"How does Sun plan to deal with us?\"","\"Does our boss have to give you an explanation?\" Guan Yan smiled arrogantly.","Sadness appeared in Singh’s beautiful eyes. She gritted her teeth and asked, \"We can’t resist, anyway. Just tell us directly. Is Sun planning to... take our lives?\"","The others were in an uproar.","The atmosphere became heavier.","Guan Yan finally dropped her disrespectful attitude upon seeing that Singh still had the guts to ask her directly.","\"What are you thinking?\"","What?","\"Our Red Alliance is not an assassin organization, nor are we that perverse.\"","Singh thought for a while before realizing what she meant. Her ashen face lit up. \"You mean...\"","\"Stop, don’t look at me like that.\" Guan Yan immediately put on a resistant expression. Under the expectant gazes of Singh and the others, she continued indifferently, \"You’re involved in an old matter. Sun only looked for you to understand what happened back then. There’s a high chance that she won’t make things difficult for you...\"","Singh only felt that the tables had turned. She saw a ray of light in the desperate situation. She was so surprised she almost couldn’t believe her ears. \"Sun won’t make things difficult for us...?\"","Guan Yan looked at her in amusement. \"What did you think? That she has nothing better to do than to find trouble with you?\"","Ignoring the sarcasm in her words, Singh heaved a long sigh of relief. She felt powerless, as if she had just survived a calamity and almost couldn’t stand up.","Guan Yan didn’t forget to ask the important questions. \"By the way, do any of you know where Di Xicheng might have gone?\"","Singh looked at her in shock. \"He’s not in the room?\"","Guan Yan did not answer her question directly. She only glanced at everyone meaningfully. \"Think about it carefully. Did he mention where he wanted to go or how he planned to leave the illegal district? Whoever provides useful clues might be the first to go home.\"","Singh and the others looked at each other. For a moment, no one could think of any useful information.","Guan Yan had only come to watch the commotion. Seeing that someone was calling her name and no one was answering, she waved at them.","\"Come to me when you’ve thought it through.\""]},{"number":3828,"title":"Chapter 3828: Big Boss Lu Sends News","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian really did not intend to do anything to Singh and the others.","This was because what happened to Ji Qing had nothing to do with Singh’s generation. These people were just sent by their families to track down the Nance Alliance’s last survivors.","To put it bluntly... Singh and the others were just running errands for their families.","She wanted to declare war on the families that participated in the hunt for Ji Qing back then, but she was not the kind of person who would casually trample on lives to achieve her goal.","She would let Singh and the others return.","Of course, she also wouldn’t let them off for nothing.","Back then, Nance Alliance’s people had their families destroyed by them.","Now that the relationship between the two sides had changed, Qiao Nian would definitely ask for compensation for the innocent people implicated back then.","As for the compensation, of course, there was a debtor for every grievance.","She would only pursue the old fellows who had participated in these matters back then!","***","Guan Yan was dealing with the aftermath.","After leaving the hotel, Qiao Nian got into the jeep and, after calling Ye Wangchuan, typed a message.","She finished editing the content shortly and then sent it to a group.","The 20-million-dollar ransom message had been sent to the major families, along with an overseas bank account.","20 million USD per person was not a small sum for any family. They would have to lose a layer of skin if they wanted their people back.","Qiao Nian didn’t care how many families were in an uproar because of her group message, nor did she care if they couldn’t sleep after reading it.","After sending the message, she extracted the SIM card from her phone, crushed it, and opened the car window to throw it out.","The night breeze blew in, bringing with it the coolness of winter.","Qiao Nian’s eyes narrowed slightly, and she leaned against the seat. Before she could rest, a piano sounded in the car.","Having just closed her eyes, the girl pinched the bridge of her nose, narrowed her eyes, and fumbled for a while looking for her usual cell phone. She looked at the caller ID before casually accepting the call.","\"Shoot.\"","The person on the other end of the line did not speak. It was extremely quiet on the other end. Only the sound of static could be heard.","Just as Qiao Nian frowned and revealed an impatient expression...","The man’s deep voice finally came from the other end. \"Are you so impatient talking to me now?\"","This voice was extremely recognizable in the illegal district.","Even the smallest faction was familiar with it.","The uncrowned king of the illegal district, the boss behind Tian Chen, Lu Zhi.","A young man with crippled legs who controlled the entire illegal district.","\"Aren’t I answering your call?\" Qiao Nian suppressed her impatience and spoke casually.","Lu Zhi was used to her tone. He kept it short, \"I received news that Nie Qingru is coming.\"","\"Oh?\" This was beyond Qiao Nian’s expectations. She did not expect Nie Qingru to come looking for her in such a hurry. Could it be that Nie Qingru did not know Di Xicheng had run away?","He tried his best to ask calmly, \"What exactly did you do in the illegal district that made her throw caution to the wind and come here?\"","Qiao Nian was still thinking about the reason Nie Qingru was being so impulsive. She replied with a distracted tone, \"... It was just some private matters.\""]},{"number":3829,"title":"Chapter 3829: Nie Qingru Wants to See You","paragraphs":["Lu Zhi said ambiguously, \"This private matter almost turned the illegal district upside down tonight.\"","Qiao Nian finally regained some rationality.","...","Tian Chen’s HQ.","Lu Zhi was still in his office. At this moment, he was steering his wheelchair to the huge floor-to-ceiling window. His beautiful face was indifferent.","\"You’ve made too much noise these past few days. Many people have called to ask about you. I’ve helped you block them.\"","\"Thanks.\"","Qiao Nian had always been concise.","Lu Zhi felt upset at her nonchalant thanks. \"That’s not what I meant.\"","He held the cell phone in his other hand and looked at the crescent moon in the sky, as if thinking of that person’s face.","After a long silence, he asked, \"Do we have to talk like this?\"","The person on the other end probably caught the emotions in his words. She restrained her casual laziness and said seriously, \"No.\"","However, her response was still so short.","Lu Zhi frowned. \"I called you because I was worried about you.\"","\"Yes.\" It was quite faint, very Qiao Nian’s style.","He grabbed the armrest, causing his cold knuckles to turn white as he exerted more strength. The protruding bones were clear and distinct.","Lu Zhi couldn’t do anything to her. He didn’t know how to get along with her. After a short period of losing control of his emotions, he suppressed the discomfort in his heart.","\"Nie Qingru will definitely force the reclusive families to become your enemy.\"","He said bluntly, \"I heard you saved someone? Is that person related to Auntie?\"","...","Qiao Nian leaned against the window. Facing the night wind, her dark eyelashes drooped. \"Yes.\"","Lu Zhi reminded her coldly, \"I don’t care what you do. Listen to me. Don’t go against Nie Qingru. It’s not time yet.\"","\"I know.\"","Even if Lu Zhi didn’t explain, Qiao Nian knew what it meant for Nie Qingru to come alone at this time.","It was rare for her to go along with him. Lu Zhi’s tone softened a little. \"I’ll arrange for you to meet her when she reaches the illegal district.\"","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes. She was a little rebellious and was about to reject him.","The person on the other end seemed to foresee this and said, \"No matter what, you can talk when you see her.\"","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened. She placed her hand on the door and refused to let go.","Lu Zhi seemed to sense something. \"Don’t you have something to tell her, too?\"","Qiao Nian thought of the name list she had obtained and the people she had captured this time. She lowered her thin eyelids, and her dark eyes cleared. \"When?\"","Lu Zhi replied, \"Three in the afternoon. Can you do it?\"","\"Okay.\"","Qiao Nian agreed to the appointment and hung up.","Ye Wangchuan called right after.","Qiao Nian wanted to get out and take a breather, but she had no choice but to answer his call.","\"Hey.\"","\"Who were you on the phone with just now? It’s been so long.\" Ye Wangchuan’s voice carried the night breeze over. It had a soothing power.","Qiao Nian’s anger dissipated. She did not mention Lu Zhi and only told him the outcome. \"I want to meet Nie Qingru.\"","It was impossible for Lu Zhi not to have spoken to Nie Qingru since he had asked her out.","Nie Qingru must also want to see her.","That was why Lu Zhi asked for this meeting. He could be considered a middleman hoping to resolve this conflict."]},{"number":3830,"title":"Chapter 3830: Master Wang’s Heart Aches for Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan’s calm voice sounded. \"I was just about to tell you about this... Ji Lin just called and said there’s news from Continent M. Nie Qingru is coming to the illegal district.\"","He paused and brought new news to Qiao Nian.","\"The archbishop called me. He revealed that the Privy Council intends to start impeachment proceedings against her when she returns.","\"Nian Nian, what do you think?\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian did not answer immediately. Instead, she asked in surprise, \"The Privy Council wants to impeach her?\"","She really did not expect Nie Qingru’s visit to cause such a huge backlash from the Privy Council.","Nie Qingru wasn’t brainless. She really did not care about the consequences this time. No wonder Lu Zhi had just advised her not to have a direct conflict with Nie Qingru this time.","\"That’s the Privy Council’s current attitude.\" Ye Wangchuan didn’t comment and suddenly became gentle. \"Where are you?\"","Qiao Nian looked outside and gave him a location.","The person on the other end said in a low voice, \"Wait for me. I’ll be right there.\"","Qiao Nian’s heart skipped a beat, and then she nodded. It was as if she had found a breathing space from the countless matters.","* * *","Ye Wangchuan arrived half an hour later.","He was outstandingly tall and had long legs. He looked like a model in his black trench coat.","Singh and the others all looked at him.","\"Isn’t that the man who came to look for us the other day...\"","\"I think it’s him.\"","Guan Yan was still finishing up. Seeing Ye Wangchuan coming, she ignored the discussions around her and naturally greeted him. \"Young Master Ye.\"","\"Yes.\" Ye Wangchuan nodded in response.","Guan Yan knew he was only paying attention to her because of her boss. Thus, she pointed towards Qiao Nian.","\"Sun’s there.\"","This time, Ye Wangchuan glanced at her and said politely, \"Thank you.\"","Guan Yan retracted her gaze and handed the statistical form to the person beside her. She leaned lazily against the car and instructed the remaining people, \"Bring those people back.\"","She was talking about Singh and the others.","Her subordinate looked back and made an understanding gesture. \"Understood.\"","He quickly got to it.","Most of them were peripheral members of the Red Alliance. This was the first time they were working with a few main members.","Guan Yan was naturally the focus of their attention.","However, besides Guan Yan, the person these peripheral members paid the most attention to was the legendary figure, Sun.","The man who came out of nowhere walked straight to Sun, took a pair of gloves from his coat pocket, and put them on Sun’s hands. He even took off his scarf and wrapped it carefully around her neck... A series of intimate actions. Sun also dropped her usual coldness and cooperated with him...","The shock was so great that it broadened their horizons.","Where there were people, there would be gossip.","\"Who’s that?\"","\"I don’t know.\"","\"Look at him... Could he be Sun’s boyfriend?\"","\"Stop gossiping.\"","They whispered to one another and kept stealing glances in Qiao Nian’s direction.","Tattoo Arm walked over and heard them gossiping about Qiao Nian. He kicked them and swept his cold gaze across the crowd.","\"What are you doing? Why aren’t you working!\""]},{"number":3831,"title":"Chapter 3831: Let’s Go, I’ll Send You Back First","paragraphs":["Caught red-handed, they were so frightened that they scattered like birds, muttering, \"Work, work, everyone, disperse.\"","Tattoo Arm watched them scatter before looking in the direction they were looking. He happened to see a man and a woman standing together.","He silently retracted his gaze and turned to watch his subordinates work.","**","Ye Wangchuan put on the scarf and gloves and warmed the girl’s hands.","Only now did he speak. \"The Xue family’s power has been wiped out in one fell swoop. Mo Xi has captured their leader. His name is Xue Qing.\"","\"Conservatives.\" Qiao Nian looked up.","Ye Wangchuan lowered his eyes and rubbed her slightly cold fingertips before replying indifferently, \"It’s his people. Right now, among the three factions of the Privy Council, he’s the only one still firmly supporting Nie Qingru’s decision. I believe it was also Nie Qingru who convinced him. That’s why he joined the Xue family’s power, which has been operating in the illegal district for many years.\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian did not want to comment on Elder Xue’s actions.","When Feng Yu introduced her to the Privy Council, Elder Xue was one of the few people who helped her, even though he had not been of much help.","But their relationship had always been good.","It was not until later, when she and Nie Qingru became more and more at odds and had more and more conflicts with the reclusive families... that they did not contact each other anymore.","Qiao Nian was a sensible person.","There was no right or wrong between her and Elder Xue. They just stood on different sides.","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyelids and said nobly and lazily, \"I heard that Di Xicheng ran away.\"","Qiao Nian pulled her hand out and reached for the lighter in her pocket, but she did not take it out. She didn’t look at him. \"He didn’t come out with the main group. He must have escaped in the chaos.\"","Ye Wangchuan did not say anything. He looked at her and calmly said, \"Do you know who Nie Qingru is here for? Have you thought about how to deal with her in the afternoon?\"","Qiao Nian walked around him, picked up her cell phone from the car, and spoke arrogantly and casually, \"Just say what you want to say.\"","It was Qiao Nian’s style of doing things.","Ye Wangchuan’s thin lips curled up as a smile flashed across his eyes. He blocked her way, opened the door for her, and went to the driver’s seat. Then, he waved at the girl outside the car. \"Get in. I’ll send you back so you can catch up on sleep.\"","Qiao Nian stood outside the car looking at him. She had yet to settle the matters here, and it seemed she couldn’t leave.","Ye Wangchuan seemed to know what she was thinking. He placed his hand on the steering wheel and said calmly, \"I’ll send you back before driving over.\"","Qiao Nian frowned, her almond-shaped eyes burning. \"You’re not sleeping?\"","It was about 120 km from here to the Red Alliance’s HQ. It would take at least three hours to drive back.","By the time he sent her back and returned, the sky would already be bright.","Ye Wangchuan gestured for her to enter. \"I can sleep during the day. Get in.\"","Qiao Nian stopped being shy, entered the car, and closed the door. Before she could do anything else, Ye Wangchuan fastened her seatbelt.","\"I’ll drive you back so you can rest.\" His voice carried a dark and hoarse and carried a smile, like a breeze brushing past one’s eardrums. \"Let’s go, Goddess Qiao.\"","**","Nie Qingru’s plane landed at the airport in the illegal district at noon.","She had contacted Lu Zhi before coming.","Lu Zhi also suggested meeting and negotiating with her.","Hence, Tian Chen’s staff came to pick her up as soon as the plane landed.","\"Empress.\" Jian Jin put on a professional smile and politely opened the door. \"I’m Lu Zhi’s person. Please get in.\""]},{"number":3832,"title":"Chapter 3832: Nie Qingru Arrives in the Illegal District","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru glanced at her and recognized her as Lu Zhi’s right-hand man. She bent down coldly and got into the car.","Jian Jin could feel her disrespect and closed the door without getting angry. She walked to the front passenger seat, sat down, and instructed the chauffeur, \"To the headquarters.\"","Neither of them spoke on the way.","The main reason was that Nie Qingru had no intention of talking to Jian Jin because of her status. From the moment she got into the car, she looked coldly at the speeding scenery outside the window. Her cold and stern eyes were like proud peacocks, ignoring everyone.","Jian Jin had only been asked by Lu Zhi to pick her up. She didn’t have the hobby of sticking her face to someone’s cold butt. Seeing Nie Qingru’s arrogant attitude through the rearview mirror, she couldn’t be bothered to speak to her.","They were silent all the way to Tian Chen’s HQ before the limousine slowly stopped.","Jian Jin consciously got out of the car first and opened the door for the Empress, politely saying, \"Empress, we’ve arrived.\"","Nie Qingru got out of the car and finally spoke. \"Where’s Lu Zhi?\"","Jian Jin made a \"please\" gesture with a fake smile. \"Mr. Lu is on the 33rd floor. Please follow me.\"","They entered Tian Chen’s HQ, attracting a lot of attention.","However, with Jian Jin personally leading the way, even if Tian Chen’s people did not know Nie Qingru’s identity, they could tell she was extraordinary since she was being led in by Jian Jin.","Therefore, although everyone sized Nie Qingru up curiously, no one dared to speak.","Jian Jin led Nie Qingru up in Lu Zhi’s exclusive elevator.","This exclusive elevator went straight to the 33rd floor.","Soon, they heard a ding , and the elevator doors parted.","Jian Jin walked out first, smiled at the person inside, and led her to the right. \"Here.\"","Nie Qingru only glanced at her from the corner of her eye before following her to Lu Zhi’s office.","**","Outside the office.","Jian Jin stopped and politely knocked on the door first, then softly said to the person inside, \"CEO Lu, the Empress is here.\"","She usually called him ’Big Boss Lu’, ’Big Boss’, ’Boss’, and so on.","With outsiders around, Jian Jin knew the situation and put on the attitude an assistant should have.","\"Come in.\" A man’s voice came from inside.","Jian Jin turned around and smiled at Nie Qingru. \"Your Majesty, please.\"","After saying that, she opened the glass door and gestured for Nie Qingru to enter alone.","Nie Qingru did not say anything and walked past her into the office.","After making sure she had gone in, Jian Jin put away her business smile, closed the door, and turned to ask the assistant, \"Do we still have coffee beans?\"","\"Yes, Assistant Jian,\" the assistant quickly replied.","Jian Jin rolled up her sleeves and walked towards the rest area. \"I’ll make two cups of coffee. Send them in for me.\"","She usually would not make coffee herself unless it was for Lu Zhi. The assistant was already used to it. He nodded repeatedly to show that he understood.","Jian Jin did not mention the guest’s identity. She only reminded him, \"Don’t look around and listen when you go in. Come out quickly after delivering the coffee.\"","She had never interacted with the Empress of the reclusive families. After spending a short time with her today, Jian Jin felt this Empress was not to be trifled with.","At the very least, the other party was not an easy person to get along with.","She didn’t want her assistant to get into trouble for no reason.","The assistant nodded in understanding and quickly said, \"I understand. Don’t worry.\"","Jian Jin went to make coffee."]},{"number":3833,"title":"Chapter 3833: After All, This is the Illegal District","paragraphs":["The atmosphere in the office was not relaxed either.","Nie Qingru sat on the sofa, took off her wide hat, and placed it on the coffee table before her, revealing her arrogant face.","\"How long has it been since we last met?\"","She was old, after all, with heavy marks at the corners of her eyes. Coupled with the fact that she had been troubled these past few days, there were obvious dark circles under her eyes.","Nie Qingru was used to being stubborn. She sat with her back straight, and her sharp gaze landed on the man behind the desk, who was reading documents.","\"Tsk.\"","She sneered, her eyes filled with mockery. \"You’re willing to work for her, but it’s a pity she doesn’t like you.\"","Lu Zhi’s hand holding the fountain pen paused, drawing a mark of varying depth on the white paper.","He raised his eyes and stretched his body as he leaned against the back of the chair. A trace of sarcasm flashed across his beautiful face as he replied indifferently, \"In this aspect, you’re still my senior. Didn’t you willingly come to the illegal district for an irrelevant person?\"","Nie Qingru’s eyes immediately darkened. \"How dare you speak to me like that.\"","Lu Zhi had always been kind on the outside but ruthless on the inside. He rarely made enemies with anyone on the surface, let alone someone with a complicated background like Nie Qingru.","However, Nie Qingru’s words had crossed his bottom line.","He was not afraid of trouble.","He sat up, elegantly took a wet tissue to wipe his slender fingers with a lowered head, and replied casually, \"I don’t care about your private matters. It’s best if you don’t ask about my private matters.\"","He wiped the remaining ink off his hands before throwing the used wet tissue aside. Then, he casually raised his head and confronted the person, leaving behind a meaningful sentence.","\"After all... this is the illegal district!\"","Silence.","Nie Qingru’s expression did not look too good as she swallowed her anger.","Lu Zhi’s warning was clear. This was the illegal district, his territory. A strong dragon could not suppress a local snake.","She wasn’t afraid of Lu Zhi, but she didn’t want him to get completely involved in this matter. Otherwise, it would bring her quite a bit of trouble.","After figuring it out, Nie Qingru’s expression softened, and she said sarcastically, \"I didn’t expect you to be a romantic.\"","They were all decent people.","Even if they didn’t get along with each other, they understood what it meant to stop when it was necessary.","After finishing her sentence, Nie Qingru shut her mouth and sat on the sofa like a Bodhisattva, emitting a deterrent aura.","Lu Zhi did not harp on her words. He fiddled with the fountain pen as if there was something magical about it that attracted him. He did not respond.","Just as the first round of confrontation quieted down, there was a knock on the door.","\"CEO Lu, I’m here to deliver coffee.\" It was the assistant’s voice.","Lu Zhi raised his eyelids. He glanced at the person sitting on the sofa before saying, \"Come in.\"","The assistant pushed the door open with a tray. Remembering Jian Jin’s instructions, he kept his head lowered and did not say a word the entire time.","Only after placing the cup in front of Nie Qingru did he say, \"Please enjoy.\"","Next, he delivered the remaining cup to Lu Zhi’s desk.","The assistant knew Lu Zhi’s leg condition was an inconvenience, so he naturally placed the cup of coffee where he could reach it with his hand. \"CEO Lu, your Blue Mountain doesn’t have sugar.\"","The coffee emitted steam from the cup. Lu Zhi touched the cup with his fingers, feeling the warmth.","This temperature was a small detail that Jian Jin usually paid attention to when making his coffee. The coldness in Lu Zhi’s eyes dissipated a little, and he gently said, \"You can leave.\""]},{"number":3834,"title":"Chapter 3834: Sister Nian’s Half an Hour Late","paragraphs":["The assistant put away the tray and bowed respectfully. \"Yes, CEO Lu.\"","In the blink of an eye, only he and Nie Qingru were left in the office.","Nie Qingru picked up her coffee cup and took a sip. Her expression and actions revealed a critical expression. She only touched it for a moment before putting it back.","She looked straight at Lu Zhi. \"When is she coming?\"","Lu Zhi sipped his coffee. His nerves were relaxed, and he was a little tired as he leaned against the back of the chair. \"Didn’t I say three o’clock?\"","Nie Qingru looked at his nonchalant attitude and suppressed her anxiety. She tried her best to look less anxious as she counted the time.","**","Qiao Nian only woke up at three o’clock.","Then, she washed her face, picked up her baseball cap from the table, put it on, took her keys and cell phone, and went out.","She arrived at Tian Chen’s HQ half an hour late.","During this period, Lu Zhi only called her once. But Qiao Nian was already on the way, and she sent him a message telling him she would be there soon.","Lu Zhi did not rush her after that.","This was not her first time in Tian Chen.","Qiao Nian pushed the door open and walked in with ease. She stepped on the bright marble floor and walked straight to Lu Zhi’s exclusive elevator.","She still dressed in her usual style. It was simple and comfortable, and she was very low-key.","Hence, when she entered, the front desk did not notice her. Only when she saw Qiao Nian walking towards the exclusive elevator from the corner of her eye did she frown and turn around.","\"Did that person...\"","She was about to say, ’Did that person go to the wrong place?’","However, reality quickly slapped her. The front desk saw a girl in an ordinary baseball cap standing sideways. Her face couldn’t be seen clearly as she entered her fingerprint, and the elevator doors opened.","The girl walked into the elevator and disappeared from her view.","The front desk person’s mouth was agape as if she had seen a ghost. She pointed in the direction of the elevator and did not speak for a long time.","Her colleague noticed her abnormal behavior and patted her, asking in confusion, \"What are you doing? Why are you pointing over there?\"","At this moment, the elevator had already gone up. From their angle, they couldn’t see that any change had taken place.","Only the front desk person saw Qiao Nian enter the elevator through fingerprint verification. She grabbed her colleague’s shoulder excitedly. \"How many people have their fingerprint passwords in CEO Lu’s exclusive elevator?\"","Lu Zhi was a clean freak.","Very few people could touch his things.","Hence, he never took the same elevator as others in Tian Chen because he did not want to stay in the same small space.","Similarly, he didn’t like others using his elevator.","Everyone in Tian Chen knew that Lu Zhi’s exclusive elevator had a fingerprint password. Not everyone could use it. No one would be tactless enough to take advantage of his elevator.","\"Are you crazy?\"","\"Hurry up and tell me.\"","\"... Only CEO Lu and CEO Jian recorded fingerprints. Everyone knows, but you don’t?\"","The front desk person let go of her shoulder and said dejectedly, \"I just saw someone enter with a fingerprint password. She’s already taken the elevator up.\"","Her colleague looked at her in confusion and even touched her forehead to confirm if she had a fever. Then, she asked strangely, \"Hey, you don’t have a fever. Why are you talking nonsense?\"","\"I’m serious!\" The front desk staff grabbed her hand excitedly.","Her colleague was stunned upon seeing her excited face. She said in disbelief, \"Did someone really just go up?\"","\"Absolutely!\"","They looked at each other and saw confusion in each other’s eyes. They couldn’t guess the identity of the person who went up using CEO Lu’s private elevator."]},{"number":3835,"title":"Chapter 3835: Does an Elder Have to Wait to Meet You?","paragraphs":["Who else would have CEO Lu’s fingerprint password?","**","Above.","Qiao Nian left the elevator and walked straight to Lu Zhi’s office, bumping into Jian Jin on the way.","Jian Jin saw her coming and quickly walked over to pull her along. \"My little ancestor, you’re finally here. If you hadn’t come, I would have gone to look for you!\"","Qiao Nian was on good terms with her and did not care about the intimacy. Soon, she was pulled to the office door.","Jian Jin let go and looked into her eyes, saying in a low voice, \"I won’t go in with you. She’s been waiting for you for a long time. Big Boss Lu is with her. Hurry up and go in!\"","One of them was the Empress of the reclusive families, a legendary figure at the top of the pyramid in Continent M.","The other was Lu Zhi, one of the big bosses in the illegal district.","Either of these two would make one’s scalp tingle. They had to hold their breaths when they spoke, careful not to offend anyone.","Only QIAO had always been arrogant and unrestrained. She left the two people inside hanging for a long time, in no hurry to come.","Jian Jin knew her temper and did not nag. \"I won’t say anything else, just one sentence. I know your bad temper, so I’ll hold back a little this time. She came prepared. You’ll be at a disadvantage if you fight her head-on.\"","With that, Jian Jin put her hand on the girl’s shoulder with a guilty expression. \"You didn’t look for me this time, and I didn’t manage to help.\"","Qiao Nian glanced at her hand on her shoulder, paused, and replied casually, \"With our relationship, there’s no need to say this.\"","Jian Jin smiled. She was a straightforward person, after all, and was not good at being pretentious. She let go. \"Go. Big Boss Lu is inside. We’re all on your side.\"","Qiao Nian knew Lu Zhi wouldn’t forget their life-and-death relationship to stand on Nie Qingru’s side and make things difficult for her.","At the same time, she knew that Lu Zhi wouldn’t let Tian Chen side with her because of her dispute with Nie Qingru.","This was Lu Zhi’s personality.","She pulled down her baseball cap and opened the door with narrowed eyes.","...","In the office.","Nie Qingru had been waiting impatiently. Hearing the movement at the door, she looked over.","After a moment, someone finally entered.","Seeing the person clearly, Nie Qing immediately stood up. Her eyes were filled with unconcealed disgust as she scolded in a low voice, \"Do you know what time it is now? Why? Do your elders have to wait for you when you meet them? Is this your upbringing?!\"","Qiao Nian was scolded as soon as she entered. She couldn’t be bothered to look up and walked straight in. \"It’s all thanks to you. I had a Mom to birth me, but I didn’t have a Mom to raise me. I only have this upbringing...\"","Reaching the center of the office, she finally turned around to face the angry noblewoman. She smiled domineeringly and curled the corners of her lips. Her eyes were filled with mockery. \"Why don’t you make the dead come back to life and teach me?\"","Nie Qingru’s face was ashen, and she took a long time to recover, looking at Qiao Nian as if she wanted to tear her apart, appearing vicious and sinister.","It was just that she did not have the warmth that a grandmother should possess.","Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to argue with her and greeted Lu Zhi. \"There was a traffic jam on the way. I was a little late.\"","Lu Zhi nodded and asked her, \"What do you want to drink?\"","Qiao Nian lazily sat down opposite Nie Qingru. \"A glass of plain water.\"","Lu Zhi pulled the office line and asked someone to send it in.","Their interaction was the complete opposite of Qiao Nian’s confrontational attitude with Nie Qingru. This contrast was also a kind of provocation and rebellion against Nie Qingru.","Nie Qingru’s expression became even uglier."]},{"number":3836,"title":"Chapter 3836: Qiao Nian, What Will It Take to Let Xicheng Go?","paragraphs":["She looked at the rebellious girl opposite her and felt a surge of anger between her eyebrows.","Nie Qingru suppressed her temper and sat back down with a cold expression. Her gaze never left Qiao Nian as she asked oppressively, \"Where’s Xicheng? What did you do to him?\"","Jian Jin entered at this moment.","She walked up to Qiao Nian and handed her the glass of water. \"It’s warm.\"","Qiao Nian acted as if she did not hear Nie Qingru’s aggressive question and gently took the water from Jian Jin. \"Thank you.\"","Jian Jin smiled intimately. \"I’ll be outside. Call me if there’s anything.\"","\"Alright.\"","Qiao Nian placed the glass on the table.","Before leaving, Jian Jin glanced in Nie Qingru’s direction. Without saying anything, she silently retreated and closed the door.","Only the three of them were left in the office.","Nie Qingru’s face darkened even more upon being completely ignored. The veins on her neck bulged. It was obvious that she was trying her best to suppress her emotions.","However, her disgust, coldness, and hatred for Qiao Nian leaked out of her eyes.","She seemed to have reached the limit of her patience as she emphasized again, \"Qiao Nian, you know why I’m here. You don’t have to play dumb. My patience is limited...\"","\"You can leave.\" The girl raised her head at this moment, revealing an exquisite face under her baseball cap, far more stunning than Nie Qingru’s.","Moreover, she had a unique aura that could not be ignored—casual, as if she was not interested in anything, but so strong that it could not be ignored.","Nie Qingru frowned coldly and watched as the girl sitting opposite her slowly took a lighter from her pocket and played with it, not even giving her a look.","\"I agreed to come and see you. You’re the one begging me, not the other way around. Please figure out the situation before you talk to me.\"","Silence.","Nie Qingru had never suffered such grievances before.","Her gaze as she looked at the girl was as if she were a venomous snake, as if she wanted to tear her apart. She couldn’t even pretend otherwise!","She verbalized the disgust in the depths of her heart. \"I really should have weeded you out at the roots!\"","She regretted it.","She should have listened to the suggestions of the people around her after Ji Qing’s death and carefully investigated her interpersonal relationships.","Instead, she ended the matter hastily and let Qiao Nian grow up.","Qiao Nian listened to her vicious curse and met her gaze expressionlessly, her emotions calm and unaffected. \"You came today to say this? There’s no need. I’m tired of hearing it.\"","Nie Qingru suppressed her anger and clenched her hands, trying her best to calm down.","\"Qiao Nian, what will it take for you to let Xicheng go?\"","Smack.","The lighter in the girl’s hand lit up.","Then, she extinguished the flame with her fair hand. Her dark eyes were bottomless, as if stirring with some emotion. It was a little strange.","However, at this moment, Nie Qingru’s mind was filled with Di Xicheng’s safety. She did not notice the change in Qiao Nian’s mood and continued to harp on this topic.","\"Didn’t you capture him to threaten me? Now that I’m here, you can come at me directly if you have anything. There’s no need to implicate irrelevant people!\"","\"Are you qualified to tell me that?\"","Qiao Nian’s emotions were ignited, and she held the silver lighter higher."]},{"number":3837,"title":"Chapter 3837: Have You Ever Thought That This Day Would Come?","paragraphs":["She looked at Nie Qingru’s cold eyes and retorted, \"You’re the last person who has the right to say these words! You asked me not to implicate irrelevant people. What about yourself?\"","Nie Qingru’s eyes flickered. In the end, she was in the wrong first.","She choked for a moment, but her expression was ugly!","Seeing that she was silent, Qiao Nian became disinterested. Her aura was still vicious, but she was not as angry. She returned to her cold attitude.","\"I don’t have Di Xicheng.\"","\"You’re lying.\"","Nie Qingru clearly did not believe it and had a huge reaction.","Qiao Nian wasn’t interested in arguing with her. She picked up the water glass and took a sip. Slowly putting it down, she said with her usual expression, \"Believe it or not.\"","Seeing her like this, Nie Qingru couldn’t make up her mind and frowned sharply at Qiao Nian.","Her gaze was filled with scrutiny and deliberation.","But she did not have the blood ties and gentleness of an elder.","\"What about Xue Qing and those people? They must be in your possession.\" In the end, she did not continue to harp on the matter of Di Xicheng. Instead, she mentioned the others.","Her main purpose in coming to the illegal district this time was to find Di Xicheng. Her secondary goal was to get her people back from Qiao Nian.","The thought that Qiao Nian might let them go didn’t even cross her mind.","\"When do you plan to let them go?\" Nie Qingru asked matter-of-factly. She even narrowed her eyes to show her dissatisfaction.","Qiao Nian had probably heard the most ridiculous joke of the day. She finally looked up at her and sized her up with clear eyes. There was a strange expression on her face.","\"You... want me to let them go?\"","Nie Qingru suppressed her dissatisfaction and tried to calm down. \"Those people didn’t participate in the matter back then. They have nothing to do with your mother’s death.\"","It would have been better if she had not mentioned Ji Qing.","Qiao Nian was immediately filled with hostility and interrupted her. \"Do you think that as long as you bring this up, I’ll pretend that nothing happened on your account and turn a big matter into a small one?\"","Nie Qingru’s thoughts were exposed. Her face stiffened, and she called out in a warning tone, \"Qiao Nian.\"","However, Qiao Nian ignored her and smiled rather uninterestedly. The corners of her lips even curled up in mockery.","\"But why should I give you face? Who are you to me?\"","\"I’m your grandmother!\"","The veins on Nie Qingru’s forehead bulged. She stood up angrily and looked down at her fiercely.","\"It doesn’t matter if you admit it or not. You have my blood in your veins. The fact that I’m your grandmother will never change!\"","\"Ha.\" Qiao Nian looked at the façade of calmness that Nie Qingru could no longer maintain. She felt that it was much more pleasing to the eye.","Nie Qingru restrained her anger. \"What are you laughing at?\"","Everyone had already fallen out with each other. Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to pretend to be a snake with her. She stood up and put her hands in her pockets, facing her.","\"I’m laughing at you. When you used your own daughter’s life to exchange for your current status, did you ever think that you would grit your teeth and stand in front of me one day? That you could only rely on your status as my grandmother to suppress me and retrieve your people?\"","Without waiting for her answer, she answered for her, \"You probably never thought about it!\"","To be precise, Qiao Nian’s tone was icy-cold. It was not mocking or anything. She was just calmly narrating a fact."]},{"number":3838,"title":"Chapter 3838: Sister Nian’s Conditions Are Ruthless","paragraphs":["However, the truth in her words was like a thorn in Nie Qingru’s heart, unable to be pulled out. It inevitably reminded her of the decision she had made back then.","She stood facing Qiao Nian for a full second before pursing her lips and speaking arrogantly.","\"Ji Qing had to die.\"","She did not explain why, as if she did not think there was a need to explain her actions to Qiao Nian.","\"Even if I hadn’t done that, she would have died anyway.\"","Ji Qing had touched the interests of too many people. She was destined to die.","In the reclusive families back then, she had not climbed to her current status yet. On one hand, her daughter had to die, and on the other hand, the interests were so easily attainable.","Nie Qingru only thought about it for one night before making a decision.","She wasn’t truly emotionless. Even if she had raised a dog for 20 years, she would still have feelings for it. Moreover, in the past 20 years, Ji Qing had carefully tried to please her growing up.","If Ji Qing did not have half of that man’s bloodline, the man she hated the most, she would not have been so heartless.","But no one could change their fate.","Nie Qingru did not think that she was in the wrong. She looked at Qiao Nian calmly without any guilt. \"From your point of view, I might have been too cold-blooded. But from my point of view, I’d already tried my best to persuade her.\"","She had indeed advised Ji Qing not to continue her research. She had only mentioned it over the phone.","Ji Qing had always listened to her, but she did not agree at that time. Nie Qingru was annoyed and could not be bothered with her anymore, so she never mentioned it again.","Of course, in her eyes, she had \"tried her best\" to save Ji Qing.","From her point of view, she sacrificed a daughter who would never win her favor and whose birth only served to prove that she had been humiliated in the past, in exchange for the highest position and countless benefits.","Any normal person would do the same.","She had only made a decision that most people would make. There was really no need for Qiao Nian to harp on this matter...","\"If you want to make things difficult for me because of this, I have nothing else to say.\" Nie Qingru looked at the girl opposite her with a burning gaze, emphasizing with a hint of threat and warning, \"But you have to understand a principle: quit while you’re ahead! Otherwise, even if you think you’re climbing high, you’ll fall even harder!\"","She was referring to the fact that Qiao Nian had wiped out all the forces of the reclusive families in the illegal district...","Everyone present was smart and could hear the meaning behind her words.","Qiao Nian sneered and raised the corners of her eyes lazily. She did not take her threat seriously. \"If you want me to let them go, sure.\"","Nie Qingru thought that she had finally listened, until the girl continued.","\"50 million USD per person. If you give me the money, I’ll let them go,\" she said casually. It was unknown if she was serious.","Nie Qingru’s face darkened instantly, and she called out in a suppressed voice, \"Qiao Nian!\"","On the plane, she received a call from the families in Country Y and Country R. They said that the ransom offered by the Red Alliance was 20 million USD per person.","20 million USD was already a sky-high price.","Qiao Nian actually asked her for 50 million USD per person.","Nie Qingru’s expression was dark, just short of pointing at the girl’s nose and saying, \"You never wanted to talk to me!\"","\"You were the one who fantasized about using your face to gain benefits.\" Qiao Nian had never indulged her. After retorting, she raised her eyebrows slightly."]},{"number":3839,"title":"Chapter 3839: It Doesn’t Represent Tian Chen, Only Me","paragraphs":["She said casually, \"That’s all I have to offer. If you want them, transfer the money. I’ll send you the bank account number later.\"","Nie Qingru’s face twitched. She was so angry that she laughed.","Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to guess her thoughts. She had already stayed long enough. She picked up her things and turned around to say to the man who had been in the background for the entire process, \"I’m leaving.\"","\"So soon?\" Lu Zhi expected that the meeting wouldn’t be good, but he didn’t expect it to be so bad.","\"Mm,\" Qiao Nian replied casually, \"I’ve already set the conditions. There’s no point in talking anymore.\"","She had actually only come here to see Nie Qingru’s attitude.","Since she had already seen it, there was no need for her to stay any longer.","Lu Zhi knew her temper and did not ask her to stay. He picked up the office line and made a call. \"I’ll get Jian Jin to send you out.\"","Qiao Nian did not reject his good intentions. She paused and glanced at him. \"Thank you.\"","Her words were polite.","She usually said ’thanks’ to Jian Jin. ’Thank you’ and ’thanks’ seemed almost the same, but the emotions were completely different.","Lu Zhi felt her distance. He tightened his grip on the receiver before letting go. Then, he looked up with a forced smile. \"You don’t have to.\"","\"Okay,\" Qiao Nian replied. It was unknown if she listened.","Lu Zhi knew that it was not something that could be done in a short time to change the current distant and awkward atmosphere.","He adjusted his mood and made the call.","After a moment, he said in a clear voice, \"Ask Assistant Jian to arrange for a chauffeur.\"","\"Okay, CEO Lu.\" The assistant on the other end of the line quickly responded.","Lu Zhi put down the receiver and looked at the girl again. \"Leave the rest to me.\"","Qiao Nian did not say anything. She looked at him deeply before waving goodbye. \"I’m leaving.\"","Her back view was as unruly as ever.","Lu Zhi did not look away until her figure disappeared from the office, separated into two worlds by the glass door.","Only then did he reluctantly retract his gaze. His calm gaze landed on Nie Qingru, who was still angry. He turned his wheelchair and came forward.","\"Empress, now that things have come to this point, everyone is responsible. You can’t get all of them back from the illegal district. Why don’t you choose a few people and transfer the money to her bank account? Everyone can resolve this matter peacefully. How about that?\"","Nie Qingru’s sharp gaze landed on his face like a knife. After a while, she squeezed out, \"Is this Tian Chen’s attitude?\"","Lu Zhi avoided her gaze noncommittally. \"No, this only represents my personal suggestion!\"","They were all adults and smart people.","Lu Zhi represented Tian Chen.","When he said that he was only representing his own opinion, he was just taking into account the deep cooperative relationship between the two parties.","Since Lu Zhi had said that, it was obvious that if she and Qiao Nian had a conflict in the future, Tian Chen would take Qiao Nian’s side.","Nie Qingru’s expression grew ugly. She had been controlling her emotions for the entire afternoon, but now, she really could not control them anymore. \"Hehe, I understand!\"","She picked up her handbag and said through clenched teeth, \"... I’m leaving!\"","Lu Zhi did not mention getting someone to send her off. He sat in the wheelchair like a mountain. However, his tone sounded a little polite.","\"Then, I won’t see you out.\"","\"Hmph.\"","Nie Qing waved her hand and walked away without looking back."]},{"number":3840,"title":"Chapter 3840: Actually, Empress, Qiao Nian Doesn’t Lie","paragraphs":["Outside.","Nie Qingru did not see Qiao Nian when she went down. She had probably left already.","A black Bentley silently stopped in front of her, and right after that, the man quickly got out of the car and opened the door for her.","\"Empress, please enter.\"","The man was dressed in a suit and leather shoes. His eyes were lowered as he bent down to open the car door respectfully. He was very obedient.","\"There you are.\"","\"Yes.\"","Shadow urged her again. \"Empress, please get in the car.\"","Nie Qingru’s expression softened upon seeing him, and she entered the car.","Bam!","Shadow closed the door and went to the passenger’s seat. After closing the door, he ordered the chauffeur, \"Back to the manor.\"","Nie Qingru had a private manor in the illegal district, but it was rarely used. This time, since she personally came to the illegal district, Shadow instructed the servants to clean it in advance.","The chauffeur responded in a low voice before turning the car around and driving steadily towards Nie Qingru’s manor in Nanwan Lake...","**","On the way.","Nie Qingru pressed her temples to ease her blood pressure that had risen from Qiao Nian’s provocation, and her ugly complexion finally recovered.","She slowly opened her eyes, and her sharp gaze landed on the man in the front passenger seat through the rearview mirror.","Her voice was low as she asked, \"Have you heard anything about Xicheng?\"","Shadow turned around and replied respectfully, \"Empress, we haven’t found any news about Master Di yet.\"","Nie Qingru’s brows were tightly knitted together. She seemed to think of something, and her face turned gloomy.","Shadow observed her expression and asked tentatively, \"She didn’t say anything?\"","In this small space, it was obvious who ’she’ referred to.","Nie Qingru’s eyelids twitched, and her expression, which had just recovered, immediately darkened. \"Heh, she won’t admit it.\"","Shadow pondered for a moment. \"Empress, with Qiao Nian’s personality, if she did something, she would say it outright. If she said she didn’t do it, she didn’t do it. Since she said Master Di isn’t in her hands, the possibility of her lying is low.\"","Nie Qingru was very wary of the name ’Qiao Nian’. Hearing it, she couldn’t control her emotions and mocked harshly, \"When did you trust her so much? Don’t forget that she has Ji Wushan’s blood flowing in her veins. What credibility do people like them have?!\"","\"Yes.\"","Shadow immediately lowered his head and apologized. \"I’m sorry, Empress.\"","Nie Qingru looked at him deeply and stopped arguing with him. She only reminded him coldly, \"Be careful next time. If it were anyone else, I would have made them regret coming to this world.\"","\"I’m sorry, Empress.\" Shadow lowered his head and apologized again.","Nie Qingru’s fierce expression eased, and she no longer dwelt on this uncomfortable topic. Instead, she asked, \"How’s the matter I asked you to do?\"","\"I’ve already sent someone to do it. If there’s any news, they’ll immediately report it to me.\" Shadow returned to normal.","Nie Qingru relaxedly leaned against the backseat. Her dark eyebrows were sparse, and her eyes were cold and solemn. Her thick, oily red lips were shone upon by the sunlight from outside. The sunlight couldn’t dispel her noble aura, and it was easy for her to give off an \"unreasonable\" feeling.","\"If she wants to fight me, I’ll fight her to the end!\"","**","At the same time.","Qiao Nian was also on her way back to the Red Alliance’s HQ.","Jian Jin was driving.","They had been good friends for many years, so she did not act like a chauffeur."]},{"number":3841,"title":"Chapter 3841: I Don’t Have So Many Status Concerns Like Him. Remember to Call Me","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian’s head was lowered as she played with her cell phone, replying to messages.","Jian Jin glanced at her from time to time.","Coincidentally, they encountered a traffic light, and the car slowly stopped.","Jian Jin found a chance to talk and elbowed the girl beside her. \"Hey, I saw Big Boss Lu just now. How are the two of you?\"","Qiao Nian had just replied to Yuan Yongqin’s message. She had transferred the data report that Ye Wangchuan had stayed up late to help her organize.","At Jian Jin’s gossipy voice, having just seen Nie Qingru and quarreled with her, she was pretty tired. Thus, she did not look up. \"What do you mean?\"","Jian Jin leaned forward. \"Are you two... reconciled? What did you say to him? Didn’t Big Boss Lu say anything to you?\"","\"What do you want to say? Just say it directly.\" Qiao Nian glanced at her from the corner of her eye. Half of her face was covered by the shadow cast by the baseball cap, making her look even colder and fairer. Her appearance was outstanding.","Jian Jin was embarrassed by the question and shrank back. \"How can I say it directly... I don’t have anything to ask. I’m just curious if Big Boss Lu said anything to you.\"","She felt that Lu Zhi had not seen QIAO for more than half a year.","With such a good opportunity, even if there was an ’old third wheel’ present, a smart man would seize the opportunity to ask her out or something.","However, since this person was Lu Zhi, she wasn’t sure if he had asked QIAO out.","Qiao Nian did not understand what she meant and narrowed her eyes in confusion. \"What do you mean, ’what did he say to me’?\"","\"Alright, I understand.\"","Jian Jin instantly understood.","Lu Zhi had not said anything!","She sat back down with a pained expression. She couldn’t show it in front of Qiao Nian. Just then, the light turned green, and the cars behind began to honk, urging them to leave quickly.","Jian Jin started the car again before casually asking, \"Did your negotiation with the reclusive families collapse?\"","Qiao Nian nestled in her seat and replied lazily, \"I guess so.\"","Actually, she had never thought of talking to Nie Qingru.","Negotiations were just a pretense.","Perhaps Nie Qingru still fantasised about using her blood relationship to suppress her, but from the beginning to the end, she only wanted to meet her.","The meeting’s outcome was similar to her expectations. They had parted on bad terms... There was a high chance that they would fight head-on next.","Jian Jin stole a glance at Qiao Nian as she drove. Her expression was complicated, but she did not continue... until she stopped outside the Red Alliance’s HQ.","Jian Jin pulled the handbrake and turned to the girl who was about to get out of the car. \"QIAO, it’s meaningless to say too much. But I still have to say that we’re friends. We’re friends no matter what. Even if Big Boss Lu can’t help you because of her status, I’m not that afraid. If you need anything, just tell me. I’ll be on call, no questions asked!\"","Qiao Nian had already opened the door. Hearing what she said, her heart warmed, and her cold eyes softened. She nodded with pursed lips. \"I know.\"","Jian Jin made an \"OK\" gesture and urged her with a smile, \"Go on. Call me if you need anything.\"","Qiao Nian left the car and waved at her, gesturing for her to leave.","Jian Jin tacitly did not say anything else. She turned the steering wheel and drove back to Tian Chen."]},{"number":3842,"title":"Chapter 3842: Brother, We’re Family","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian watched as her car disappeared around the bend, then turned to enter the building.","Just as she was about to reach the bungalow, she received a call from Guan Yan.","Qiao Nian looked at the caller ID and casually accepted the call. \"Qin Si said that you’re not back yet. Where are you?\"","\"Why is he watching me all day long? I’m not his mother.\"","Guan Yan complained before changing the topic. \"By the way, I called to tell you that a friend I know in the slums is looking for me. I want to meet him. There’s a high chance I’ll eat with him and will only be back after dinner. So, I won’t be eating at home. Help me tell Young Master Ye not to make food for me tonight.\"","Since coming to the illegal district, Ye Wangchuan had been the one to settle their meals.","Of course, Guan Yan knew very well that she was just one of the extras. Young Master Ye was definitely not willing to cook for supporting characters like her.","However, no matter what, she had been eating free food for so many days. She still understood the principle of taking someone else’s food. Since she wasn’t eating dinner today, she should let him know in advance.","Qiao Nian stopped in her tracks. \"You want to see a friend?\"","This timing was too coincidental. She had to think about it.","She did not think Nie Qingru would arrange something right after they met.","However, she couldn’t help but feel uneasy.","Guan Yan was very open-minded. \"He’s an old friend. He’s reliable. You don’t have to worry.\"","Qiao Nian was silent before saying softly, \"Be careful.\"","Guan Yan agreed.","They exchanged a few more words. Guan Yan was on the way to her appointment already. She briefly told her when she would be back before hurriedly hanging up.","Qiao Nian hung up and stared at the cell phone with her dark eyes for a while. She considered the friend Guan Yan had mentioned, then stopped thinking about it.","She put her phone in her pocket and took two steps into the western-style building.","\"Sister Qiao, you’re back?\" Qin Si heard the commotion at the entrance and craned his neck to see who it was. Although he did not see who he was expecting, he still greeted Qiao Nian happily upon her return.","Qiao Nian put down the box of cakes that Jian Jin had forced on her and walked in. Besides Qin Si, she saw Tattoo Arm, Mo Xi, and Ji Lin in the living room.","They seemed to have become familiar with each other.","Tattoo Arm saw her and called out, \"Sun.\"","The others greeted her respectfully. \"Miss Qiao, you’re back.\"","Ji Lin and Qiao Nian had always been half-acquainted. Qiao Nian did not take their previous disagreement to heart, but Ji Lin had always been thinking about this and did not dare to get too close to her.","Mo Xi was much better. He was a smooth-talker, to begin with. In addition, he had sharp eyes and had never thought that Qiao Nian was ordinary.","He smiled and greeted the girl. Then, he pointed at the study and said meaningfully, \"Master Wang is on a call inside.\"","Qiao Nian happened to have something to discuss with Ye Wangchuan. She did not think too much about it and went straight to the study.","The few people outside looked at each other.","Mo Xi watched as Qiao Nian entered the study and closed the door. Then, she patted his shoulder and smiled like a fox. \"Brother, we’re family!\"","Tattoo Arm was straight. He was disgusted by the intimacy with people of the same gender. Frowning, he slapped his hand and said coolly, \"I understand.\""]},{"number":3843,"title":"Chapter 3843: Sister Nian Has Still Affected Her Mood","paragraphs":["Mo Xi didn’t mind being neglected. He smiled so widely that his eyes became slits as he pulled the other party towards the sofa while brainwashing him.","\"Look, we’re family now. You’ve been in the Red Alliance for so long, you should know something about Miss Qiao’s past.","\"Brother, let’s chat. I’ll help our boss get some information.\"","**","In the study.","Qiao Nian didn’t know that Mo Xi and Ji Lin were inquiring about her past from her subordinate.","She entered the study and saw Ye Wangchuan on a call with his back facing the door.","Qiao Nian leaned against the wall and waited for him to finish his call.","Meanwhile, she vaguely heard the words ’Beijing’ and ’return’. It was probably someone from Beijing urging him to return.","Ye Wangchuan quickly ended the call and put away his cell phone.","Turning around, he saw the girl leaning against the wall. A fleeting light flashed in his dark eyes as he walked over and stood in front of her. His lips curled into a smile. \"When did you return? I didn’t even notice...\"","Qiao Nian was used to being in close contact with him and did not feel that they were too close. She raised her chin slightly, and her gaze landed on the spot he was just at.","\"Oh, just now. I didn’t want to bother since you were on a call.\"","Ye Wangchuan saw stars in her eyes, and his eyebrows relaxed. He did not miss the hint of fatigue hidden between her eyebrows. He pushed away the black hair covering her eyes.","\"It didn’t go well?\"","His voice was pleasant to the ears.","This low voice became even more seductive, as if biting someone’s ear. The small feather fan tugged at Qiao Nian’s heartstrings.","A numbing, electric current ran through Qiao Nian’s ears. She straightened her legs slightly and changed her standing posture uncomfortably, trying to suppress the abnormality as she walked in.","\"She didn’t mean to talk to me. She just asked me to let them go.\"","After taking two steps and distancing herself from the man, she turned around and stared at him with dark, wild, and tyrannical eyes.","It was quite mocking.","\"The reason I was given was actually—she’s my grandmother. I should listen to her.\"","There was no smile in Qiao Nian’s eyes.","In fact, ever since meeting Nie Qingru, that feeling of frustration clung to her.","However, Qiao Nian was used to digesting her emotions alone and did not show it in front of Jian Jin and Guan Yan.","Mo Xi and Ji Lin also couldn’t tell.","She would only subconsciously relax in front of Ye Wangchuan. Those uncontrollable and violent emotions showed themselves now.","Qiao Nian leaned back slightly against the desk with her hands on the edge. Her eyes were so dark that they appeared to be an abyss. \"Sometimes, I wonder if everyone is like this. The Qiao Family is this way, and so is she.\"","They were used to relying on kinship to manipulate others. Regardless of right or wrong, they would always stand on the moral high ground and use their status as elders to threaten others.","If one didn’t do as they wished, they would often accuse them of being unfilial and cold-blooded.","It was as if they were the only ones wronged from beginning to end.","As long as the younger party talked back, they would always be wrong and should be nailed to the pillar of moral shame.","But why?","Nie Qingru had done one thing after another... which one of them looked like something an elder would do?","Nie Qingru didn’t even try to hide her disgust and contempt.","Just like that, she scolded her loudly, using her grandmother status to suppress her.","Qiao Nian suppressed her rebelliousness and quickly returned to normal. \"I didn’t agree to her request.\""]},{"number":3844,"title":"Chapter 3844: Nie Qingru Started Making a Move","paragraphs":["On the other side, Sotheby’s East Road.","Guan Yan’s red sports car stopped outside a vegetarian restaurant.","\"Where’s the Ping Lan private room? Take me there.\"","One of the two waiters at the door stepped forward and bowed politely. \"Are you a guest under the reservation for the Ping Lan room? Mr. Nike is already waiting for you inside.\"","\"Lead the way.\"","Guan Yan tossed the car keys to the waiter before striding in.","***","This vegetarian private restaurant was called Ting Tang, and it was very famous. Guan Yan was not a vegetarian, but had heard of this restaurant a few times.","Today was her first time here.","The decorations were elegant and focused on the collision of bright colors and quietness, with a romantic French style.","Guan Yan had always rejected such artistic things. After a few glances, she followed the waiter to the second floor.","As their backs disappeared around the corner of the wooden stairs, a man in a restaurant uniform walked out from the shadows, brought a walkie-talkie to his mouth, and said in a low voice, \"Attention, attention. The target has entered our range.\"","\"Roger that, over.\"","A similarly deep voice immediately sounded from the other side.","**","The second floor.","\"It’s here.\"","The waiter led Guan Yan to a private room and stopped outside.","Guan Yan looked up and saw the words \"Ping Lan\" written by a calligraphy expert. The strokes were like dragons and snakes, and they had a certain style.","She did not enter immediately. Instead, she raised her peach blossom eyes and sized up the corridor, inadvertently asking, \"Is your family’s business not doing well?\"","The waiter was stunned by her question and looked up in a daze. \"Huh?\"","Guan Yan raised her chin and looked around the second floor. \"Otherwise, why is it so quiet today? It’s as if the other private rooms are empty.\"","The waiter quickly lowered his head to hide his pale face and explained vaguely, \"It’s still early. It’s not mealtime yet. Many guests haven’t arrived yet.\"","Guan Yan raised her watch and looked at the time. It was four in the afternoon.","Feeling that she was overthinking, she pushed open the door and said, \"Alright, I’m going in.\"","The waiter heaved a sigh of relief after she entered. Only then did he dare to move his stiff limbs and walk out in a daze.","This was his first time doing such a thing. He didn’t know what those people wanted to do, but he was instinctively nervous and afraid.","That guest... should be fine, right?","***","Guan Yan didn’t know what the attendant was worried about.","Inside the private room, she saw a familiar figure. Guan Yan’s eyes lit up as she quickly walked up and hugged the other party.","She patted his back twice. \"How long have I been calling you to the illegal district? You’re always unwilling to leave that damned place! Seriously!\"","Guan Yan couldn’t control her joy and slapped the person again before letting go. She couldn’t hide her delight as she pulled out a chair and sat down. \"How long are you planning to stay this time?\"","There were only two other people in the private room.","One of them was the young man who hugged her. He looked gentle and weak, a typical Eastern European. He had deep eyes, a high nose, and a pair of blue eyes that appeared friendly.","The other one was slightly older, in his early fifties. His skin had a dark luster left behind by years of exposure to the wind and sun. His figure was leaner, and his age was obvious. However, his eyes were bright. With a closer look, one could tell that he was an expert."]},{"number":3845,"title":"Chapter 3845: Did You Have Something to Tell Me Just Now?","paragraphs":["The young man’s name was Nike. He was a friend Guan Yan had met in the slums of Continent B.","At that time, she was transporting a batch of goods for Daji. Along the way, she was intercepted by the local gang. Because she didn’t know the local situation beforehand, she capsized in a ditch and almost lost her life.","Injured, she ran to the slums and met Nike, who was treating an old woman.","At that time, she was in despair and asked for help. She didn’t expect that the gentle and timid man would not only help her but also treat her injuries and allow her to hide in the slums for half a month.","Later on, when she recovered and contacted Sun, they separated.","It was precisely because of this experience that Guan Yan came out at such a sensitive time to meet him.","She was still thinking about Nike and his friends refusing to leave the slums. Her peach blossom eyes were relaxed as she asked them, \"By the way, why did you suddenly come to the illegal district to look for me?\"","At this moment, there was a knock on the door.","Guan Yan frowned unhappily. \"Who is it!\"","The person outside said softly, \"Hello. I’m a waiter. I’m here to deliver drinks to you.\"","Guan Yan rubbed her glabella and suppressed her temper. \"Come in.\"","The person pushed the door open and entered.","The woman was indeed dressed as a waiter.","She came in with a tray and poured a cup of rose tea into a blue porcelain teacup for everyone.","She introduced it to the guests gently. \"This is our specialty tea. It’s made from freshly gathered roses.\"","Guan Yan ignored her introduction and looked at the other two people in the private room, mainly at Nike. \"By the way, you haven’t answered my question yet. Why did you suddenly come to the illegal district to look for me?\"","Nike had been paying attention to the waiter pouring the tea. At her question, he suddenly came back to his senses. His expression was uncontrollably complicated.","However, Guan Yan was happy that they had come to look for her and did not notice the fleeting change in his expression. She continued to look at them with relaxed trust.","Nike opened his mouth and forced a smile. His eyes flickered. \"We’re here to buy medicine and thought of asking you out for a meal.\"","\"Medicine?\" Guan Yan knew that the slums were in urgent need of medicine and would often support them. Upon hearing this, she narrowed his peach blossom eyes. \"What medicine? Give me a list. I’ll get someone to help you find them later.\"","Nike’s expression became more indescribable. His eyes moved slightly, as if he had something to say to her. However, looking at the waiter quietly pouring tea for them from the corner of his eye, he held it in. \"Okay, thank you.\"","\"We’ve been through life and death together. You don’t have to be so polite with me.\" Guan Yan also realized that he was frequently looking at the waiter.","She urged, \"It’s not done yet?\"","The woman had just finished pouring three cups of tea. She straightened her back. \"It’s ready, guest.\"","\"Mm,\" Guan Yan replied. She said indifferently, \"I don’t need you yet. Leave.\"","The waitress quietly put away the tray and sensibly left the private room. She even closed the door.","Guan Yan watched as that person left.","A pair of clear eyes landed on Nike again. She said steadily, \"Did you have something to tell me just now? There’s no one around now. Speak.\"","Nike’s heart skipped a beat. He didn’t expect her to be so sharp. She had accurately captured his emotions in that fleeting moment."]},{"number":3846,"title":"Chapter 3846: Sister Qiao, Can You Help Me Contact Guan Yan?","paragraphs":["His back was stiff, and he did not dare to look Guan Yan in the eye. He held the teacup with both hands and forced an expression.","\"It’s not easy for us to meet. Let’s drink first.\"","Guan Yan could tell he was acting a little strange today. She stared at him for a while, but felt it was not good to treat her friend with such a scrutinizing gaze.","Hence, she relaxed and clinked teacups with Nike and the silent man with a smile. \"Cheers to friendship!\"","She downed her drink with alacrity.","Nike didn’t have time to stop her before she drank the flower tea.","He looked at Guan Yan, who was defenseless against them, and suddenly pursed his lips. He looked up and said, \"Guan Yan, I’m sorry.\"","Guan Yan had yet to react.","What sorry?","The next thing she knew, her stomach was on fire. That was not the worst part of it. Her vision began to spin, and dizziness washed over her.","Guan Yan’s expression changed slightly as she realized this was an ambush.","She suddenly propped herself on the table, wanting to stand up.","But it was too late.","The other party had made up his mind to succeed in one go. He had used the most powerful antiperspirant drug on the market against her. As long as she drank it, there would be no exception.","Guan Yan was helpless as she sank into darkness, feeling weak all over.","\"Uncle Dumb,\" Nike called.","The 50-year-old dark-skinned man caught the fallen woman and turned to him. He opened his mouth, but could only communicate through mouthing words.","What he asked was: [What do we do next?]","Pain, conflict, and regret flashed in Nike’s blue eyes, but it was too late.","There were surveillance cameras in this private room. Everything that happened inside was under someone else’s control. When Guan Yan finished her tea and collapsed...","There was already a knock on the door.","It was the voices of those people.","\"Hello, can the guest come in?\"","**","In the evening.","Knock knock.","Qin Si knocked on Qiao Nian’s door.","\"Sister Qiao, can I come in?\"","\"Come in.\"","The girl inside had just received the ransom list from her subordinates.","Among them, the Singh family was the most sensible and concerned about Singh’s safety. They were the first to transfer the money to the Red Alliance’s overseas account.","A few more also transferred money over. The total amount had already exceeded ten figures.","Ten figures was not a small sum.","Qiao Nian propped her legs up and leaned against the desk chair, casually composing a message for them to release the people according to the names on this list.","After sending the message, she anonymously transferred the huge sum of money into the Children’s Charity Foundation’s account in Continent F.","Behind this charity foundation was a welfare organization for children operated by a few weapons forces led by David and Cage.","Because of the few big bosses behind it, the foundation’s financial flow was clean, with few people embezzling money.","Qiao Nian sent the money and received a message notification. She opened it and saw that the staff of the foundation was asking for her name.","She did not reply and deleted the message.","She looked up and saw Qin Si standing a step away from her. His face was conflicted, as if he had something to say to her, but he could not say it.","Qiao Nian’s temples throbbed. She silently turned off the phone screen and took the initiative to break the silence. \"Why are you looking for me?\"","Qin Si stole a glance at her. He did not joke around like usual, saying things like \"If I look for you for no reason, Master Wang will send me to Continent F to mine.\"","Instead, he hesitated before solemnly asking, \"Sister Qiao, can you help me contact Guan Yan?\""]},{"number":3847,"title":"Chapter 3847: No One Picked Up","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian clearly did not understand.","Qin Si took a deep breath and couldn’t care less about his face. \"I haven’t been able to contact her since this afternoon. I’m a little worried.\"","Qiao Nian reached for her phone on the desk, saying, \"She called me this afternoon saying she was going to see a friend...\"","Qin Si nodded anxiously. \"I know. I just have an indescribable feeling, and my heart is beating very fast. I’m afraid she’ll find it annoying if I contact her, so...\"","\"I’ll try sending her a message.\"","Qiao Nian stopped nagging and sent a message to Guan Yan.","Five minutes passed.","There was no response on her WeChat.","Qin Si was still waiting in the room.","Qiao Nian thought for a moment, got up, walked to the window, and dialed Guan Yan’s number.","Beep...","As soon as she made the call, there was the sound of an electric current being connected.","At this moment, Qiao Nian had yet to notice that something was wrong. She had one hand in her pocket, coolly waiting for Guan Yan to pick up the call.","\"Beep beep beep...\"","The phone rang a dozen times, but no one picked up.","Qiao Nian frowned slightly. Her eyes darkened as she thought of something, and her expression turned cold.","\"Sorry, the number you have dialed is temporarily unavailable. Please try again later.\" The call was not picked up, and a mechanical female voice sounded.","Qiao Nian hung up. Frowning, she pursed her red lips into a straight line and looked at the screen without blinking.","Qin Si sensed the abnormality in her expression and immediately walked over. \"What’s wrong? Sister Qiao, you can’t get through?\"","\"Mm.\" Qiao Nian calmed down and called again. \"Don’t be anxious. I’ll try again. She might not have noticed it just now.\"","Qin Si looked at her without blinking.","A minute passed.","The same thing happened. \"Sorry, the number you have dialed is temporarily unavailable...\"","This time, Qiao Nian hung up without listening. She walked past Qin Si and strode out. \"Something might have happened to Guan Yan.\"","**","Downstairs.","Mo Xi was preparing a hotpot. Ji Lin was also called in to help.","Tattoo Arm was more familiar with the illegal district. Thus, he was sent out to buy drinks and some of the spicy hotpot ingredients that were harder to find.","The simmering soup emitted a rich fragrance, and the warm orange light in the living room was gentle and warm...","When Qiao Nian came down, Ye Wangchuan was on the sofa on a call.","He had a laptop on his lap and was holding a video conference. His bangs were combed back slightly to reveal his smooth forehead.","It was rare to see him wearing a pair of rimless gold-rimmed glasses. As his eyes moved, he looked unrestrained and noble. He looked like a refined scum.","Qiao Nian heard him speaking fluently in Country Y’s language. His pronunciation was standard, and he was lazily leaning against the cushion.","Perhaps noticing her coming down, he looked up from the corner of his eye and smiled as he said something to the person on the other end of the video call.","Qiao Nian looked as he hung up, took off his earpiece, and asked, \"Why are you down? It’s not dinner time yet.\"","Mo Xi also came out wearing strange plastic gloves. He greeted her with a smile. \"Miss Qiao, we’re not done yet. Have a seat. Ji Lin and I will call you when we’re done.\""]},{"number":3848,"title":"Chapter 3848: Something Happened to Guan Yan","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian rubbed her temples, walked over, and said in a low voice, \"Something might have happened to Guan Yan. I can’t contact her.\"","The smile in Ye Wangchuan’s deep eyes disappeared. He frowned and said in a serious tone, \"What happened?\"","Qiao Nian sat down and, ignoring Qin Si, who had followed her, said, \"She called me this afternoon saying that a friend was coming and she was going to meet him.\"","Ye Wangchuan did not say anything. His furrowed brows represented his attitude.","Guan Yan was a little impulsive to meet her friend at such a time!","Qiao Nian also knew that Guan Yan was too rash. She rubbed her eyebrows and blamed herself. \"She told me she has known this friend for a long time and is reliable. I thought that since she’s so smart, I didn’t need to send anyone to accompany her.","\"I should have gone with her.\"","Ye Wangchuan picked up the phone on the coffee table. \"It’s useless to talk about this now. The most important thing is to find out where she went, who she met, and where she is now.\"","\"Mm.\"","Qiao Nian suppressed the gloominess in her eyes and gradually calmed down.","\"I’ll look into it.\"","She got up, intending to go upstairs.","Ye Wangchuan stood up and walked with her. \"I’ll go with you.\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian stopped and looked back at him, but didn’t say anything.","Passing by Qin Si, Qiao Nian noticed his anxiety. She stopped and pursed her lips to comfort him. \"Don’t worry, I’ll definitely find her.\"","Qin Si forced a smile. \"Alright, I believe you.\"","Qiao Nian patted his shoulder and tilted her head to look into Ye Wangchuan’s deep eyes. She could barely suppress the surliness in her gaze. \"Let’s go.\"","Qin Si watched them leave. He did not stay idle. He immediately returned to his room to call his parents in Beijing.","Madam Qin was still having afternoon tea with her best friend outside. It was rare for her son to call her.","She smiled and said to her friends before accepting the call. \"Isn’t this my busy son? Why are you calling me?\"","Qin Si ignored her sarcasm and paced around the room. \"Mom, how many people do we have in the illegal district?\"","\"Why are you asking this?\" Madam Qin frowned slightly.","Everyone looked at her curiously.","She apologized to everyone, got up, and hurried to find a quiet corner to speak.","\"Did something happen over there?\"","Immediately, Madam Qin felt that something was wrong. \"Isn’t Young Master Ye with you? What could have happened to you? Where’s Young Master Ye?\"","Qin Si took a deep breath and cut her off. \"Mom, just tell me how many people our family has in the illegal district. Give me their contact number. I have a use for them.\"","\"You brat, do you know what you’re talking about? It’s easy for you to ask me for people. Your grandfather has to discuss this with the rest of the family before he can make a decision. If you want me to give you the number right away, how can I...\"","Although Madam Qin complained that he was insensible, she was still worried. \"What happened to you? Why are you in such a hurry?\"","Her son had a sloppy personality. Madam Qin knew this well. Now that he was urgently asking for help...","It would be a lie to say that she wasn’t worried.","\"Tell me what the matter is first so I can help you convey it to your grandfather,\" she said patiently."]},{"number":3849,"title":"Chapter 3849: Find a Doctor to Take a Look at Her, Don’t Let Her Die","paragraphs":["Qin Si felt deeply helpless for the first time.","As he listened to his mother’s repeated questions, he finally understood why his two good friends were passionate about cultivating their own forces in their teens.","At that time, he only knew how to play.","Anyway, with their family background, they could play for the rest of their lives.","Now, he understood why Ye Wangchuan and Bo Jingxing stopped playing.","It was too late for him to come to his senses now that he needed his own people.","Qin Si briefly explained Guan Yan’s matter. He did not mention the complicated relationship between Qiao Nian and Nie Qingru and only talked about himself.","Madam Qin was silent for a long time before saying, \"Qin Si, you should know the family’s requirements for you. That girl is not suitable to be our daughter-in-law.\"","\"Mom!\"","Qin Si’s scalp went numb, and his head buzzed. He subconsciously interrupted, \"I’ve decided on her!\"","Madam Qin did not want to argue with him over the phone. After a while, she quietly said, \"I can’t make the decision on this matter. I have to tell your grandfather. I’m going to look for him now. Wait for my news.\"","\"I can’t wait—\"","Qin Si heard the busy tone before he could finish speaking.","His mother had already hung up.","He stared at the phone with throbbing temples, and the string in his brain was tightly clenched, as if it would snap in the next second.","He did not intend to sit back and wait.","Since the Qin family’s path was not feasible, he immediately called Bo Jingxing and roughly explained the situation, then asked if the other party could help him.","Bo Jingxing quickly sent the contact information of his people in the illegal district.","Qin Si called the other party and arranged a meeting place. Then, he casually took a coat from the closet and rushed out.","He didn’t know where Guan Yan was, but his intuition told him that Nie Qingru was behind it.","He didn’t have that many connections, so he could only use the clumsiest method to investigate.","**","At the same time.","Nie Qingru was in the underground prison of her private manor in the illegal district. A beautiful woman was strung with metal chains and hung on a wooden scaffold.","Her head was lowered, her curly chestnut hair falling limply over her shoulders, with blood snaking down her feet.","She remained silent.","The Nie family’s secret guard had already used all the methods. Even when Guan Yan fainted from the pain, they couldn’t pry open her mouth to hear anything related to Qiao Nian.","He watched as the woman tilted her head and lost consciousness again.","The secret guard, an unyielding man, couldn’t help but speak up for her. \"Lord Shadow, her body can’t endure any more torture. Otherwise, I’m afraid she will die before the morning arrives.\"","Shadow frowned and looked at the woman hanging on the torture rack. He did not expect her to be so stubborn. She would rather die than betray Qiao Nian.","In the shocking silence, the secret guard finally heard him relent.","\"Get a doctor to take a look at her. Don’t let her die.\"","\"Yes.\"","The secret guard heaved a sigh of relief and nimbly threw away the torture device before running out to look for the doctor.","Shadow’s malicious gaze examined the unconscious woman for a while. In the end, afraid that Qiao Nian would go crazy, he did not dare to torture Guan Yan to death.","Only when he left did the tightly bound woman slowly open her eyes. Her peach blossom eyes were clear, and she did not look like she had \"fainted\" at all. F*ck, she was actually pretending just now."]},{"number":3850,"title":"Chapter 3850: Would Rather Die Than Betray Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Guan Yan’s entire body was in pain, and her pierced scapula almost took half her life. Cold sweat dripped down her forehead, and her pale lips did not let out a single word of begging for mercy.","She looked at the empty underground prison and listened to the wet and cold sound of water dripping. A fishy taste rose in her throat.","She gritted her teeth and spat out a mouthful of black blood.","Guan Yan’s hands hung above her head, and she couldn’t wipe away the blood at the corner of her mouth. She moved his neck uncomfortably and said hoarsely, \"Tsk, I’m really unlucky.\"","She did not expect Nike and Uncle Dumb to betray her.","The person who had risked his life to save her seemed like a different person. He even tampered with her tea.","Guan Yan had mixed feelings.","She could roughly guess why Nie Qingru could order them around.","Nie Qingru must have used the people in the slums to threaten them into setting up a trap for her in the illegal district.","She didn’t hate Nike for making the choice. However, she just could not forgive him.","As long as they contacted her and told her about it, she could think of a way to help solve the problem.","However, neither Nike nor Uncle Dumb did that. At the critical moment, they only believed in themselves and not her.","Guan Yan recalled once falling in love with that person. She smiled bitterly, glad about not telling the other party about her feelings. Otherwise, she would definitely look even more pitiful now.","Her smile tugged at her wound. Guan Yan grimaced and moved, trying to survey her surroundings.","There was only one dim light in the dark cell. The light bulb was covered in dust, and the light it shone on was gray.","She could only see what was happening within ten meters of her.","There were leaks and spider webs everywhere. It was obvious that it had not been used for a long time. In front of her was a row of ghastly torture tools, some of which were covered in blood.","These were the torture tools she had just experienced.","Nothing else could be seen.","Guan Yan smiled bitterly upon seeing this. She didn’t know if this was considered a rare \"use of waste\" by the reclusive families and Nie Qingru.","However, it was obvious that her current situation was too miserable, and she was not qualified to care about these things.","**","It was completely dark outside.","Shadow came out of the dark cell and went to his room to shower. After changing into clean clothes, he went to the manor to find his master.","At this moment, someone happened to come out.","The two sides met.","The man lowered his eyes and greeted him fearfully, \"Lord Shadow.\"","\"Mm.\"","Shadow walked past him and went straight in.","***","This manor had been idle for a long time. The decorations were all in the extravagant European-style palace style according to Nie Qingru’s preferences.","The huge crystal chandelier in the middle of the living room hung down layer by layer. Under the light, it reflected a glorious beauty. It was the gorgeous and decadent style that Nie Qingru had always liked.","Shadow stepped on the cold marble floor and walked closer. He saw the woman, who was always domineering, sitting on the European-style sofa, pressing her temples with her eyes closed.","There was undisguised fatigue on her face.","Shadow’s heart skipped a beat. He quickly lowered his head and shouted, \"Empress, I’m here.\"","The person on the sofa did not react.","\"Empress?\"","Nie Qingru was old, and it was inevitable that she was in low spirits. Coupled with the fact that she had been worried sick about Beijing and Di Xicheng recently, she had visibly aged a lot."]},{"number":3851,"title":"Chapter 3851: Empress, Do You Want to Take a Medicine","paragraphs":["If it were before, she would have noticed the moment Shadow approached, but this time, only when Shadow called her did she realize that someone was approaching.","Nie Qingru opened her eyes and tried to suppress her fatigue. There was only shrewdness in her eyes. \"Did she say it?\"","\"She didn’t spill a word about Qiao Nian. About herself, she answered what she was asked.\" Shadow frowned and concluded, \"... She’s a tough nut to crack.\"","\"Of course I know she’s hard to deal with!\" Nie Qingru could not suppress her temper. She stood up with a cold aura and stared at him. \"Why did we spend so much effort to capture her?\"","Shadow lowered his head.","Nie Qingru heaved a sigh of relief. \"Didn’t we capture her to get the wolf cub’s weakness out of her? And also news about Xicheng!\"","Shadow lowered his head and did not say a word.","Nie Qingru paced in frustration, then stopped and said, \"You told me these two things, but you didn’t get any answers. Have you thought about what the wolf cub will do when she finds out we’ve taken her people away?\"","Shadow raised his head and looked into her eyes, then said guiltily, \"I’m sorry, Empress. I was incompetent.\"","Nie Qingru: \"I don’t want to hear this!\"","Shadow said, \"We’ve tried all the punishments we can use on her, but she just won’t say anything. If we continue, she might die, so I...\"","He did not finish his sentence.","Nie Qingru was a smart person and could tell what he was implying.","Her heart grew exceptionally irritable.","\"Heh, she would rather die than betray Qiao Nian? What benefits did that evil creature give them that her subordinates are willing to die for her?\"","Shadow replied, \"Guan Yan is one of the main members of the Red Alliance. Her relationship with her is not something ordinary people can compare to...\"","Nie Qingru’s face turned even uglier as she looked at him in contempt.","\"She doesn’t want to say... I’m sorry, Empress.\" Shadow immediately stopped what he was about to say. He placed his hands in front of him and lowered his head respectfully.","Nie Qingru’s expression softened, and her snake-like eyes narrowed. \"It doesn’t matter if she doesn’t say anything. We still have Plan B.\"","Unless absolutely necessary, Nie Qingru did not want to use the backup plan.","Guan Yan refused to explain anything, forcing her to take the risk and choose the most risky way to find Di Xicheng and force Qiao Nian to let him go...","Shadow seemed to want to persuade her.","Nie Qingru saw it.","However, she rarely wavered upon deciding on something. She simply pretended not to see it. Her face was cold and solemn, and her eyes were sharp as she said, \"Go and make arrangements.\"","\"...Yes.\"","Shadow knew what she meant by Plan B. Seeing that Nie Qingru had made up her mind, he knew it was useless to persuade her, so he decided to do his best.","Nie Qingru pressed a hand against her temple. Her head was heavy and her feet were light. She said tiredly, \"Go.\"","Shadow could tell her old ailment was acting up. He hesitated before taking a bottle from his pocket, pouring out a small white pill, and handing it to her.","\"Empress, take a pill.\"","Nie Qingru opened her eyes and saw the white pill in his palm. Disgust and annoyance flashed across her eyes.","None of this could compare to the pain in her head.","She did not resist for long. She grabbed the pill and put it in her mouth. Then, she swallowed with it black tea.","Nie Qingru did not know what to do with the medicine, but a few minutes after taking it, she clearly felt that the stubborn migraine had been relieved to a certain extent."]},{"number":3852,"title":"Chapter 3852: The Old Demoness is Used to Kicking Someone to the Curb When They’ve Outlived Their Usefulness.","paragraphs":["She closed her eyes, not wanting to mention the owner of the small pill. She waved her hand and said, \"Go do your work!\"","\"Yes, I’m leaving, Empress.\"","Shadow knew better than to poke her and left obediently.","**","Qiao Nian was still investigating where Guan Yan had gone missing.","She quickly found the trajectory of the sports car through Guan Yan’s license plate number. Finally, she found that her target was a vegetarian private restaurant called Ting Tang.","Qiao Nian did not stay for a moment longer and brought her people there.","***","Eight in the evening.","It was the evening peak.","As one of the top private restaurants in the illegal district, Ting Tang’s business had always been excellent.","The parking lot was crowded with luxury cars.","Many well-known figures in the illegal district were having dinner here tonight. It was a lively scene.","However, all of the liveliness was broken when seven or eight jeeps roared to a stop outside.","Ting Tang’s doorman could be considered to have seen the world. Seeing seven or eight jeeps rumbling to a stop in front of the restaurant, he realized the danger.","He said to his companion, \"Hurry and inform the manager.\"","He adjusted his facial expression, squeezed out a smile, and quickly walked towards the jeeps blocking the door.","\"How many guests will be dining?\"","The leading jeep’s window rolled down, revealing a young and beautiful face. The girl turned her head, and her dark eyes landed on him.","The waiter’s heartbeat accelerated as if it was about to jump out of his chest. He felt dizzy, and his voice tightened. \"... Uh. I’m sorry, guests. Do you have a reservation?\"","Qiao Nian glanced at him before retracting her gaze. She was shrouded in shadows, and her emotions could not be seen clearly. He only heard her sloppy and cold order, \"Enter and search.\"","\"Yes, Sun.\"","A few jeeps behind her opened their doors at the same time, and a dozen burly men jumped out.","The leader had tattoos all over his body. His facial features were handsome and mature. He was in his thirties, and his buzz cut with only a little green hair was especially iconic.","He did not say much and waved his hand. \"Go in!\"","The waiter wanted to stop them. He was so anxious that his mouth was blistering. \"Hey! Hey! You can’t go in. This is Ting Tang!\"","The dozen or so burly men ignored him and walked past him into Ting Tang.","However, the girl leaned against the driver’s seat with one arm and lazily said, \"What about Ting Tang?\"","The waiter was attracted by her voice. He swallowed his saliva, not knowing why he was so nervous. He instinctively replied, \"You don’t know who the boss behind Ting Tang is?\"","\"Who is it?\"","The waiter couldn’t figure out if she was pretending or not. He calmed down and said, \"That person from Tian Chen!\"","\"Oh.\"","He originally thought that as long as he mentioned that person’s name, he would scare her half to death. At the very least, she would be stunned for half a day.","However, with the girl’s long eyelashes covering her eyes, her red lips curled up into a rather casual arc.","\"I’m scared.\"","Silence.","She said she was scared.","Yet there was no trace of fear on her face.","The waiter even caught her arrogance, but it was definitely not ’fear’!","Qiao Nian was also direct. She touched the lighter in her pocket and propped her face on her hand. Then, she raised the corners of her eyes and said softly, \"Then, please tell the big boss behind Ting Tang that I’m definitely going to smash this place tonight!\""]},{"number":3853,"title":"Chapter 3853: Tell Lu Zhi That I’m Smashing His Place","paragraphs":["8:30 P.M.","The guests eating in Ting Tang were chased out of one private room after another.","Those who could book a private room here were all famous people in the illegal district. Many people came tonight to discuss business or to host friends.","Their dinner was ruined, and they lost face on such an occasion. All of them were furious and called the waiter over, making a fuss about wanting to see the boss.","Ting Tang’s waiter had never seen such a scene. He could only comfort them and move the guests to a safe area outside for now.","\"She said she wants to ruin tonight’s event? Who’s so arrogant? I want to see who she is!\"","\"Today, I must teach her a lesson and let her know there’s always someone better!\"","Several offended big bosses walked out of Ting Tang angrily. Under the waiter’s guidance, they saw the girl sitting in the jeep.","Their anger was instantly stoked, and they were completely stifled.","The man who had been cursing to teach the troublemaker a lesson also shut his mouth, looking like he had seen a ghost.","\"Why is this big boss here?\"","\"Hasn’t she always kept a low profile?\"","He couldn’t say anything, but he was already showing his fear. His aggressive aura automatically weakened.","Some people who didn’t know Qiao Nian stood at Ting Tang’s door with their arms crossed.","\"I heard that the boss behind Ting Tang has a powerful background. Who is this person? How dare she cause trouble like this? Is she tired of living?!\"","People who knew her identity were immediately called out to him.","\"Shut up. Keep quiet. Be careful not to implicate everyone!\"","...","From time to time, whispers came from the noisy crowd at Ting Tang’s door, mixed with the keywords \"Sun\" and \"Red Alliance\".","Qiao Nian acted as if she did not hear them. She had no intention of getting off the jeep.","Tattoo Arm and the others quickly searched Ting Tang.","They did not look good when they came out.","Tattoo Arm walked to the jeep and reported, \"Sun, Sister Guan Yan isn’t inside.\"","Then, he pushed the chick-like man forward and said coldly, \"This is the manager. He should know what happened.\"","Qiao Nian’s perverse gaze landed on Ting Tang’s manager, and she asked emotionlessly, \"A woman came to your shop this afternoon? She was wearing a brown leather dress and had curly chestnut hair. She’s beautiful, around her mid-twenties.\"","\"I... I don’t remember.\" The Ting Tang manager’s forehead was covered in sweat. He was terrified and guilty, not daring to look Qiao Nian in the eye.","\"Oh, really?\"","Qiao Nian casually turned her wrist, and a mini pistol appeared in her fair hand. The black muzzle was aimed at the manager’s head.","The man was so frightened that the hair on his back stood on end.","Before he could speak, the girl frowned slightly, as if she found it quite boring. The gun moved away from his head and pointed down, as if she wanted to let him off.","The manager’s pale face had just improved when the girl fired at his feet.","BANG!","She did not even use a muffler.","Everyone’s gaze was attracted to the gunshot sound. They saw a flash of fire from the muzzle and heard the Ting Tang manager’s scream.","Whether they knew Qiao Nian or did not recognize her, they were all stunned."]},{"number":3854,"title":"Chapter 3854: Sister Nian: Find a Portrait Artist","paragraphs":["The Red Alliance had always kept a low profile.","Although they were also in the diamond business with Continent F and had to transport goods sometimes, they were considered newbies in the illegal district, where everyone was evil.","Over the years, the people in the illegal district had rarely heard of the Red Alliance attacking anyone.","It wasn’t until now that they saw with their own eyes how Qiao Nian shot without saying a word. Her methods were fierce and not inferior to Tian Chen’s Lu Zhi.","After Qiao Nian fired the shot, she did not even look at the smoking muzzle. Her gaze landed on the man hugging his legs and screaming.","Her expression was indifferent.","\"I’ll ask again. Did you see my person come to your place this afternoon? Who did she meet? What happened?\"","\"Ow—\" The manager was in so much pain that he almost fainted. His mind was buzzing, and the huge panic supported him in hearing the girl’s voice clearly.","\"I’m only going to give you one chance to tell me what you know. Understand?\"","He could only nod crazily. \"U-Understood.\"","If Qiao Nian had not fired that shot, he might have used his powerful social skills to stall for time and wait for the boss to come and settle the dispute.","However, Qiao Nian shot him without any warning just now. He didn’t dare to have any more fantasies and bet his life.","This time, the manager cooperated and briefly explained what had happened in the afternoon. After a long time, he sobbed, \"They’re our boss’s friends. They’re just borrowing the venue from us.","\"At first, we didn’t know what they wanted to do. It wasn’t until we saw the person you mentioned enter the private room, and then they took her away with the excuse that she was ’drunk’, that we roughly guessed what had happened.","\"We didn’t want to cause trouble, so we didn’t stop it.\"","He explained anxiously, \"But this has nothing to do with us! Those people came by themselves. They didn’t allow us to interfere with the entire process... Our waiter just led your friend there.\"","Qiao Nian put away the gun without looking away. Then, her cold gaze landed on Tattoo Arm, and she gave him a look. \"Find a portrait artist to draw the appearance and characteristics of those people according to his description.\"","\"Okay.\"","He grabbed the manager and carried him into Ting Tang like carrying a chick.","...","The news of Qiao Nian smashing Ting Tang’s venue spread like a whirlwind.","There were so many guests outside Ting Tang, and everyone had personally experienced it. They saw with their own eyes how she ordered someone to take the manager away without giving him face.","The illegal district was destined to be sleepless tonight.","Large and small forces were restless. Everyone was asking Lu Zhi’s opinion on this matter. Would Tian Chen and the Red Alliance fall out because of Qiao Nian’s arrogant behavior this time?","The battle between the two top factions in the illegal district would definitely be earth-shattering. They also wanted to follow the story and see if they could pick up any benefits.","However, to everyone’s disappointment, Tian Chen did not do anything even after two hours. It was so quiet that it was as if Lu Zhi didn’t know what had happened at Ting Tang.","Because Lu Zhi did not do anything, Qiao Nian didn’t have to say anything, and none of the guests brought out by Tattoo Arm and the others dared to leave.","The scene at Ting Tang became odd.","A row of jeeps blocked Ting Tang’s entrance, and the guests in their fancy clothes and leather shoes stood shivering in the cold wind, but no one left.","Everyone looked at the only person who did not get out of the car, their eyes almost piercing through her.","They were counting on this big boss to leave quickly."]},{"number":3855,"title":"Chapter 3855: That’s Right, It’s Your Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian placed one hand on the open window and replied to the message on her phone with the other. Her facial features were cold in the night.","Finally, the portrait artist hired by Tattoo Arm drew a few portraits according to Manager Ting Tang’s instructions and brought them to Qiao Nian. \"Sun, the portraits you wanted.\"","Qiao Nian turned off her cell phone and took the thin pieces of paper from him. She lowered her eyes and flipped through them one by one until she saw a portrait of a man with a mole on the left side of his face. She pursed her lips and licked her dry lips with a rather surly expression.","She pulled out this portrait. \"...Take this person to him for confirmation.\"","\"Okay.\" Without another word, Tattoo Arm started back.","Qiao Nian did not stay idle, either. She took photos of the other portraits, took out her laptop from the backpack in the front passenger seat, and opened it on her lap.","Then, she connected to the data cable and imported the photos she had just taken into the computer.","Qiao Nian opened Tian Chen’s data section and implanted the Trojan Horse. Her fair fingers flew across the keyboard, and a series of codes poured out from her fingertips.","It took her less than ten minutes to conquer Tian Chen’s so-called \"Iron Wall\" defense system. She guided a few portraits in and screened them.","She had face blindness.","It was difficult for her to remember an ordinary person’s appearance. Unless they had something unique about them, she wouldn’t have an impression of them.","The man with a mole on the left side of his face belonged to the category of people with unique looks.","Qiao Nian wasn’t sure if she remembered wrongly, but if not, she remembered seeing this person beside Lu Zhi.","He was one of Tian Chen’s people...","**","At the same time.","Tian Chen’s HQ.","As the master of the hacker world, it was definitely not a problem for Qiao Nian to break through Tian Chen’s defense system.","Tian Chen didn’t raise freeloaders, either.","Even though the advanced information engineers couldn’t stop this hacker from cutting through Tian Chen’s defense system, they were stronger than the average person.","At the very least, they realized within a minute that someone was touching Tian Chen’s data and had successfully hacked in to implant the Trojan Horse.","The manager of the Information Engineering Department rushed straight to the 33rd floor and entered the office.","\"CEO Lu.\"","He saw another person in the office. Upon taking a closer look, he immediately greeted her respectfully, \"Assistant Jian.\"","In Lu Zhi’s office on the 33rd floor of the headquarters, apart from himself, Jian Jin was also inside. The atmosphere was strange.","They looked as if they had had a heated argument.","If it were in the past, the manager would have immediately turned around and left.","But now, he couldn’t care less.","He braced himself and met Lu Zhi’s cold and indifferent gaze. \"CEO Lu, a hacker broke into our information system. I think... I think it’s Sun.\"","They had interacted with the Red Alliance countless times.","All these years, the two organizations were as close as friends. The Information Engineering Department, led by him, often cooperated with Slim Waist Control from the Red Alliance to do code competitions with them.","He had some understanding of the Red Alliance’s main members’ standards.","Although Guan Yan, Slim Waist Control, and the others were superb, they were not invincible.","Only one person in the Red Alliance was a god-like figure in his eyes. Her level was unfathomable. Only that person could ignore his obstruction code and take down Tian Chen’s data area in ten minutes...","The Red Alliance’s Sun!","But didn’t Sun have a close relationship with their boss? Why did she do this?"]},{"number":3856,"title":"Chapter 3856: Do You Still Remember Your Original Intention?","paragraphs":["\"She suddenly attacked our data component 10 minutes ago. I don’t know what she’s doing.\" The manager of the Information Department reported the situation methodically.","Jian Jin’s expression turned ugly, and she immediately looked at the man sitting behind the wide desk.","Lu Zhi frowned and said in a deep voice, \"I understand.\"","The department manager did not understand what he meant. \"CEO Lu, are you going to contact Sun?\"","Lu Zhi placed his hands on the black desk, making his cold, white skin look shocking. No one could tell what he was thinking. They only heard his cold voice, \"Leave.\"","The department manager’s heart skipped a beat. Even though he did not understand what Lu Zhi was thinking, he could feel that the atmosphere at this moment was abnormal.","He bade farewell to Jian Jin haltingly and left the office.","When he disappeared, Jian Jin faced Lu Zhi again. \"QIAO has already fallen out with Nie Qingru. We can’t stay neutral forever.\"","Lu Zhi’s temples tightened as he looked up. \"I’m not only representing myself, but I’m also responsible for Tian Chen.\"","Furious, Jian Jin waved her hand excitedly. \"I don’t understand! In the past, we could risk our lives for each other. Why are we afraid to do anything now that we’ve become better? Then what’s the point of us gritting our teeth and risking our lives to get to where we are now?\"","Qiao Nian had returned to Rao City.","Back then, she and Lu Zhi stayed in the illegal district and went through a lot to achieve the current Tian Chen step by step.","She also cherished Tian Chen.","But were these more important than Qiao Nian?","She would always remember her original intention—for her friends to live a better life and not be controlled by others.","That was why they created Tian Chen.","Jian Jin looked at him sadly. \"Do you remember your original intention?\"","Lu Zhi’s thin lips were pursed into a straight line. His gaze met hers, and the air was shockingly silent.","Jian Jin suddenly lost interest in this confrontation and turned her head away first. \"I know you’re smarter than me. I’m stupid, so I follow whatever you say. But it’s different this time. You’re carrying the fate of thousands of people in Tian Chen. You can’t make the decision. I’m different. I’m just a small assistant. I can’t represent others, only myself.\"","She turned to look at Lu Zhi again. Her eyes were as determined as if she had returned to her childhood. \"I only remember that it was QIAO who dug me out of the pile of dead people back then. She was so hungry that she almost ran out of strength, and even fed me the only food she had on her. If she hadn’t saved me, I wouldn’t be alive now and wouldn’t have become the Jian Jin I am today. I owe her my life!\"","To be precise, she owed more than just a life.","Back then, Qiao Nian had dug her out of the pile of dead people and brought her not only life, but also spiritual salvation.","After that, Qiao Nian also taught her martial arts. She trained her body again and again to ensure that she would not be defeated and eliminated by those mercenaries.","At that time, they faced the possibility of death every day.","Once they lost, they would die.","She had never been a strong person. Every night, she hid under the blanket and cried secretly. But she was afraid of being discovered and did not dare to make a sound.","During that long period of repression, Qiao Nian was her faith. She was the reason why she could firmly believe that she could live.","Jian Jin’s eyes reddened. She wiped away her tears and looked away stubbornly. Then, she pulled off the nameplate on her chest and placed it on Lu Zhi’s desk. \"I’m leaving. Take care of yourself.\""]},{"number":3857,"title":"Chapter 3857: Don’t Worry, My Ultimate Purpose Is Not Her","paragraphs":["Lu Zhi looked at her figure and finally called out to her, \"Jian Jin.\"","The woman did not turn around, but she instinctively stopped for him.","Lu Zhi’s slender and beautiful fingertips touched the nameplate’s cold metal, deep in thought. \"Are you disappointed in me?\"","Jian Jin was momentarily silent before saying, \"Others don’t understand you. I know the responsibility you bear after 20 years of friendship.\"","Lu Zhi was different from her.","She could be willful and only represent herself.","Lu Zhi couldn’t.","She remembered how Lu Zhi \"reconciled\" with his hypocritical relatives for Tian Chen’s reputation.","Lu Zhi had his difficulties.","She did not want to make things difficult for him.","\"I’m not arguing with you because I want you to go against the reclusive families for QIAO’s sake. I just think...\"","She only felt that compared to everything Ye Wangchuan had done for Qiao Nian, Lu Zhi might also love her, but he was not as good as Ye Wangchuan.","Lu Zhi would never be able to love her without reservations.","Jian Jin did not say anything. She just shook her head and smiled bitterly. \"Forget it. There’s no point in saying this.\"","She insisted on keeping her back to him. She waved her hand carefree. \"I’m going to help QIAO. I’ll say the same thing. Take care of yourself.\"","Lu Zhi’s eyes were deep. No one could guess what he was thinking. He just watched as Jian Jin disappeared from sight step by step.","He leaned against the backrest, his beautiful face in a daze for a long time.","Nie Qingru’s call came at this time.","Lu Zhi looked at the incoming call but did not pick it up at first. When the call was about to go to voicemail, he slowly picked up the phone and accepted it.","\"Shoot.\"","His tone was not good.","Nie Qingru probably did not expect him to take so long to pick up the call and even speak in such a tone. She choked and asked, \"Did you eat dynamite?\"","\"If there’s nothing else, I’m hanging up.\" Lu Zhi was extremely cold.","Nie Qingru was most likely angered. She paused for a few seconds and, ignoring his attitude, concisely asked, \"I’ve already gotten someone to prepare it. What about you?\"","Lu Zhi frowned and struggled for a moment.","She could roughly guess his hesitation and reminded him coldly, \"If you want to get what you want, you can only snatch it. Otherwise, you can only look at her from afar for the rest of your life. Are you willing to let Ye Wangchuan laugh for the rest of his life?\"","\"You’d better remember the conditions we agreed on,\" Lu Zhi said, affecting the hoarseness in his voice.","Nie Qingru had expected him to agree and happily said, \"Of course. Even if you don’t believe me, you should believe in yourself.\"","\"You’re right. I don’t believe you.\" Lu Zhi did not hide his distrust at all. He warned her coldly, \"So, you’d better remember where my bottom line is. The illegal district is my territory. As long as I want it, even the Empress of the reclusive families can forget about keeping her life here!\"","These words were pretty domineering.","He did not give her any face.","Nie Qingru’s face twitched after being contradicted, and she could no longer smile. She replied expressionlessly, \"You have your bottom line, and I have mine.\"","She did not wait for Lu Zhi to answer before continuing, \"Don’t worry. My ultimate goal is to find Xicheng, not to kill her.\""]},{"number":3858,"title":"Chapter 3858: Jian Jin: As Far As I Know","paragraphs":["1 A.M.","Qiao Nian finally locked onto the identities of those people in the huge database.","Unexpectedly, besides the man with the mole on the left side of his face, most of the people had nothing to do with Tian Chen. They were all mercenaries from the illegal district.","It seemed Nie Qingru had lost all her men in the illegal district and could not find anyone to use them for the time being. Therefore, she used high profits to gather these mercenaries.","Mercenaries were a headache in any region. Most wandering mercenaries had no principles or bottom lines.","They only had one rule—money.","They would do anything if you offered them enough money.","Furthermore, they were not afraid of death.","Therefore, in many places, these wandering mercenaries were also known as ’people without a future’.","Qiao Nian did not expect Nie Qingru to hire such people to find Di Xicheng. After all, no matter how she looked at it, the Empress, who had always been high up in the air, had nothing to do with these lowly people...","One was a bright moon hanging high in the sky, and the other was a rat hiding in the sewers.","These two completely different people were actually mixed together.","Qiao Nian could not tell what she was thinking. She was only once again disgusted by Nie Qingru’s sanctimonious attitude.","After she locked onto their identities, she sent a photo of Tian Chen’s guy to Jian Jin. To save time, she made a call.","\"Beep...\"","The call was picked up immediately.","Qiao Nian concisely asked, \"Did you receive my message?\"","Jian Jin finished handing over to her assistant and left Tian Chen’s HQ. Her footsteps were relaxed and happy. \"You sent me a message? What message?\"","She did not say that she had left Tian Chen and Lu Zhi.","She knew Qiao Nian’s personality after all these years. She did not want her relationship with Lu Zhi to fall apart again.","Thus, she easily changed the subject. \"Give me a minute. Let me take a look.\"","\"Okay.\" Qiao Nian had been causing a commotion looking for Guan Yan for most of the day. She didn’t know that Jian Jin and Lu Zhi had already quarreled. She rubbed her forehead and waited for her.","Jian Jin opened WeChat and read the unread message.","She found the photo Qiao Nian had sent her a few minutes ago, clicked on it, and frowned. Her expression changed from relaxed to serious.","She had just walked out of Tian Chen when she stopped involuntarily. \"What’s wrong with this person?\"","Qiao Nian did not hide it from her and told her about Guan Yan being taken away from Ting Tang in the afternoon.","\"I asked the portrait artist to sketch the people based on their descriptions and searched for their identities. This is one of them.\"","\"You want to ask me... if Big Boss Lu was involved?\" Jian Jin was sharp.","Qiao Nian was silent for a moment.","She was unwilling to suspect Lu Zhi, but since this was his person, she had to ask for Guan Yan’s safety. She could not let go of any possibility.","Jian Jin said slowly after a moment of silence, \"Not that I know of. QIAO, Lu Zhi treats you differently from outsiders. I believe he won’t do anything to hurt you... As for this person, he’s indeed from Tian Chen. But you also know Nie Qingru’s methods. There are so many people in Tian Chen, so it’s inevitable for a spy to sneak in.\"","\"I got it.\"","Qiao Nian’s tense nerves relaxed.","Jian Jin put down this sensitive topic and chatted briefly with Qiao Nian. She asked where Qiao Nian was now and said she would come over immediately.","**","On Qin Si’s side.","Qin Si had been waiting by the roadside for a long time."]},{"number":3859,"title":"Chapter 3859: He Could Only Use Stupid Methods to Find Her","paragraphs":["Qin Si was not as powerful as Qiao Nian in the illegal district, so he could only use the stupidest method: following from behind.","The black car was parked under a tree, blending into its shadow under the moonlight, making it difficult to notice the vehicle.","Qin Si was sitting in the driver’s seat with his hands on the steering wheel. His handsome face was anxious as he muttered, \"Why hasn’t anyone come out yet?\"","In the front passenger seat was someone from the illegal district that Bo Jingxing had introduced to him. One of Bo Zheng’s subordinates was called Luo Fei.","Luo Fei had his hair combed back and wore a funny-looking aviator. He was unshaven and refused to shave. Hearing his question, he glanced at the young master beside him.","He said casually, \"What’s the hurry? We’ll have to follow a criminal for a month, two months, or even half a year. Barely any time has passed.\"","He did not say that he looked down on Qin Si, but his words revealed it.","In the past, based on Qin Si’s temper, he would definitely argue with him. Now, Qin Si acted as if he did not hear him and patted the steering wheel dejectedly.","\"No, I can’t wait that long!\"","Luo Fei glanced sideways. \"Your... Who was caught by them?\"","Bo Jingxing only told him that his friend had encountered some difficulties in the illegal district and hoped he would help.","When Qin Si came to find him, he only said that someone had been captured by someone from the reclusive families and asked him to help investigate those people.","Therefore, Luo Fei still did not know who Qin Si was looking for.","\"My girlfriend.\" Qin Si pursed his lips and stared fixedly at the high-end apartment that no one had entered, afraid he would miss an important person in a moment of inattention.","\" Hiss .\" Luo Fei gasped and sat up straight in shock.","He did not expect that the person arrested was the girlfriend of this young master from Beijing.","Luo Fei was a little regretful of his attitude just now. At the same time, he was extremely curious. \"No. Why was your girlfriend taken away by them? What did she do...\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Qin Si’s sharp eyes noticed a man wearing a hood that covered most of his face sneaking into the neighborhood.","He ignored Luo Fei’s question and grabbed his arm forcefully. He pointed at the sneaky figure and said, \"Take a look and see if it’s him!\"","Luo Fei glanced over. \"It’s so dark. Who can see the face clearly.\"","\"I’ll go get him.\"","Without another word, Qin Si unbuckled his seatbelt and got out of the car.","Luo Fei was shocked at his impulsiveness and reached out to stop him. \"I’ll go. What are you doing? Come back!\"","But it was too late.","Qin Si walked quickly towards that person.","\"F*ck!\" Luo Fei clenched his fist and smashed the window. With no choice, he unbuckled his seatbelt and followed.","They did not know if the other party was carrying any weapons. Logically speaking, they had to be very careful in this situation. They couldn’t easily approach the target...","Qin Si couldn’t care less. He blocked the person about to enter, his eyes burning like a torch. \"Where is she?\"","\"Who are you?\" The man was shocked. He looked at Qin Si impatiently and realized he did not know him. He pushed his hand away and tried to leave. \"Move.\"","Qin Si had a high position in Beijing, so he stopped the other party from leaving. \"Let me ask you, where is she?!\"","\"Are you crazy?!\" The other party was furious and wanted to pretend to hit him.","Qin Si struck first, punching the man’s face. The man staggered and almost fell, but Qin Si grabbed his collar and twisted it back."]},{"number":3860,"title":"Chapter 3860: How Did They Get Involved with the Red Alliance Now?","paragraphs":["This time, Qin Si made it clear.","\"Did you capture a woman from Ting Tang this afternoon? Where did you guys hide her?\"","Luo Fei caught up swiftly.","Moreover, he heard the Young Master asking the question already.","He covered his eyes, not daring to see.","What was Qin Si doing!","The right order of things would be first, verify if the other party was involved in the matter, then to interrogate them.","With how directly he asked, only a fool would admit it!","As expected—","That man was stunned for a moment before coming to his senses. He immediately resisted. \"What are you saying, you must’ve gotten the wrong person.\"","\"I am looking exactly for you!\"","Qin Si forcefully lifted the guy.","He was tall with long legs, while the other party was only 1.70m tall. Being lifted off the ground like that, he almost suffocated with his collar tightened around his neck.","That man’s face went red, and he slapped Qin Si’s hand anxiously. His eyeballs were bulging. \"F*ck, l-let go of me.\"","\"Where did you guys hide her?!\" Qin Si’s eyes burned, and he looked murderous.","\"L-Let go of me.\" That man was running out of oxygen, and his eyes were about to roll backwards. The nerves in his neck were also pounding.","Seeing that the man was about to lose his life, Luo Fei grabbed Qin Si’s hand. \"That’s... enough.\"","Qin Si seemed not to hear him. His eyes were fixed on the man. \"If you’re not saying, you’re going to die. What’s the point of a dead man keeping a secret?\"","That man’s eyes flickered. Perhaps truly frightened, he actually revealed something, \"I-I don’t know.\"","Qin Si released his grip slightly upon seeing that he was about to pass out. He allowed him to take a breath but did not let go of him, keeping the man’s life in his hands.","With that crucial breath of fresh air, that man’s face brightened significantly. He gritted his teeth and looked at the man holding him.","\"I don’t know where they’ve hidden her. I only know about the manor. I saw the car drive into the manor, but I don’t know what happened after that.\"","\"...Where’s this manor?\"","That man disclosed the manor’s rough location before reminding him, \"Brother, they have infrared cameras all around the area. You’ll be immediately detected. Once you’re detected, that’s the end.\"","He was not sincerely trying to help.","He was merely gloating.","When this lunatic went to the manor, he would meet his end. He couldn’t wait to see it.","Qin Si released him. \"You don’t have to worry about that.\"","That man was released and almost landed on the ground. After finding his footing, he barely managed to keep upright, his legs feeling like soft cotton.","He looked at Qin Si and Luo Fei, and his eyes revealed some understanding. He asked, \"You guys are with the Red Alliance, right?\"","Luo Fei was silent.","How did they get involved with the Red Alliance now?","Was he not just helping Captain Bo’s nephew’s good friend?","However, having worked in this area for so long, he knew how to react. He simply glanced at Qin Si and saw that his expression had not changed."]},{"number":3861,"title":"Chapter 3861: I Saw the Manor Before","paragraphs":["Seeing that Qin Si and Luo Fei were silent, the person thought he had guessed correctly and continued, \"I heard that Sun came looking for us.\"","He looked at them with a complicated expression and softened. \"I’m just a mercenary. Back then, I was tricked by my friend into taking this job. I didn’t know that this matter involved the Red Alliance, much less the woman’s identity. I wouldn’t have gotten involved if I knew she was Guan Yan!\"","Luo Fei was confused.","His heart trembled when he heard the name ’Guan Yan’. He suddenly leaned in Qin Si’s direction and observed his reaction.","In the end, Qin Si listened calmly without any reaction.","Luo Fei couldn’t describe his emotions.","Qin Si said that he was here to find his girlfriend.","This person said that they had captured Guan Yan.","If he remembered correctly, one of the main members of the Red Alliance was called Guan Yan!","The Qin family in Beijing and the female hacker in the illegal district... The difference between the two was too great. Luo Fei couldn’t imagine how these two people were entangled.","However, the current situation did not allow him to be curious. Otherwise, he would have asked Qin Si a few questions.","\"Look at this house of mine... I want to earn money, but as you can see, I’ve already bought a house in the illegal district and settled down. Why should I risk my life? I was scammed!\"","Afraid that Qin Si would not believe him, the person turned around and pouted, emphasizing, \"I heard that Sun only realized that she had gotten into trouble when she was taken away in the afternoon.\"","He resisted the urge to touch his neck and said to Qin Si in a slightly fawning tone, \"Can you help me put in a good word in front of Sun later and convey my situation... Look, you came looking for me and I explained immediately.\"","If not for because he had heard about what had happened at Ting Tang, he would not have determined that Qin Si and Luo Fei were from the Red Alliance.","Neither would he have told them the manor’s address so quickly without any resistance.","He was only doing this to form a good relationship. In the future, when they were dealt with, he would be able to dodge the bullet.","Qin Si automatically ignored what he said and only caught the main point. \"The address you just gave me... You didn’t lie to me?\"","\"How would I dare?\" The man raised his head and swore. \"I swear that the address I gave you is real. I saw the manor with my own eyes.\"","Qin Si retracted his gaze. \"That’s good.\"","The man was still worried and emphasized, \"I only saw them drive into that manor. I don’t know if there’s a transfer point inside. If you can’t find them, don’t blame me...\"","Qin Si ignored him and turned to leave.","Luo Fei had been watching the entire time. Seeing there was nothing else to watch, he comforted the person in amusement and hurriedly followed Qin Si.","Qin Si got into the car first.","He followed and sat in the front passenger seat. As he fastened his seatbelt, he asked curiously, \"What are you going to do next? Find... Sun?\"","Bo Zheng was not a gossipy person.","Not many people in Beijing knew that Qiao Nian was Sun of the Red Alliance. Those who knew tacitly kept this secret.","Luo Fei had been operating in the illegal district for many years, so he knew very little about matters in Beijing, let alone that Sun was inextricably linked to Beijing.","He only knew that this top big boss was very low-key and rarely appeared in the illegal district.","\"No.\" Qin Si restrained his temper, seeming to have matured all of a sudden. He drove the car around and replied, \"I’ll go take a look at the manor first.\""]},{"number":3862,"title":"Chapter 3862: Giving Every Big Boss in the Illegal District a Villa","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru’s manor was located in the famous wealthy district of the illegal district.","These villas were very famous locally.","The land was not cheap. Even people outside the illegal district had heard of this area.","However, the reason why outsiders knew that there was such a wealthy area in the illegal district was not because the price of a random villa here exceeded 100 million yuan, it was that even if one had money, they might not be able to live here!","The conditions to live in this wealthy district were extremely harsh. Even if one had the money to buy a house, if they didn’t get the approval of the industry committee...","They still couldn’t live here.","And those who could live here were all from the top circle in the illegal district... In other words, what they said about needing the approval of the industry committee actually meant needing to enter this social circle.","There were dozens of townhouses outside. The greenery was full of shade, and the lawns were neatly laid out.","The innermost circle of the illegal district was further in.","Qin Si drove past the tree-lined path, and their field of vision gradually widened.","Luo Fei took this opportunity to introduce this area to him. \"It’s said this place was developed by the real estate big boss, Min Jie. To make a name for the villa area he developed, this smart real estate businessman specially gave each of the major big bosses in the illegal district a house.\"","He raised an example. \"For example, Tian Chen’s Lu Zhi, the K Organization’s leader, and...\"","Luo Fei paused and glanced thoughtfully at Qin Si. \"And the person you know... Sun from the Red Alliance.","\"However, Sun is a loner and rarely appears in the illegal district. When that real estate tycoon gave this group of big bosses a house, only she didn’t want it.\"","Luo Fei’s eyes turned red at the mention of this, and he felt extremely pained.","He had been lurking in the illegal district all this time and received a meager income. And these big bosses in the illegal district even accepted ’gifts’ of such high prices.","And she still did not want it!","Luo Fei put away his comparison mentality and was too lazy to sulk. He got to the main point. \"She didn’t want it. The others accepted it. Among them were the reclusive families!\"","Qin Si finally glanced at him. \"Continue.\"","Luo Fei sulked. \"Young Master, what do you take me for!\"","Although he said that, he continued humbly, \"Tian Chen and the Red Alliance have controlled the illegal district for many years. Although the reclusive families are powerful, they can’t resist the local tyrants. Their development in the illegal district has been unsuccessful all these years. Not only did they not manage to compete with Tian Chen, but they were also gradually left behind by Tian Chen and the Red Alliance...","\"Of course, as an old faction, the reclusive families have global influence. Even if they suffer setbacks in the illegal district, it won’t affect their status.","\"Min Jie also knows this. That’s why when he developed this piece of land, he specially built a manor that matched the status of a few big bosses.\"","People like Qiao Nian and Lu Zhi would not stay in an ordinary villa.","Min Jie wanted to please these top figures back then, so he was naturally willing to spend a lot of money.","The land he developed was so valuable and classy because of these top big shots who lived here in seclusion.","However, Lu Zhi rarely stayed in the house.","Qiao Nian did not want a house.","The K Organization’s leader lived here.","Now, another person was living here—the reclusive families.","\"The reason I’m willing to tell you so much is this: that area is heavily guarded. It’s different from the areas we have been to until now.\""]},{"number":3863,"title":"Chapter 3863: Do You Think We Can Sneak In?","paragraphs":["Luo Fei dropped his smile, and his expression became much more serious. \"I don’t object to you taking a look, but we have to stand further away.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, he saw Qin Si step on the brakes. The car shook violently, and Qin Si’s calm voice sounded. \"...We’re here.\"","At the end of the villa area was Nie Qingru’s manor.","This manor was just as Luo Fei and the mercenary had said. There were surveillance cameras everywhere around the iron gate carved with copper flowers.","The wall was a full five meters tall, completely blocking out probing gazes.","Moreover, there was an infrared searchlight on the manor’s wall with a full 360° view. It was enough to search 50m away from the manor clearly.","Only upon seeing this did Qin Si know that there was really an impenetrable wall in this world.","If Guan Yan was really locked up here, the possibility of saving her was close to zero.","\"Do you think... we can sneak in?\" Qin Si looked at the people entering and exiting and suddenly asked Luo Fei with a strange expression.","Luo Fei was still observing the situation around the manor. He was amazed by the surrounding security equipment and lamented that this was indeed the residence of a top big boss.","Hearing Qin Si’s question, for a moment, he suspected something was wrong with his ears and dug into them with an incredulous expression. \"What did you just say? I didn’t hear you clearly.\"","Qin Si’s handsome face was emotional. His eyes met Luo Fei’s with determination.","\"Say, can you find a way for me to sneak in?\"","**","On Qiao Nian’s side.","Qiao Nian had already met up with Ye Wangchuan.","Ji Lin was also there.","Seeing her, he took the initiative to greet her. \"Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Nian was in a bad mood and just nodded in response.","Then, she walked towards Ye Wangchuan and briefly explained the situation to him.","\"How’s the person you found? Do you know where he is?\"","Ye Wangchuan tucked her loose hair behind her ear and said, \"Mo Xi hasn’t found Di Xicheng yet, but he found traces of one of his secret guards.\"","They knew very well who had captured Guan Yan.","Qiao Nian went to Ting Tang with great fanfare because she wanted to get \"evidence\" so she could negotiate with Nie Qingru.","Otherwise, if she used any other method, Guan Yan’s life might be endangered.","This time, she was afraid of hurting the rat.","\"Di Xicheng is cunning and ever-changing. That person might just be a smokescreen he released to attract our attention.\"","Qiao Nian’s voice became softer and softer.","She frowned. Anyone could tell that she was in a bad mood.","Guan Yan’s whereabouts were unknown.","It was really difficult for her to discuss this calmly.","Fortunately, she had strong self-control. After a short period of frustration, Qiao Nian quickly composed herself and suppressed the ruthlessness in her heart.","She stuffed her hands into her pockets and said, \"He didn’t fall into our hands, but he didn’t contact Nie Qingru... It seems like he wants to use this opportunity to watch Nie Qingru and me kill each other.\"","\"He has a grudge against Nie Qingru.\" Ye Wangchuan was always so sharp.","Qiao Nian looked up. \"Yes. I’ve found some information that links Nie Qingru to the destruction of the Di family. However, Nie Qingru destroyed the information back then, so no one knows what happened.","\"The reason why Di Xicheng came after me is definitely related to his uncle.\""]},{"number":3864,"title":"Chapter 3864: Qin Si Is Missing","paragraphs":["A trace of mockery flashed across Qiao Nian’s dark eyes, and her voice turned cold. \"He thinks that Ji Wusun’s blood flows in my veins. Since Ji Wusun is dead, he can only take revenge on me.\"","Whether it was Nie Qingru or Di Xicheng, they were both ridiculous.","They couldn’t even find their enemies. They could only find a substitute to hate and take revenge on in their own way.","\"As for why he’s after Nie Qingru... It’s most likely related to the fire that burned the Di family back then.\"","Qiao Nian had already analyzed what Di Xicheng wanted to do.","\"He wants to sit this one out and reap the spoils later! He wants to watch me and Nie Qingru fight to the death before he comes out to take the benefits...\"","Ye Wangchuan looked into her eyes. \"What about you?\"","\"What?\"","Qiao Nian was in a terrible mood. She raised her head, revealing her beautiful and tense face under her baseball cap. Her eyes were dark and emotionless.","Ye Wangchuan grabbed her fingers and squeezed them as if to comfort her before saying softly, \"What are you going to do next with Di Xicheng’s plan?\"","\"I don’t have a choice.\" His fingers attracted Qiao Nian’s attention. Fortunately, her hostility was not as strong. However, she still said weakly, \"With Guan Yan in her hands, Di Xicheng is destined to win.\"","Di Xicheng had won this round not because of schemes, but because of the people’s hearts.","Who would have thought that the Empress of the reclusive families, who only cared about profit, would be flustered because of him?","From the moment Nie Qingru rashly grabbed Guan Yan and wanted to talk to her, this game had entered the rhythm that Di Xicheng wanted.","Qiao Nian was rarely led by the nose.","This time, Di Xicheng forced her to make a choice she did not want to make...","Ye Wangchuan saw that her eyes had darkened again, and she was enveloped in gloom. He silently pinched the girl’s fingertips with his left hand.","Pulled out of the gloom, Qiao Nian looked up with dark eyes. \"... Sometimes, I don’t understand what kind of person she is.\"","Ye Wangchuan understood what she was talking about. He rubbed the top of her head and comforted her softly. \"Don’t think about it if you can’t figure it out.\"","What kind of person Nie Qingru was, whether affectionate or heartless, loyal or not, it had nothing to do with them...","There was no need for Qiao Nian to feel bad over such a person.","\"By the way,\" Ye Wangchuan tried to divert her attention, \"Qin Si hasn’t been seen since the evening. Did you see him?\"","Qiao Nian frowned. \"No. He didn’t look for me.\"","Ye Wangchuan was surprised. \"I thought he couldn’t sit still and went to look for you. He hasn’t contacted you since?\"","\"No.\" Qiao Nian was very sure.","At this moment, they seemed to have noticed Ji Lin’s existence and looked over tacitly.","Ji Lin was the third wheel for half an hour, silently swallowing everything he saw. Just as he was comforting himself that he was getting used to it, he was suddenly stared at by the two love birds and almost choked on his saliva. \"Ahem. Miss Qiao? Master Wang? You...\"","What he wanted to say was: Why are you guys looking at me? It’s a little scary~","Qiao Nian was the first to ask, \"Ji Lin, has Qin Si contacted you?\"","Ji Lin straightened his face and shook his head. \"I didn’t see him, either.\"","He saw Qiao Nian’s thoughtful expression and added, \"He went out not long after you left.\"","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened. She seemed to have thought of something and became anxious."]},{"number":3865,"title":"Chapter 3865: He Really Sneaked Into Nie Qingru’s Manor","paragraphs":["Ji Lin also thought of the same thing. \"Miss Qiao, do you think Young Master Qin went to... the Empress?\"","The relationship between Nie Qingru and Qiao Nian was extremely complicated. They couldn’t be described simply as enemies. Due to their relationship, Ji Lin usually referred to Nie Qingru as the Empress and rarely mentioned her by name.","Anyone who knew Nie Qingru’s relationship with Qiao Nian would pay attention to this. After all, she was Miss Qiao’s biological grandmother, so outsiders like them couldn’t say anything.","Faced with Ji Lin’s guess, Qiao Nian was silent for a moment. She pursed her lips and said, \"He probably wouldn’t be so impulsive.\"","**","Reality proved that Qin Si was more impulsive than everyone had expected.","He had not returned last night.","Ye Wangchuan couldn’t get through to him. Only then did everyone at the Red Alliance’s HQ realize that he had gone after Nie Qingru alone.","At this juncture, it was really dangerous for him to act alone.","Ye Wangchuan entered the study and called Beijing. Then, he pressed his forehead with his fingers, feeling a headache. \"I’ve asked the Qin family and his circle of friends. His mother said he called home in the afternoon. But this matter was too big, so she didn’t agree at that time and said she would ask the Old Master. She hasn’t replied to Qin Si yet. In addition, Bo Jingxing said that Qin Si looked for him, and he gave him a local.\"","He saw Qiao Nian looking at him. Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened, and he added, \"Bo Zheng’s men.\"","Bo Zheng had an international reputation, so it was normal for him to have a few people in the illegal district. After all, most of the opponents they usually faced came from the illegal district and the independent continent.","Ye Wangchuan did not expect his two good friends to do this behind his back.","Therefore, when Bo Jingxing told him that he had given Qin Si manpower, he was angry and spoke quite harshly.","Bo Jingxing knew that Qin Si had not returned for the entire night and realized the seriousness of the matter. He also apologized and said that he would ask Bo Zheng to try to contact Luo Fei.","...","They waited until three in the afternoon before Bo Zheng called.","Bo Zheng had always been a man of few words. He only told them three things:","1. Qin Si had indeed gone after Nie Qingru.","2. Qin Si entered the manor with Luo Fei’s help, and the latter lost contact with him.","3. Luo Fei was still guarding outside the manor. The manor looked calm. It seemed that Qin Si was still safe.","Qiao Nian’s head buzzed after hearing this. Her head hurt so much that she pressed her fingertips against her temples, trying to suppress her surging blood.","She asked Ye Wangchuan for Luo Fei’s number, then expressionlessly stood up and picked up her phone. \"I’ll contact this person.\"","She wanted to know the current situation and why Qin Si did not talk to her before taking action!!","**","Illegal district.","Outside the reclusive families’ private manor.","Luo Fei sat alone in the driver’s seat of the black car. After staying up all night, his eyes were bloodshot, and he did not dare to look away as he watched the manor like a hawk.","Ever since Bo Zheng personally called to ask about Qin Si, he realized that he had done something wrong on impulse yesterday.","Qin Si did not come out for the entire night. If anything happened to him, not only would he not know how to answer Qin Si’s family, but he might even implicate Captain Bo...","At this thought, Luo Fei’s head felt like it was about to explode. He was filled with regret!","He shouldn’t have agreed to help Qin Si."]},{"number":3866,"title":"Chapter 3866: I’m Sun, Where’s Qin Si?","paragraphs":["While he was spying, the phone in the storage compartment buzzed and lit up. From the corner of his eye, Luo Fei saw that it was an unknown number from the illegal district. He was vigilant and did not pick it up.","But the other party was insistent and called again.","Luo Fei hesitated before slowly reaching for the cell phone. \"Hello.\"","Qin Si’s voice immediately came from the other end.","\"Honey, I’m not going back today. Also, I dropped my cell phone in the toilet. This is a call from a brother. I’m calling you to report. Don’t worry about me.\"","Honey?!","Luo Fei’s eyebrows twitched. Given Qin Si’s situation, there was a high chance that he had borrowed a cell phone from someone.","Therefore, he pinched his throat and said in a muffled voice, \"When are you coming back?\"","The background was noisy and indistinguishable. \"By the way, the necklace you asked me to buy... I found it! I’ll place an order for you when I go back and change my cell phone.\"","When Qin Si emphasized the word ’necklace’, Luo Fei suddenly thought that he was talking about ’Guan Yan’.","Luo Fei had been doing intelligence work for years. How could he not know this secret code? He immediately replied, \"Come back when you find it. I’ll wait for you to return.\"","\"Okay.\"","Qin Si was most likely relieved and hurriedly said to him, \"I’ve borrowed someone else’s phone. I’m not talking to you anymore. Bye.\"","Before Luo Fei could ask about his situation, the beeping sound came from the other end.","Qin Si hung up.","Anxious, Luo Fei frowned as he thought about how to bring him out.","At this moment, his phone lit up again.","Luo Fei looked down and saw another unknown number.","He did not understand why so many people were calling, but then he thought it was Qin Si again and quickly accepted the call. \"Hello.\"","Luo Fei took the initiative to ask nervously, \"Is that you?\"","There was silence on the other end before a girl’s arrogant voice sounded. \"I’m Sun. Where are you? Let’s meet.\"","Red Alliance—Sun!","Luo Fei was so shocked that he sat up, causing the top of his head to hit the roof. He saw stars. He quickly sat back down. \"I can’t leave right now...\"","He glanced at the manor and roughly described his current situation to Qiao Nian.","\"...If something happens inside, I can at least sense the changes immediately.\"","\"How long has he been in there?\" Qiao Nian asked after a pause.","Luo Fei looked at the manor. His tone was cold and serious. \"...It’s been a night.\"","He recounted how Qin Si had called him. In the end, he said in a low voice, \"If I understand his meaning correctly, he should have found Guan Yan’s location.\"","Qiao Nian’s tone was heavy. \"Nonsense!\"","She rarely revealed her emotions. This time, she was really angered by Qin Si’s actions. She barely managed to suppress her anger. \"I’ll go over and think of a way to bring him out. As for Guan Yan... I’ll handle it.\"","Qin Si dared to barge into Nie Qingru’s nest alone. Qiao Nian really did not expect this. If it were her, she might not even dare to play so wild.","\"No matter what, we have to ensure his safety!\"","Luo Fei was a smart person. He quickly said, \"I understand.\"","Qin Si was already lucky to find Guan Yan. He couldn’t possibly bring her out on his own.","The longer Qin Si stayed inside, the more likely he was to be discovered."]},{"number":3867,"title":"Chapter 3867: Nie Qingru Had Long Discovered the Car Parked Outside","paragraphs":["As the rational party, Qiao Nian had to guarantee the safety of the people she could easily bring out first before thinking about anything else.","Luo Fei hung up and carefully monitored the manor, ready to contact Qiao Nian at any time...","**","In the manor.","Shadow walked the long corridor and reached the living room. He saw the servant kneeling in front of Nie Qingru and serving her black tea.","The marks of time had long been etched on the noble Madam. What remained unchanged was her noble and outstanding temperament.","She took the exquisite teacup from the tray and caught a glimpse of someone coming in from outside.","\"Is that car still parked on the roadside?\"","Shadow did not dare to look anymore and lowered his head. \"Yes, Empress.\"","A trace of interest appeared on Nie Qingru’s face. She took a sip of black tea and said slowly, \"Who do you think is outside?\"","Shadow did not dare to make wild guesses. \"I’m slow-witted.\"","\"Tsk.\" Nie Qingru placed the teacup on the tray and raised her eyelids, her eyes filled with mockery. \"Other than that evil creature, who else dares to approach this place?\"","Lu Zhi might dare.","However, Lu Zhi wouldn’t do that with his personality.","At this thought, Nie Qingru suppressed her fluctuating emotions and looked up. \"There’s no news of Xicheng yet?\"","Shadow was silent.","\"Hmph!\" Nie Qingru’s expression suddenly turned cold. With a flick of her sleeve, she almost sent the teacup flying. But she did not care. \"She said she didn’t do anything to Xicheng! Besides her, who else can make me unable to find any news!\"","Shadow raised his head and said with a low voice, \"Empress, is it possible that Young Master Di doesn’t want us to find him?\"","Halfway through his sentence, a death-like gaze zeroed in on him.","Shadow naturally shut his mouth under such a gaze.","Nie Qingru’s expression was ugly. \"Don’t say such things again!\"","Shadow fell silent again.","Nie Qingru took a deep breath. \"You know how guilty I feel towards him. I understand what you’re saying, but I don’t want to think about it. Do you understand what I mean?\"","Shadow felt sorry for her.","He changed his attitude and nodded solemnly. \"I’m sorry, Empress. I won’t say that again.\"","Nie Qingru’s expression softened. \"Mm.\"","She thought of the car parked outside her manor for the whole night, and a sharp light flashed in her eyes. She ordered Shadow, \"Find a few people and bring that person back.\"","\"Empress?\"","Nie Qingru couldn’t find Di Xicheng’s whereabouts and was already extremely impatient. \"Pfft, don’t they want to keep an eye on me? Come in and see more clearly!\"","At this moment, someone rushed in to report the latest news from Continent M to Nie Qingru.","The Privy Council urged her to go back quickly.","The person was in a hurry.","Shadow deduced from her hurried footsteps that the news from Continent M was probably not good. He did not want to cause Nie Qingru any more trouble here.","Hence, he quickly bowed and said, \"Then, I’ll go out first.\"","\"Go on.\"","Nie Qingru had thought of the same thing.","After Shadow left, she sat back expressionlessly. She didn’t even look at the person as she asked, \"Tell me, what does the Privy Council want?\"","The person hunched her back and did not dare to look up. She stammered, \"The archbishop wants you to call him immediately. He wants to talk to you about Beijing.\"","Nie Qingru’s eyes flickered, and anger flashed across her face. However, she quickly suppressed it and waved her hand. \"You can leave.\""]},{"number":3868,"title":"Chapter 3868: Brother, Let Me Borrow Your Cell Phone Again","paragraphs":["She walked towards the bedroom without saying a word.","The Privy Council was not giving her any face now, especially Quentin, who was chasing after her relentlessly, as if he wanted to use this opportunity to drag her down.","In addition, her previous decision to compete with Beijing caused severe damage to many families’ interests. Nie Qingru could vaguely feel that her current situation was declining, as if she were being pulled down by Quentin...","Nie Qingru had been in a high position for a long time and was used to giving orders.","This time, she had suffered a huge setback. No matter how unwilling she was, she could only communicate with the Privy Council nicely to prevent worse things from happening.","Nie Qingru still did not know that the three heads of the Privy Council had reached an agreement. When she returned from the illegal district, they would start impeachment proceedings against her.","If she knew, she would probably feel even worse.","**","Qin Si sneaked into the manor in the clothes of a deliveryman.","With the help of Luo Fei’s friend, he successfully came in a car delivering vegetables. He also knocked out a guard and snatched the other party’s identity card before barely hiding.","However, he was unfamiliar with the situation in the manor and did not dare to act rashly.","After one day and one night, he only found out that an important ’criminal’ was locked up in the manor. It wasn’t easy to ask about the exact location, and he did not dare to ask.","In addition, Qin Si also heard that a doctor came last night, probably for the prisoner.","Ever since he learned that Guan Yan was here and was very likely injured, he had been anxious and wished he could find her immediately.","However, besides thinking of a way to borrow a cell phone to contact Luo Fei and spread the news that Guan Yan was here, he had yet to find a way to quietly find out Guan Yan’s exact location without alerting others...","Just as Qin Si was at a loss, he suddenly saw Shadow rushing out with a few people and calling for help.","\"You, you, and you... Come with me!\"","Shadow was picking people.","Afraid of being recognized, Qin Si tried his best to bury his head.","Luckily, Shadow did not pick him. He only called the people around him.","Those called immediately followed him.","Qin Si saw them rushing out of the manor.","He found it strange, so he leaned over and elbowed the burly man who had lent him his cell phone. \"Brother, um, do you know what they’re going to do?\"","The burly man was so disgusted by his expression that he had goosebumps. He pulled a long face and angrily asked, \"Why do you care so much?\"","\"I’m just curious.\" Qin Si was thick-skinned. He didn’t care about the other party’s bad attitude at all and smiled obsequiously as usual.","As the saying goes—","One shouldn’t slap a smiling person.","Even though the burly man was extremely annoyed by him, upon seeing him smiling with a good temper, he immediately suppressed his impatience and said woodenly, \"I’m not sure, either... I just heard the brother in charge of the surveillance room say that a car was parked outside the entire night.\"","Qin Si’s expression changed drastically. He suddenly pinched his palm and instantly felt a sharp pain in his brain. He forced a smile.","\"There’s a car outside?\"","\"I didn’t see it with my own eyes... I only heard it from the person in charge of the surveillance room,\" the burly man said arrogantly. \"That person might not know that we have surveillance cameras on the other side of the road and thought that he hid well!\"","Qin Si’s smile gradually disappeared, and he chuckled. \"...Maybe.\"","His heartbeat accelerated. Trying his best to control his facial expression, he stretched out his hand to the burly man. \"Brother, let me borrow your cell phone again.\""]},{"number":3869,"title":"Chapter 3869: Qin Si: Thank You, Brother","paragraphs":["Luo Fei was still outside when Qin Si called again.","Because he had called with this number once before, Luo Fei picked it up without hesitation. \"Hello, why are you calling me again?\"","Qin Si said anxiously, \"You’ve been exposed!\"","\"What?\" Luo Fei had yet to react.","Then, Qin Si spoke with suppressed breathing. \"Someone discovered you. The people in the manor are preparing to catch you... Run!\"","This time, Luo Fei heard it clearly.","However, his mind was a mess, and he did not know what to do. \"I...\"","\"You what? Listen to me. Hurry up and leave. Don’t let them catch you!\" Qin Si was hiding in the toilet. He couldn’t stay inside for too long, afraid that he would arouse suspicion.","Luo Fei’s eyelids twitched. Looking up, he could already see the commotion at the manor’s entrance. Knowing that Qin Si was not scaring him, he gritted his teeth and asked, \"What are you going to do?\"","Qin Si was still worried that the people outside would discover him and said quickly, \"Don’t worry about me. I’ll think of a way myself. If they catch you, we’ll be in even more trouble.\"","Luo Fei knew that he was right. His heart sank. He put the phone on speaker mode and threw it on the passenger seat. Then, he started the car and stepped on the accelerator. He turned the steering wheel and was about to turn around and run.","At the same time, he did not forget to say to Qin Si, \"I’ll go get reinforcements. Be careful.\"","\"Okay.\"","Qin Si knew that once Luo Fei left, the risk of being exposed would increase, but there was no other way now.","He hung up and deleted the call log. He walked out of the toilet cubicle and looked at his face in the mirror. The facial muscles were tense, and his eyes were sharp.","He definitely could not go out in his current state.","Qin Si took a deep breath and slapped himself twice on the face, forcing his tense expression away, and turned on the tap to flush his face.","After washing his face with cold water, he looked at the mirror again. The man in the mirror had turned into his usual cynical and smiling expression.","Only then did he turn off the tap. With this expression, he went out and returned the phone to the burly man. He even winked at him. \"Thank you, bro!\"","His wink and cheeky smile disgusted the burly man. He snatched the cell phone and sized Qin Si up. He held back his disdain and retracted his gaze. He wanted to say something, but hesitated. \"Why are you winking? You’re like a woman.\"","Qin Si did not mind and grabbed his shoulder with a smile. \"Aren’t I thanking you?\"","The burly man pulled away, not buying it. \"Alright, just stay away from me.\"","\"Don’t mind me, brother~\" Qin Si got some information about Guan Yan from him, and naturally started chatting with him.","He was born into a prestigious family and indulged in social occasions from a young age.","Which young master from the upper-class circle didn’t know how to interact with people? They had come into contact with these things since they were young.","It was just that most people couldn’t be bothered with relationships.","Now that he wanted to get information out of him, he just had to say nice things to the burly men, and they felt extremely at ease. Unknowingly, they started chatting.","Qin Si first complained to him about how strict his wife was and how troublesome women were. They were the most popular topics among men.","The burly man naturally agreed and also talked about his lover.","As he spoke, Qin Si saw that it was about time."]},{"number":3870,"title":"Chapter 3870: Qin Si’s About to Be Exposed","paragraphs":["Only then did he shift the topic to Guan Yan. He said to the burly man gloomily, \"I’m on duty. Look, I called home a few times. Just now, she even scolded me, saying that I don’t care about the house. Tell me, the manor has been so busy these few days. How can I have time to care about my house?\"","\"That’s right. Women are all like this. How would they know that it’s not easy for us outside?\" The burly man sighed.","\"Isn’t that so? If she knew how to care for me, she wouldn’t pester me to buy a necklace.\"","\"Hey, it’s not easy!\" The burly man grew sympathetic, and his attitude towards Qin Si became much closer.","It was easy for men to resonate with other men with unhappy marriages.","To put it bluntly, mercenaries were also just men.","Qin Si’s eyes flashed. He touched the tip of his nose and took the opportunity to say, \"Sigh, didn’t we invite a doctor over yesterday? I wonder if the person locked up is dead.\"","He was afraid that the burly man would suspect him. Before the other party could react, he said as if he was talking to himself or as if he was explaining, \"If that person dies, I don’t know how much time it will take us. My wife is still waiting for me at home...\"","\"They’re not dead, right?\" The burly man casually said, \"I saw the doctor come out of the dungeon in the middle of the night with a medicine box. Their people even sent it over.\"","The people he was referring to were the reclusive families’ people led by Nie Qingru.","Nie Qingru did not bring enough manpower this time and recruited many mercenaries to take charge of the perimeter’s security. Only like this could Qin Si use Luo Fei’s connections to sneak in.","The burly man was experienced and familiar with the reclusive families’ people. He knew a lot.","However, they weren’t in the same group, after all. The man addressed Nie Qingru and Shadow as \"them\".","Qin Si understood and pretended to be curious. \"There’s a dungeon here?\"","The burly man sized him up. \"You don’t know?\"","Qin Si’s heart skipped a beat. At least, he maintained his calm on the surface and did not reveal any flaws under the other party’s gaze. He said frankly, \"Ah, I’m new.\"","The burly man put away his vigilance and said, \"I mean, you don’t look familiar. I don’t think I’ve seen you much.\"","\"I... came out to make a living to support my family.\" Qin Si rubbed his nose in embarrassment.","The burly man looked at him with more sympathy and patted his shoulder. He clicked his tongue and said, \"Sigh, it’s not easy for anyone!\"","\"That... that dungeon...\" Qin Si couldn’t wait to mention it again.","The burly man retracted his hand. \"There’s an underground prison here. A few brothers were called over to help clean it. They said that it hasn’t been used for a long time and it’s disgusting.\"","Qin Si said, \"Where’s that dungeon?\"","The burly man glanced at him. \"Why are you asking this?\"","Qin Si suppressed his excitement and tried his best to look calm. \"I’m just curious~ I can brag when I get home.\"","The burly man did not say anything and retracted his gaze. \"There’s someone locked up there. They value that person quite a lot. It’s best if you don’t ask too much.\"","Unwilling to give up, Qin Si thought of a way to make him spill the beans...","At this moment.","There was a commotion outside.","Those who went outside earlier returned in anger.","There were mercenaries among the people Shadow called over.","Everyone cursed and was furious.","The burly man’s attention was completely on that side, and he forgot about Qin Si’s existence. He strode over, grabbed the arm of a person, and asked, \"What happened? Why are you back? Didn’t you go to arrest someone?\""]},{"number":3871,"title":"Chapter 3871: Indeed Discovered","paragraphs":["\"Sigh!\" That person was extremely depressed. He pursed his lips and said, \"He ran away!\"","The burly man looked puzzled. \"He ran away?\"","That person was familiar with him and did not hesitate to speak. \"Speaking of which, it’s strange. As soon as we went out, that person seemed to know we were onto him. He stepped on the accelerator and ran away without hesitation. It was as if someone had informed him in advance...\"","It was easy to draw connections.","The burly man was stunned and immediately turned to look in Qin Si’s direction.","Unexpectedly, the person who was supposed to be waiting for him had ’disappeared’.","The burly man was a mercenary, after all. His expression immediately changed. Realizing that he might have been deceived, he felt a huge rock on his chest and grew furious.","He clenched his fists and angrily said, \"Damn it, I fell for it again.\"","The person touched the back of his head in confusion and asked honestly, \"What are you talking about?\"","The burly man said to him with a dark expression, \"A spy has sneaked in here.\"","\"Ah?\"","How could there be a spy here?","That person was too bold.","The burly man grabbed him and walked in. \"Let’s go talk to the reclusive families’ people!\"","**","Qin Si quietly left when the burly man went to talk to the mercenaries.","The manor was filled with mercenaries and people from the reclusive families.","He knew very well that Shadow and Nie Qingru were not easy to deal with.","Even if the burly man did not betray him, from the moment Luo Fei ran away, they would quickly realize that a \"spy\" had sneaked into the manor.","Logically speaking, he should think of a way to sneak out before Nie Qingru and Shadow reacted.","But Qin Si did not leave.","He went against the flow and began to search for the prison’s location.","Seconds ticked by.","Every second now was the time of danger. He had to find Guan Yan in the shortest time possible.","Then, he had to send the news out.","Only then would Guan Yan have a chance of being saved!","This kind of thing was easier said than done.","Qin Si came from a wealthy family. He was different from Ye Wangchuan, who liked to go to poor and dangerous places like Continent F to train himself.","He grew up among the rich.","In the top circle of Beijing, the people around him all carefully supported and catered to him.","It could be said that if he had not come to the illegal district with Qiao Nian and if nothing had happened to Guan Yan, Qin Si wouldn’t have known there was so little he could do.","He was now aware of the vastness of the world, of his own meager strength.","He realized that if he wanted to protect the woman he loved, he would have to pay the price with his life... When he realized this, he did not even think about escaping for a moment.","He only wanted to do his best to fight for Guan Yan’s life...","Qin Si covered his face and searched hard.","He vaguely noticed the atmosphere becoming tense. Many people in the manor began to look for something.","He knew that they were here for him.","Qin Si’s heart pounded faster than the sound of the wind.","The atmosphere became increasingly tense, and the clothes on Qin Si’s back were already drenched in cold sweat. It would be a lie to say that he was not afraid.","However, he didn’t show any signs of panic and carried out his plan in an orderly manner—find the location of the secret prison and inform Sister Qiao!"]},{"number":3872,"title":"Chapter 3872: Found Guan Yan!","paragraphs":["\"You guys look over there.\"","\"You go this way.\"","Footsteps approached.","Qin Si cursed his bad luck and hid in a room, preparing to leave after they left.","The footsteps outside were hurried.","Qin Si waited.","Suddenly, he realized that the room was a little strange. The floor tile in the middle protruded strongly, as if it were not very flat.","This was the property that Min Jie, the real estate tycoon of the illegal district, had given to a few top big bosses. They were willing to spend money on materials everywhere.","Qin Si did not think this real estate tycoon would make such a mistake.","He immediately reacted. When the footsteps outside had gone far, he squatted down and knocked on the floor tiles.","Knock knock.","A hollow sound came from below.","Qin Si had dabbled in real estate before. Although his status did not require him to participate in every segment, he had developed a strong interest in this industry at that time.","Therefore, he followed the purchaser for half a month.","Qin Si understood from the echo that it was empty below!","He looked around the room and finally found a switch on a statue of a handsome horse.","He flipped the switch, and an entrance was revealed in the middle of the room, leading downward.","Qin Si’s heart skipped a beat as he walked down the rough cement stairs.","He walked down a long, dark, and narrow staircase before gradually sensing the light. However, the beam of light was very weak and did not help much.","Qin Si carefully held onto the stairs as he went down. When his eyes adapted to the dark environment, he quickly walked to the end and saw the person he had been searching for two days.","Guan Yan was hung on the torture rack by refined chains. Her clothes were drenched in blood. Her hair hung down, and her eyes were closed. She looked like she was on the verge of death.","Qin Si’s heart skipped a beat. He almost didn’t dare to approach her.","\"Guan Yan...\"","The person trying to conserve her strength suspected that she was hallucinating. Her eyelashes fluttered, but she did not open her eyes.","She was really too tired, and she was enduring extreme pain.","Even after the doctor injected penicillin into her, it only prevented the wound from inflaming and forming pus, but it could not relieve the slightest pain.","Shadow and the others wanted to force her to speak through torture, so they would not let the doctor prescribe her painkillers.","She was in pain, and she could only feel her life slipping away.","\"Guan Yan...\"","In her blurriness, she heard that voice again. This time, Guan Yan’s eyelashes trembled violently, and she finally opened her eyes slowly.","Adapting to the environment, she saw a man who should not be here appear in the dark prison.","Guan Yan’s reaction was intense. \"What are you doing here?\"","She realized something. \"Sun’s here?\"","\"No, I’m alone.\" Qin Si walked over and tried to release her from the chains. Realizing that he could not break it, he suppressed his urgency and let go.","He pulled away from Guan Yan and pulled the chain. Then, he looked at the woman’s beautiful peach-blossom eyes and asked softly, \"How do I open this?\"","Guan Yan recovered from her shock. Her expression was ugly as she gritted her teeth and said, \"Are you crazy?! You came in here alone? How did you get in? Do you want to die?\"","Qin Si had endured it for two days and couldn’t hold back anymore. He glared back with red eyes. \"What about you? You knew it would be dangerous these few days, but you still went to see your friend? What kind of friend is so important that you don’t even want your life!\"","Guan Yan had never seen him like this and subconsciously looked away.","Qin Si knew that now was not the time to argue with her. He suppressed his jealousy and gritted his teeth to pull the chain. \"I’ll save you!\""]},{"number":3873,"title":"Chapter 3873: Qin Si: I’m Your Man, I’ll Definitely Get You Out","paragraphs":["\"Don’t worry about me...\" Guan Yan looked at him again, trying to persuade him.","Qin Si’s eyes were bloodshot, and he stubbornly said, \"I’m a man. Your man! I’ll get you out!\"","Guan Yan couldn’t describe her feelings at that moment.","She had just been betrayed, and now someone had risked his life to save her.","Yesterday, she had thought that feelings were the most ridiculous thing in the world. Not many men could be relied on.","Now, someone was using stubbornness to forcefully break the indestructible wall that had just been erected in her heart and forcefully put a bullet in it.","Guan Yan’s beautiful face was emotionless as she stared fixedly at the man trying to unchain her. Then, she squeezed out three words. \"You are sick!\"","Qin Si was sick. That was why he had risked coming here to look for her when his life could be so good in Beijing! If he died here, it would be a waste of his good reincarnation.","Qin Si, on the other hand, laughed at her scolding. \"You woman,\" said as he gently picked her up and used the height difference to ease her swollen wrist from the chains, \"If I weren’t sick, would I have taken a fancy to you?\"","Guan Yan raised her eyebrows and was about to retort, but he cut her off with a gentle and sloppy tone, \"Come on, we’re all sick. We can be sick together. It’ll save us from harming other people. Live a good life with me for the rest of your life. I’ll treat you well!\"","Guan Yan turned her head away. \"...I don’t know if we can leave yet.\"","Qin Si’s expression relaxed as he looked at her frankly. \"Even if we can’t leave, I’ll die with you. What are you afraid of?\"","Guan Yan was speechless. She stared at him for a few seconds, her throat moving as she said with difficulty, \"Qin Si, you don’t have to do this.\"","Qin Si was quite gentle. He relaxed when he realized that he couldn’t open the shackles. However, he did not let go of her. \"I’m willing!\"","Guan Yan stopped talking.","The sound of water dripping could be heard in the dark prison. Only a dim yellow light bulb inside did not cause the place to fall into complete darkness.","However, in such a dark and cold place, Guan Yan’s pain seemed to have disappeared. She quietly leaned against the man’s neck and enjoyed a moment of peace.","She looked at the dim yellow light and said softly, \"Idiot.\"","Normally, Qin Si would jump 80 feet high and argue with her, but this time, he silently agreed to her scolding.","But the peace did not last long.","Voices came from above.","\"Go outside and take a look. I’ll look around inside.\"","\"Okay.\"","Then, they heard someone coming down.","Guan Yan trembled and pushed the man away. \"Leave quickly!\"","Qin Si immediately let go of her.","Guan Yan was disappointed for a moment, but she was not a pretentious girl. She knew that she was imprisoned here and could not leave.","Leaving her behind was the most rational choice.","Unexpectedly, Qin Si did not leave. Instead, he looked around before looking back at her. \"Are you armed?\"","What?","Guan Yan did not know what he was talking about.","Qin Si asked again, \"Are you armed?\"","He knew whether it was Qiao Nian or Guan Yan... These big bosses in the illegal district liked to bring one or two self-defense weapons with them wherever they went."]},{"number":3874,"title":"Chapter 3874: Qin Si Contacted Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Sister Qiao was more arrogant.","She wasn’t carrying self-defense weapons on her, though she occasionally brought them along.","As for Guan Yan...","According to his understanding of her personality, Qin Si was certain that she must have one or two weapons for self-defense.","Seeing Guan Yan’s reaction, he knew that he had guessed correctly. His handsome face was cold and solemn as he reached out with a firm gaze. \"Give it to me. I still have something to do.\"","...","Enemies were bound to meet on a narrow road.","No one expected the burly mercenary to be the one who came down to check on the situation.","When the burly man realized that the door of the dark prison had been opened, he took out his gun and loaded it, holding it at the ready as he went down the dark stairs.","When he got down, he immediately saw the beautiful woman hanging on the torture rack.","Besides her, he did not notice anyone else.","The burly man frowned. \"... Strange.\"","Since the secret passage above was open, why was there no one below?","Just as he was about to turn around and see if there were any hiding places in the room, he suddenly heard a gust of wind.","As a mercenary, his reaction was already fast. He immediately turned around and was about to shoot, but it was too late.","The other party used his blind spot to avoid his first search and pounced out when he was at his most relaxed. No matter how fast he reacted or how skilled he was, he couldn’t withstand a sneak attack.","Qin Si swiftly electrocuted him with something that looked like a lighter that Guan Yan had given him. He heaved a sigh of relief and dragged him to a corner.","He squatted on the ground and took out the burly man’s cell phone. The tense expression on his handsome face finally relaxed. He looked up and said to Guan Yan, \"I’ll call Sister Qiao.\"","Guan Yan was pretending to be unconscious just now to confuse the burly man.","She opened her eyes and frowned before saying seriously, \"Qin Si, listen to me. It’s not too late for you to leave now. Don’t worry about me...\"","The man who was about to go up to make the call turned around and said calmly, \"... It’s too late. Wait for me!\"","Seeing that she couldn’t persuade him, Guan Yan frowned and watched him leave.","She tried to free herself again, but Shadow was not to be trifled with. He did not leave any chance for her to undo the chains.","Moreover, Guan Yan’s wounds began to bleed again because of her activity. The pain became so unbearable that the corners of her mouth twitched. She secretly sighed for her sorry state.","She did not expect to fall so badly this time.","If she had known that Qin Si would take the risk for her, she wouldn’t have carelessly gone to the appointment. At least, she would have brought Tattoo Arm and the others.","Unfortunately... there were no ifs in this world.","**","Qin Si indeed got a signal after going up.","He called Qiao Nian first, and she picked up the call instantly.","Qin Si observed the commotion outside and lowered his voice as he said anxiously, \"Sister Qiao, listen to me. I found Guan Yan. She’s hidden in the manor’s underground cell. She’s fine, but her condition isn’t good. She’s injured, but her life isn’t in danger.\"","\"Where are you?\" Qiao Nian asked directly.","Qin Si caught the worry in her voice and smiled. \"You don’t have to worry about me. I’m fine. I’m still in the manor. They didn’t find me...\"","He realized he jinxed himself as soon as he finished speaking.","The mercenaries who had gone to other places had actually turned around and walked back.","Qin Si knew he didn’t have much time left. He immediately closed the door of the secret prison and quickly told Qiao Nian its location."]},{"number":3875,"title":"Chapter 3875: You Only Need to Tell Me Now, Will You Help Me?","paragraphs":["He explained everything in detail, including the small path that he had found inside the manor.","Then, he pushed open the door and left the room at the risk of being discovered. He even sent Qiao Nian his location.","After doing this, he threw the phone into a nearby fountain.","The pool water was deep, and the cell phone landed with a splash.","This slight sound attracted the mercenaries’ attention, and they quickly discovered him.","One of them immediately pointed in Qin Si’s direction and excitedly shouted, \"He’s there!!\"","Qin Si took a deep breath and ran in the opposite direction.","The sound of the wind tore apart from both sides.","Qin Si did not care about anything.","There was only one thought in his mind—Run away, away from there. He couldn’t let Nie Qingru discover he had found Guan Yan. This way, when Qiao Nian arrived, Guan Yan could be safely saved...","**","Red Alliance’s HQ.","Qiao Nian tried to keep her cool after Qin Si’s call.","When Tattoo Arm came in and saw her, he only dared to lower his head and whisper, \"Sun, Luo Fei is here.\"","Two hours ago, they contacted Luo Fei through the satellite phone and helped him lose the cars that Shadow sent to chase him.","Luo Fei had narrowly escaped death. Before he could rest, he returned to the Red Alliance with the people Qiao Nian had sent.","This was his first time coming to the most mysterious Red Alliance’s HQ in the illegal district.","Unlike Tian Chen’s brilliant building, which was dozens of stories high, the Red Alliance’s HQ was more like a ’home’, with an European-style building with grass and flowers outside.","Luo Fei was led inside in a daze. He was still surprised that the Red Alliance’s HQ, which everyone feared in the illegal district, had such a warm style.","\"Sun, I’ve brought him here.\" Tattoo Arm brought him out.","Luo Fei was left alone with the legendary Sun herself.","He had heard Qin Si mention Sun. He had also heard some gossip about this big boss recently and was already prepared.","However, upon seeing the young girl, he couldn’t help but call out with difficulty, \"Sun?\"","\"Yes.\" Qiao Nian hooked her chin at him with an indifferent expression. \"You’re Luo Fei, Uncle Bo’s man?\"","Luo Fei trusted her a little more now that she mentioned Bo Zheng. He looked up and met the girl’s gaze, then simply said, \"I’m the person in charge of the illegal district sent by Captain Bo.","\"I’m very sorry about Young Master Qin.","\"At that time, Young Master Bo called and asked me to do his friend a favor. I didn’t expect it to involve the reclusive families and the Red Alliance. Later on, we found out the manor’s location. Young Master Qin wanted to sneak in and asked me for help. I was indeed not careful enough and agreed.\"","Luo Fei lowered his head, unable to hide his guilt. \"Young Master Qin doesn’t understand the situation in the illegal district. It’s my fault for being impulsive after staying here for so long! If Young Master Qin hadn’t taken the risk to inform me ahead of time, I’m afraid I wouldn’t be here right now...\"","Qiao Nian listened quietly before calmly saying, \"But since he informed you, it means he exposed himself.\"","Luo Fei’s guilt deepened. \"I’m sorry.\"","\"It’s useless to apologize.\" Qiao Nian interrupted him, internally suppressing her anger. \"He called me ten minutes ago, and then we lost contact. If I’m not wrong, he has already been discovered. I know that you’re Uncle Bo’s subordinate, and I also know that you have the IPA’s power behind you. Now, you only need to tell me if you can bring your people to the manor to ask Nie Qingru for someone on suspicion of extortion?\""]},{"number":3876,"title":"Chapter 3876: Okay, I Promise You","paragraphs":["Luo Fei suddenly raised his head. \"... Extortion crime? Ask for people?\"","What was Sun talking about?","Qiao Nian crossed her hands and spouted nonsense without a change in expression. \"Qin Si from Beijing and Guan Yan from the Red Alliance are involved in a case of extortion. It involves three continents and 13 families. The crime involves billions. I’ll send you their bank accounts and the transfer records of the extortion. You just have to take the evidence to the manor and ask for them in the IPA’s name. Be quick!\"","Luo Fei’s lips trembled, and his fingertips were taut from excessive nervousness. \"You want me to play favorites?\"","Qiao Nian looked straight at him, her eyes dark and bottomless. \"I want you to save them.\"","Luo Fei choked.","He was in a dilemma.","On one hand, Qin Si had taken the risk to inform him, allowing him to escape in time. On the other hand, it was the bottom line of his profession that he had held on to for all these years. They fought in his heart, and neither could gain the absolute upper hand.","Qiao Nian looked at his pale face and said slowly, \"If you can’t even protect the people around you, I don’t know why you insist on sticking to it!\"","Luo Fei opened his mouth. \"I...\"","His throat was dry. Meeting the girl’s mocking gaze, he actually did not have the confidence to hold her gaze.","In the end, he was the one who sent Qin Si into the manor, and the latter was also exposed because of him... No matter what, he shouldn’t have left Qin Si behind.","However, he didn’t expect Sun to be so direct as to ask him to use the IPA’s power to save someone the moment he arrived.","\"I can only mobilize my subordinates. If they contact the headquarters, I might not be able to persuade them to help...\"","The International Police Association was the world’s largest non-governmental organization composed of members of the Disciplinary Force, founded on January 1, 1950.","The IPA had people in all regions and often used its connections to help the international police solve cases.","Although they were a non-governmental organization, they were actually inextricably linked to the international police.","To a certain extent, the two were the same force.","However, some things that were inconvenient for the international police would be handed over to the IPA, especially in the illegal district, the independent continent, Continent F, and other areas.","It was not good for the international police to get involved in matters in these areas.","However, they often encountered criminals who had committed important crimes and escaped here. At this time, the local IPA would represent the police and ask for them.","The IPA was not a government agency. It was just a civil society organization. There were fewer restrictions, and it was more convenient to move around.","Most of the factions would cooperate with the IPA on the international police’s account.","\"I don’t need you to convince your headquarters to help. I just need you to bring me in.\"","What Qiao Nian wanted was for Luo Fei to use his identity as an IPA to see Nie Qingru. Only then would they have a good reason to enter the manor.","As for Luo Fei saying that the headquarters would not agree to help... She had already thought of this.","The IPA was definitely unwilling to get involved in such a dispute. All she wanted was to enter the manor, nothing else... Otherwise, she would have to rely on the manor’s defensive map that she had obtained.","Unless she used weapons of mass destruction, it would be almost impossible for her to break through.","Luo Fei could roughly guess what she wanted to do. He was shocked, hesitant, and finally made up his mind. He looked at the girl. \"Alright, I promise you!\"","Qiao Nian’s expression softened. She patted his shoulder, and a trace of gentleness flashed across her dark eyes. \"Thank you.\""]},{"number":3877,"title":"Chapter 3877: Qiao Nian: I Want to Bring Guan Yan Back Personally","paragraphs":["Luo Fei laughed bitterly. \"You don’t have to thank me. I owe him. Otherwise, no matter what you say, I won’t go against my principles.\"","Qiao Nian replied, \"Yes.\"","She lowered her hand, and her half-squinted eyes were filled with hostility. She pressed the corners of her mouth and turned to walk back, saying to Luo Fei, \"Since you’ve decided, let’s discuss what to do next!\"","**","Luo Fei was the person in charge of the IPA in the illegal district. He had about 70 people under him, and they had a close relationship with him.","As long as he asked for help, these people would most likely not refuse.","\"The problem is, not all of them are nearby. Only about a dozen of them can rush over in time.\"","\"A dozen?\"","\"18.\"","Luo Fei did some calculations and felt that the number of people he could bring was too few. He couldn’t help but frown and say to Qiao Nian, \"I’ve been observing outside the manor for the entire night. There are 200 to 300 people inside. With just us, if they don’t cooperate, we definitely won’t be able to take them away.\"","Qiao Nian tapped on the table with a thoughtful expression before looking up and saying casually, \"You don’t have to worry about this. You just have to bring your people and ask to see her. I’ll think of a way to deal with the rest.\"","Luo Fei looked at her. He still couldn’t associate this overly young girl with the legendary omnipotent big boss of the illegal district.","Legend had it that Sun was not only a hacker, but also a weapon user.","David, one of the weapons dealers in Continent F, was one of her people. She also made highly lethal weapons and had a close relationship with several big bosses like him...","Luo Fei thought that, according to this description, even if Sun was very young, she should be the cold and unapproachable kind of person.","He looked at the girl with a complicated gaze... Qiao Nian was cold, and there was an aura around her that was not to be trifled with.","However, it had nothing to do with the rumored brutality and fiendishness. Instead, she was beautiful. The kind of beauty that would stun one with just a glance.","A beautiful and young Asian girl was actually the Red Alliance’s master, the legendary big boss of the illegal district...","Luo Fei had been hiding in the illegal district for more than 10 years. If he hadn’t spoken to Qiao Nian face-to-face today, he wouldn’t have believed his eyes.","Even though he was right in front of Qiao Nian, he still felt like he was floating in the clouds.","\"You...\"","What?","Qiao Nian looked at him, clearly not understanding what he wanted to say.","Luo Fei quickly took a deep breath to compose himself. Then, he decisively stood up and grabbed his cell phone. \"I’ll go out and make a call now.\"","Qiao Nian did not stay idle after he left. She immediately called Tattoo Arm in to arrange a series of things.","She told him calmly, \"I’ll go in with the IPA later. You might not be able to contact me, so I’ll leave the rest to you!\"","Tattoo Arm pursed his lips and pulled her arm. \"Sun, why don’t I go?\"","Qiao Nian and Nie Qingru’s relationship... If Sun went in alone with the IPA, who knew what would happen?","What if Nie Qingru went crazy...","Tattoo Arm couldn’t help but worry. \"It’s safer for me to go. They won’t attack me...\"","However, Qiao Nian was unmoved. She stood up and, without looking back, said, \"I want to bring Guan Yan back personally.\""]},{"number":3878,"title":"Chapter 3878: She Will Never Be Able to Pay Me Back in This Life!","paragraphs":["In the manor.","Shadow’s men had already captured Qin Si and presented him to Nie Qingru.","Qin Si’s hands were tied behind his back. His handsome face was bright red as if he had been beaten up, and blood was seeping out of the corner of his mouth.","\"Walk faster.\" The mercenary behind him gave him a shove.","Qin Si almost fell. Fortunately, he wasn’t that unlucky. He barely managed to walk to the woman sitting on the upper seat, looking down at him.","\"Kneel!\" The mercenary behind him ordered sternly.","\"Hehe.\" Qin Si spat out a mouthful of blood and looked at Nie Qingru provocatively. \"I only kneel after visiting the grave during the new year. Who died in your family?\"","Standing on Nie Qingru’s left, Shadow’s expression suddenly changed. He walked over, kicked Qin Si’s knee, and watched expressionlessly as the latter knelt on the ground uncontrollably before revealing a disdainful expression. \"If you don’t want to die too quickly, pay attention to your attitude!\"","\"Hey, that’s enough.\" Nie Qingru waved her hand to signal Shadow to come back. Then, she glanced at the person kneeling in front of her and said casually, \"He’s just a child. Why are you arguing with him?\"","Qin Si found it hypocritical and ridiculous.","If Nie Qingru did not want to be mean to him, she could have stopped Shadow earlier. However, she did not speak the entire time and waited for him to be forced to kneel.","Only then did she lightly blame Shadow for being too mean.","After all, Qin Si was the descendant of a prestigious family and had seen many ways to win people’s hearts in the upper-class circle. With Nie Qingru’s actions just now, even the dogs in Beijing shook their heads!","Shadow immediately lowered his head and apologized respectfully. \"I’m sorry, Empress.\"","\"Come back.\" Nie Qingru beckoned him over.","Shadow glared at Qin Si warningly and walked to Nie Qingru’s side like a loyal bodyguard.","Nie Qingru looked at Qin Si’s handsome face twisted in pain, but did not say a word. She smiled and politely asked, \"You’re Nian Nian’s friend?\"","Qin Si had been beaten up, and Shadow even kicked him ruthlessly in the knee. His bones were in extreme pain, especially his stomach... However, with Nie Qingru pretending to be loving and asking this question, he suddenly raised his head and looked at her with a complicated gaze. \"What did you call Sister Qiao?\"","Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes, barely managing to maintain her amiable appearance. \"What’s wrong?\"","Qin Si said bluntly, \"You must have taken the wrong medicine! Do you need me to explain your relationship with Sister Qiao? Calling her Nian Nian... Forget it. I’m afraid Sister Qiao will vomit up last night’s meal if she hears it. She has a bad temper. I advise you not to disgust her.\"","These words were extremely arrogant.","He didn’t give Nie Qingru any face at all.","Nie Qingru’s smile immediately disappeared. Her expression turned dangerous. She sneered at the person acting mischievous in front of her. \"What’s my relationship with her? She only told you about her enemy, but she didn’t tell you that I’m her biological grandmother?!","\"If it weren’t for me, she wouldn’t even be qualified to enter this world! Tell me, what’s my relationship with her?\"","Her breathing was unstable, as if her emotions were affected by Qin Si’s words.","Nie Qing’s skinny hand gripped the armrest of the chair tightly. The veins on the back of her hand bulged, making her look even more terrifying and sinister.","\"She’ll never be able to pay me back in this life!\""]},{"number":3879,"title":"Chapter 3879: Isn’t It Even More Ridiculous That There’s No One to Protect You?","paragraphs":["Qin Si really didn’t expect anyone in the 21st century to say such things. After a short moment of shock, he looked at the angry person with a complicated expression.","\"You mean that as long as you provide the eggs for fertilization, no matter how you treat your descendants, they deserve it?\"","Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes and asked, \"What’s wrong?\"","Qin Si rolled his eyes speechlessly. \"Then, according to what you said, your parents can treat you equally badly. As long as they give you a chance to come to this world, even if they manipulate your life, it’s only natural. You owe them everything?\"","He thought of Ji Qing and blurted out, \"Then, why didn’t your parents want you to die?\"","Shadow had already taken out his gun and pointed it in Qin Si’s direction. He warned again, \"Watch your attitude when talking to the Empress!\"","Nie Qingru did not feel offended. She just looked at him with cold and fierce eyes. The corners of her mouth twitched, and she actually smiled.","\"How do you know they didn’t?\"","Qin Si was shocked for a moment.","He stared blankly at the high and mighty noblewoman, as if he had touched a corner of the truth about why Nie Qingru’s personality was so twisted and strange...","However, Nie Qingru did not give him a chance to probe further. She sat back in her seat and composed herself.","\"I wanted to have a ’friendly’ chat with you. Since you’re unwilling, tell me if Qiao Nian has done anything to Xicheng.\"","\"You mean Di Xicheng?\" Qin Si looked up.","Nie Qingru was very unhappy that he called Di Xicheng by name. Frowning, she suppressed the killing intent in her heart and hummed expressionlessly.","\"Where did she hide him?\"","She had captured Guan Yan to ask this question.","Guan Yan insisted that Qiao Nian did not capture Di Xicheng. Nie Qingru did not believe her and felt that she was deliberately defending Qiao Nian.","She had probably seen Qin Si once or twice and did not have a deep impression of him, but she knew that he often followed that evil creature and was one of Qiao Nian’s few good friends.","Only then did she get her subordinates to bring him over and ask him before dealing with him.","Nie Qingru’s patience for the past two days was almost exhausted. Without waiting for Qin Si’s answer, she lowered her eyes and adjusted the cloak on her shoulders before coldly saying, \"I advise you to think carefully before you speak.","\"Your family does have some status in Beijing, but this is not Beijing, and I’m not from Beijing. It’s easier for me to crush you than to kill an ant!\"","Her tone was icy. She habitually looked down on human lives, as if life and death were as light as dust in her eyes.","She did not have any reverence for life.","Qin Si smiled, not the least bit afraid. \"Then, I’ll have to trouble you to crush an ant like me.","\"Anyway, if you ask me about Sister Qiao, I only have one answer—I don’t know! If you have the ability, kill me.\"","Nie Qingru stared at Qin Si’s expression, and her eyes narrowed sinisterly. She chuckled, but the smile did not reach her eyes. \"You risked your life to enter my manor for Qiao Nian, but in the end, she didn’t care about you when something happened. Even so, you still want to protect her... How ridiculous!\"","Qin Si smiled provocatively. \"Yes, we’re all willing to take the risk for Sister Qiao. What about you? If no one protects you under such circumstances, wouldn’t it be even more ridiculous?\""]},{"number":3880,"title":"Chapter 3880: Drag Him Out... and Execute Him!","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru’s face completely darkened, and there was no longer a trace of a smile on it. The way she looked at Qin Si revealed her murderous intent.","She raised her hand and ordered Shadow, \"Drag him out... and execute him!\"","\"Yes.\"","Shadow had been enduring for a long time. He motioned for his two subordinates to drag Qin Si out.","The Qin family was indeed one of the few families at the pinnacle of the social hierarchy in Beijing. Originally, Nie Qingru would not have made an enemy for herself.","However, they were now in the illegal district, an internationally recognized no-man’s land.","Even if he was a young master from Beijing, Qin Si was responsible for his own life and death here. The Qin family would not have the confidence to find trouble with her after this.","Nie Qingru was prepared to execute Qin Si, who had been arguing with her all this time, because of this. It did not matter to her whether she killed him or not.","Normally, she could have given him orders when in a bad mood. However, she was not that kind-hearted.","After all, these people were lowly, and she did not care about them.","She could easily decide their fate.","Qin Si, on the other hand, was not that timid. He was not as frightened as Nie Qingru had imagined he would be, considering he was the pampered young master of his family.","He straightened his back, not intending to embarrass Beijing. When the mercenaries pulled him up, he said in a low voice, \"I’ll walk myself!\"","\"Pfft!\" Nie Qingru’s killing intent was aroused, and a cold sneer immediately appeared in her eyes. She \"kindly\" called out to her subordinates, \"Let him walk.\"","Thinking highly of Qin Si’s manliness, the two mercenaries let go and did not deliberately make things difficult for him.","Qin Si walked out step by step.","Throughout the entire process, he did not try to stall for time nor turn around to beg for mercy... He kept his head up and chest out, full of backbone.","Shadow followed behind, silently loading the gun. He would immediately execute Qin Si when they were out of the courtyard.","One second.","Two seconds.","As Qin Si walked out of the hall, he glanced in the direction of Guan Yan’s hidden cell before calmly retracting his gaze and preparing to face what would happen next.","\"Come on.\"","His voice was hoarse as he tried to control his emotions.","Seeing his act, Shadow was silent for a moment. Then, he raised the gun to his temple and said softly, \"Actually, you shouldn’t go against the Empress. As long as you tell her what she wants to know, the Empress won’t take your life.\"","\"I won’t betray Sister Qiao.\" Qin Si closed his eyes, clearly too lazy to continue talking to him.","Seeing how stubborn he was, Shadow knew that he could not persuade him anymore.","His voice was low. \"You clueless people are willing to sacrifice your lives for her. What did she do for you? She didn’t even come to look for you, which means she doesn’t care about you at all. She only cares about her own safety...\"","At this critical moment, running steps sounded from outside, and right on the heels of that, someone reported anxiously, \"Lord Shadow, the IPA is here!\"","Shadow loosened his grip on the trigger and frowned at Qin Si, who was calmly facing death with his eyes closed. His intuition told him that the IPA was coming for Qin Si.","Hesitating for a moment, he put down his pistol, took a deep breath, and instructed the two mercenaries, \"Take him away.\"","Then, he turned around with a straight face and said to the runner, \"Let’s go meet them!\"","\"Yes.\"","The runner lowered his head and led the way, not daring to look at them."]},{"number":3881,"title":"Chapter 3881: Empress, The IPA’s People Are Here","paragraphs":["Shadow’s intuition was on point.","Luo Fei and ten others were parked outside the manor. He directly revealed his identity and asked to see Nie Qingru.","The bodyguards at the door were checking their identification information.","One of the bodyguards kept looking up at them, his heart beating like a drum. He couldn’t understand why the IPA would come at this time.","Luo Fei even asked him politely, \"Brother, are you done reading?\"","At his urging, the bodyguard hurriedly checked the ID photo twice before returning it.","\"Your credentials are clear.\"","Luo Fei took his identification card and got into the car, ready to drive into the manor.","The people guarding outside the manor were mainly the mercenaries Nie Qingru had recruited from the illegal district. These people were not afraid of anything but the international police.","The IPA’s relationship with the international police was clearly not ordinary.","None of them wanted to attract the attention of the international police, so when they saw Luo Fei’s car forcefully trying to enter, the bodyguards only hesitated for a moment before pushing open the railing and letting them in.","Shadow was almost there when he received a report from the bodyguard at the door through the walkie-talkie. \"Lord Shadow, the IPA people have gone in.\"","The veins on Shadow’s forehead bulged. \"Why did you let them in?\"","\"T-There’s nothing wrong with their documents. They urged me to open the door, so I...\" the bodyguard explained vaguely.","Shadow knew that mercenaries were afraid of the IPA. He knew that it was useless to blame them for being unruly. After all, the illegal district was not their territory.","Their people had been captured by Qiao Nian in one fell swoop, so they could only spend money to hire these outsiders. Of course, outsiders were not as useful as their own people.","Everyone was only bound by benefits.","Shadow suppressed his anger and said coldly, \"I know. Be careful next time. Don’t let anyone in without my permission.\"","The person on the other end of the walkie-talkie apologized carefully. \"Okay, okay. I’ll be careful next time. I’m sorry, Lord Shadow.\"","Shadow cut off the communication and stopped. Then, he turned around. \"Go back by yourself. I’ll inform the Empress.\"","He left the subordinate behind and rushed into the hall without looking back.","...","\"IPA people?\"","\"What are they doing here?\"","Shadow suddenly rushed and told her that the IPA had come looking for her. Nie Qingru was in a daze, not knowing why this organization, which had nothing to do with her, would come looking for her at this time.","Shadow said in a low voice, \"I guess it has something to do with Qiao Nian.\"","Nie Qingru immediately snapped out of her daze. Her eyes went cold, and her mouth curled up into a sneer. \"That’s true. At this time, other than her, who else can’t wait to find trouble for me?\"","Now that she realized Qiao Nian might be behind the IPA, she unhurriedly picked up the tea made by the servant and snorted. \"If they want to come, let them come. I want to see what they can do.\"","\"Yes.\"","Shadow thought so, too.","Nie Qingru took a sip of tea and put the cup down. A thoughtful expression appeared on her face, and she said with a faint smile, \"Since she found a third party to approach me at this time, if she kneels and begs for mercy, I might consider letting her subordinate live. However, there’s a prerequisite... She has to hand over Xicheng!\"","She said coldly, \"Let me see with my own eyes that Xicheng is safe and sound. Otherwise, if even a strand of hair is missing, I will bury her subordinate with her!\""]},{"number":3882,"title":"Chapter 3882: I’m Here to Ask You for Her","paragraphs":["Shadow looked at her and did not dare to speak. With Qiao Nian’s personality, he did not think she would beg for mercy. He had thought ahead of Nie Qingru.","He felt that the IPA was probably up to no good this time.","However, seeing the disdain and coldness in Nie Qingru’s eyes, he could not pour cold water on her and suppressed it.","He said softly, \"Empress, should we move Guan Yan away in advance?\"","Not the least bit panicked, Nie Qingru waved her hand and said, \"No need. Since she found someone to beg me, what’s there to be afraid of? She’s the one who should be anxious and afraid!\"","\"... Yes.\" Shadow went silent after that.","...","Luo Fei quickly led his men into the hall and saw Nie Qingru.","He had already mentally prepared himself before coming. Seeing the Empress, he was only temporarily shocked by her aura. When Qiao Nian walked past him, Luo Fei immediately woke up from his daze and greeted her with a smile.","\"Empress, sorry to disturb you. We’re from the IPA. I’m Luo Fei, the person in charge of this area.\" He handed over his business card.","Nie Qingru glanced at it before returning it. Her tone was polite. \"Team Leader Luo, why are you looking for me?\"","\"Ah, cough cough! It’s like this...\" Luo Fei’s tone turned vague.","Nie Qingru’s gaze suddenly fixed on the girl behind him and greeted her, \"Heh, isn’t this my good granddaughter who has eyes that grow on her head? Why are you free to visit me?\"","Luo Fei didn’t know their relationship and turned around at this shocking secret—","The girl impatiently lowered the brim of her cap to cover her clear and cold eyes and hummed casually. \"Who are you calling?\"","Nie Qingru’s expression instantly turned cold. \"What? You don’t even recognize your grandmother?\"","\"Oh.\" Qiao Nian looked up. There was no warmth in her dark eyes, only alienation. \"I don’t know her.\"","Nie Qingru’s already ugly expression turned completely cold. The way she looked at Qiao Nian was filled with disgust, as if she could tear her apart in the next second.","Luo Fei felt the tense atmosphere and immediately stepped between them, using his body to block Nie Qingru’s ferocious gaze.","\"Empress, let’s get down to business.\"","Nie Qingru couldn’t see Qiao Nian, so she gradually suppressed her impetuous emotions. However, her attitude was not very good. She turned around and walked back. \"Tell me, what’s the matter?\"","She originally thought that Qiao Nian was here for Guan Yan.","She had taken the initiative to greet the other party just now because she wanted to see the other party admit defeat in humiliation. Who knew that this evil creature was still so arrogant?","Qiao Nian was like a wolf cub that did not know how to yield. If she did not break her legs and pull out her sharp teeth, she would never know fear!","At this thought, Nie Qingru decided to kill Guan Yan in the secret prison.","\"I don’t have much time. I still have to attend the banquet later. Team Leader Luo, please hurry.\" Nie Qingru’s attitude was disrespectful, not taking the IPA seriously at all.","Luo Fei pursed his lips, took out an arrest warrant from his pocket, and showed it to everyone. Then, he requested Nie Qingru, \"Our IPA has received reports of a major case involving extortion. Two of the suspects are on your estate.\"","What was he trying to say?"]},{"number":3883,"title":"Chapter 3883: So You Admit They’re Here","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru, Shadow, and the others did not expect this and were speechless.","Luo Fei continued righteously, \"This big case is suspected to be worth billions. It involves three continents and more than 10 families. The case has blown up. We’re also enforcing the law impartially. I hope you can cooperate with us and hand the people over, Empress.\"","Without waiting for Nie Qingru’s response, he handed her a bag.","Shadow took a step forward and took the leather bag from him. Then, he took out the documents and read them one by one. His expression changed slightly, and he immediately looked at the girl behind Luo Fei.","The evidence was about the ransom payment for Singh and the others. There were two overseas accounts inside, and the owners were Qin Si and Guan Yan.","He handed the document to Nie Qingru with a straight face, saying softly, \"Empress, take a look.\"","Nie Qingru skimmed through the evidence. Her cheeks twitched slightly, seeming quite angry. \"What a good piece of evidence!\"","They knew very well that the person involved in extortion was Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian had even followed the IPA people to their manor to ask for the culprit on the grounds of extortion...","She really knew how to play.","Qiao Nian blatantly treated them as fools.","How could Nie Qingru and Shadow not feel wronged?!","However, they all knew that since Luo Fei had obtained such \"evidence\", Qiao Nian must have used some means to change the owner of the account to Qin Si and Guan Yan.","As for how she did it, wasn’t it easy since she was the number one hacker?","Nie Qingru’s fingers gripped the paper tightly until it crumpled. Then, as if she had thought of something, she said gloomily, \"I know why you’re here.\"","She stared at Luo Fei with a fake smile. \"But Team Leader Luo, have you obtained the approval from the headquarters before coming here?\"","\"Well, I—\"","\"I know your Minister Fred.\"","The person in charge of the IPA headquarters was Fred. He and Luo Fei were not on the same level.","Seeing Luo Fei’s unconfident expression, Nie Qingru immediately understood that he might have been persuaded by Qiao Nian to do this in private.","She immediately retracted her anger and revealed today’s first sincere smile. \"Shadow, contact the IPA headquarters. Tell them about our situation and ask them if they agreed to this.\"","Luo Fei’s expression changed, and he subconsciously glanced at the girl’s reaction.","Although he had long guessed that Nie Qingru would not easily cooperate and would very likely contact the IPA headquarters to ask for an explanation...","He was still uncertain about how things would develop.","With Nie Qingru’s identity, it was difficult for the IPA to offend her. Qiao Nian’s \"evidence\" was only a financial crime and did not involve other major humanitarian crimes.","This way, the headquarters would choose to try to mediate the relationship between the two parties, and it was more likely that they would ask about the specific situation.","However, if that was the case, what was the point of them coming to the manor?","Luo Fei saw Shadow pick up his phone and walk to the side to make a call. His heartbeat accelerated, and he became uneasy.","Qiao Nian looked extremely calm as she asked Nie Qingru softly, \"So you admit they’re here?\""]},{"number":3884,"title":"Chapter 3884: The IPA’s Boss Is Coming","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru wanted Qiao Nian to bow down. She did not admit or deny it as she looked at the girl and said, \"They’re willing to risk their lives for you, but you’re so ruthless. You’re not even willing to bow to me to get them back.\"","\"Alright, I understand.\" Qiao Nian was not angered. Instead, she nodded calmly.","Seeing her reaction, Nie Qingru vaguely felt that something was wrong.","Before she could think about it, Shadow returned.","\"Empress, the IPA said that Fred is in the illegal district. He’s coming. He said that he’s almost here and asked you to wait a little longer.\"","Nie Qingru subconsciously frowned.","She refrained from asking why Fred was in the illegal district and was even coming to see her. After all, her relationship with him was neither good nor bad. They were just acquaintances from the same class.","If she had to say that she had anything to do with Fred, it was probably that one of the reclusive families was related to him.","That family was also one of her staunch supporters. They often presented treasures to please her.","Could it be that Fred was coming because of that tribe?","Or did he hear that she was in the illegal district and was coming to visit out of courtesy?","Nie Qingru really could not understand why Fred would suddenly come to visit her. She looked at Luo Fei’s and Qiao Nian’s reactions warily.","Qiao Nian’s eyes flashed with deep thought, as if she could not tell anything was wrong.","Luo Fei was surprised and was peeking at Qiao Nian’s reaction.","Nie Qingru did not notice anything amiss. She retracted her gaze and said firmly, \"Since the IPA’s boss is coming, let’s wait for him.\"","Luo Fei was uncertain. He anxiously looked at Qiao Nian.","Finally, he couldn’t keep his cool and asked Nie Qingru, \"Empress, can I bring my subordinates out for a breather?\"","Nie Qingru’s sharp gaze had long noticed Luo Fei’s uneasiness. Feeling even happier, she waved her hand in an easygoing manner. \"Team Leader Luo, please help yourself.\"","Luo Fei walked up to Qiao Nian and covered his mouth with his hand, coughing and signaling her to come out with him. \"Follow me.\"","The girl pulled down her baseball cap and followed out of the hall under everyone’s gaze.","Luo Fei walked until he reached a relatively quiet corner. He immediately pulled Qiao Nian over and said anxiously, \"Oh no, I didn’t expect the person-in-charge of the headquarters to be in the illegal district. Once he’s here, I can’t make any requests on the IPA’s behalf anymore...\"","He was only a small person in charge of an area, while Fred was the head of the entire IPA and his immediate superior.","To put it bluntly, his current situation was like using the company’s name in private business. But in the end, he bumped into the boss.","It was a life-or-death situation!","Luo Fei didn’t care if he died. He was more worried about Qin Si’s safety. \"This path won’t work. Why don’t we think of another way...\"","\"Are you so sure Fred is on the reclusive families’ side?\" Qiao Nian suddenly asked.","Luo Fei was stunned. \"What do you mean?\"","His expression froze for a moment before he thought of something. Looking enlightened, he said in surprise, \"Are you saying that you are the reason he’s here?\""]},{"number":3885,"title":"Chapter 3885: Luo Fei Is Stunned by Sister Nian’s Backup Plan","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian met his surprised eyes and broke his fantasy expressionlessly. \"I don’t know the IPA’s boss.\"","Luo Fei was surprised for nothing. His face crumbled. He looked at her with a complicated gaze","before saying, \"Sun, now’s not the time to joke. Please be more direct. Don’t say things halfway. You made me happy for nothing.\"","Qiao Nian did not argue with him. Instead, she lowered her eyes and pondered.","Before, when Nie Qingru observed her, she had also observed Nie Qingru’s reaction.","She saw a trace of surprise flash across Nie Qingru’s face when she heard that Fred was coming to visit. Even though Nie Qingru immediately realized that she was showing her emotions and immediately restrained her surprise, Qiao Nian still caught it.","From her reaction, Qiao Nian could tell that Nie Qingru was not too familiar with Fred. Two people who were not familiar with each other, but Fred personally came to visit... It was inevitable that people would overthink!","Qiao Nian asked Luo Fei if he was sure that the IPA was on the reclusive families’ side based on this point. However, it was obvious that Luo Fei did not know what the higher-ups were thinking.","Qiao Nian shook her head. \"Let’s go back.\"","\"No.\" Luo Fei became anxious again after recovering from his shock. He blocked the girl’s path and said anxiously, \"It wasn’t easy for us to get out. You haven’t told me what to do next.\"","What he meant was that there would be no room for negotiation when Fred arrived.","It would be best if Qiao Nian could discuss a solution with him.","Luo Fei decided to be more direct. \"Sun, what is your backup plan?\"","Qiao Nian rarely needed to report her arrangements to anyone.","She looked at his arm and stopped in her tracks. Then, she looked at him patiently, her dark eyes expressionless.","Luo Fei’s aura softened under her gaze. \"I’m just... worried about Young Master Qin. After all, I wasn’t cautious enough this time. If he loses his life, I’ll feel guilty for the rest of my life.\"","Qiao Nian’s cold eyes softened. She put her hands in her pockets and said hoarsely, \"I followed you in to confirm that Guan Yan and Qin Si are still here. Then...\"","Luo Fei perked up. He knew that the next step was the main point.","Qiao Nian sneered and licked her dry lips. \"Then, I arranged for a large-scale missile weapon outside. If the two sides can’t reach an agreement, we’ll raze this place to the ground!\"","Tattoo Arm was in charge of transporting weapons and accurate projection.","Before coming, she had already explained to him that she had brought a jammer. It was small, but it would affect the electromagnetic waves nearby.","Outside, the people from the Red Alliance, led by the Tattoo Arm, would use electromagnetic waves as a signal to launch missiles and lethal weapons to bombard this place.","This was also the perfect signal plan that Qiao Nian had prepared to prevent Nie Qingru’s signal jammer.","Qiao Nian said coldly, \"I’ll find them as soon as possible and bring them out. Qin Si has already told me Guan Yan’s exact location. When the time comes, you go and get her. I’ll find Qin Si.\"","Luo Fei was dumbfounded as he listened. His dizzy brain could not function. He couldn’t believe his ears.","He repeated, \"This is your backup plan?\""]},{"number":3886,"title":"Chapter 3886: The Big Bosses Play with Weapons Whenever They Disagree","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian asked him arrogantly, \"Can’t I?\"","Luo Fei fell silent, not knowing what to say.","It was not that Qiao Nian’s backup plan was not good, but it was too f*cking fierce! A little too fierce!","He had been in the IPA for most of his life. The IPA was very particular about the rules. For example, if he wanted to talk to someone, he would have to go through the relevant procedures and then negotiate with them. If the negotiations were successful, they would go through another process. If not successful, it would be another process... In short, no one would play with missiles.","It was a missile, not a marble!","Luo Fei’s facial muscles twitched. \"But we caused such a big commotion in the illegal district. Putting everything else aside, Guan Yan and Qin Si will be in danger if we do this.\"","Qiao Nian put her hands in her pockets and looked at him calmly. \"So this is the backup plan I prepared, not the first move.\"","What f*cking logic.","It seemed like the big boss had restrained herself.","Luo Fei had mixed feelings. It was indescribable.","The way he looked at Qiao Nian was no longer with the disbelief like when he first saw that she was overly young and beautiful. He couldn’t associate Qiao Nian with the legendary Sun.","He was almost 40, but he didn’t have the guts to do this.","This was too much!","As expected of a big boss.","\"Then, let’s wait for the boss to arrive.\" Luo Fei could only accept it. \"What if he doesn’t stand on the reclusive families’ side? I’ll explain it to him properly.\"","\"Okay.\" Qiao Nian also did not want to make a move so quickly. She looked up and said to Luo Fei, \"Let’s go back.\"","Luo Fei watched her leave and could only follow her.","When he came out, he anxiously asked Qiao Nian for a backup plan. Now that he knew what Sun had prepared, he was so frightened that he wished he could walk slower. He was afraid that Qiao Nian would be unhappy and the missile would fly past his head...","**","While Luo Fei and Qiao Nian went out, Nie Qingru used the excuse of changing clothes to go upstairs. She frowned and contacted the IPA.","She asked her contact why Fred had suddenly come to the illegal district.","However, Fred had come in a hurry this time. The IPA people did not know why he was here, either.","Nie Qingru exchanged a few pleasantries with the other party before finding an opportunity to hang up.","She had a strong desire to be in control and was used to controlling everything. She did not allow anything unexpected to happen. Therefore, after a short moment of thinking, Nie Qingru found Fred’s private phone number and called him.","Beep...","She heard the static sound.","The call went through.","Nie Qingru walked to the floor-to-ceiling window and held her cell phone tightly, waiting for the other party to accept the call with a cold expression.","However, things were once again out of her control—Fred didn’t answer the call!","Nie Qingru listened as it rang more than 10 times before it was automatically hung up, and a robotic female voice sounded. \"Sorry, the number you dialed is temporarily unavailable.\"","She hung up decisively and dropped the cell phone. Frowning, she stared at the blurry shadow projected from the French window glass. She was unsure if Fred had deliberately not picked up her call or if the cell phone was not by his side...","Nie Qingru had a noble status.","As much as she wanted to find out why Fred was coming to visit her, the first call had gone unanswered.","Her pride did not allow her to call the other party again."]},{"number":3887,"title":"Chapter 3887: The Reason Fred Didn’t Answer the Call","paragraphs":["In the meantime, on Ye Wangchuan’s side.","A black Lincoln sped along the wide road in the illegal district. The scenery on both sides moved backward rapidly. The car drove quickly and steadily.","The driver was Ji Lin, who had been busy for the past two days. Two men in formal attire were in the backseats.","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were relaxed. Even though he was wearing a formal suit, it could not hide his lazy and noble aura. He leaned back in his chair leisurely and looked out the window at the speeding greenery.","The man sitting next to him was slightly older. Wearing a black suit and a black tie, he looked like a black-faced demon.","The older man’s cell phone had just rung. However, after taking it out and seeing the caller ID, he put his cell phone aside and did not pick it up.","When the car fell silent again, Ye Wangchuan turned to look at him with his deep eyes and straight nose. \"Aren’t you going to answer it?\"","Fred looked up, so angry that he laughed. \"How can I answer her call after you asked me for this sort of help?\"","His name sounded Western.","However, from his facial features, he looked more oriental. He had black hair and yellow skin. Even his eyes were the typical black color of people from Continent Y.","However, his outline was much deeper than that of ordinary people from there. His eye sockets were also deep. Coupled with his tall and big nose, one could tell that he was of mixed blood.","\"If I didn’t owe your Auntie a favor, I really wouldn’t care about you!\" Fred was so angry that he spoke ruthlessly.","However, his harsh words were useless against Ye Wangchuan.","Ye Wangchuan did not even look up as he retorted, \"You have to help me if you want to be my uncle in your lifetime.\"","Fred was speechless.","Ye Wangchuan continued to tease him in a relaxed tone, \"It’s not easy to be an uncle in Beijing.\"","\"I didn’t even get her...\" Fred complained, but in fact, his face had already softened. It could be seen that Ye Wangchuan had grasped his weakness.","Ye Wangchuan clicked his tongue and looked out the window again, not seeming to want to talk anymore.","On the other hand, Fred felt a little annoyed by his words. After a few minutes, he couldn’t help but say, \"I’ve been wooing your Auntie for almost three years. She always rejects me because I’m younger than her. I’m not that much younger. We’re only seven or eight years apart. It’s normal these days. Why won’t she accept me?\"","He had met Ye Lan when handling an urgent mission in a small European country. At that time, Ye Lan had decisively and intelligently helped him.","He fell in love with this calm and wise Oriental woman and then pursued her passionately.","At first, Ye Lan did not realize his pursuit and would even come out to eat and shop with him. It was only when he expressed his feelings that Ye Lan began to avoid him, as if his pursuit was some ferocious beast and she was completely unwilling to accept his feelings...","Fred’s facial features were oriental, but in fact, he was educated in the West and was passionate and unrestrained in relationships.","He did not quite understand why Ye Lan rejected him every time.","In his mind, people could be together as long as they had feelings for each other. He clearly did not care that Ye Lan was seven years older.","Moreover, Ye Lan had taken good care of herself. People couldn’t tell the age difference between them..."]},{"number":3888,"title":"Chapter 3888: Two-faced Master Wang’s Scheme","paragraphs":["He didn’t know what Ye Lan minded, but he respected her opinion. Although he had pursued her for the past three years, he had not caused too much trouble for her.","However, after three years of interaction, the more he understood her, the more attracted he became to this independent woman. He really wanted to have a further chance with her.","He also found it interesting that Ye Lan did not completely reject him.","During this process, he had seen Ye Wangchuan a few times when meeting Ye Lan for dinner and indirectly gotten to know him and the others.","If Ye Wangchuan had not looked for him, he would have taken the time to visit him anyway.","\"Do you think your Auntie will be angry if I visit the Old Master at your house during the new year?\" Fred did not know much about the ways of the world in Beijing.","He had probably heard from his friends that, to pursue a woman, one had to bring gifts and go to her door more often to get familiar with her.","However, Ye Lan and he were in a special situation. He didn’t know if he should go or not.","Ye Wangchuan finally gave him a look. He crossed his arms and said inexplicably, \"If you can help this time, the Old Master might want to see you. My Auntie won’t be angry with you... If you can help me, I’ll also help you. Let’s work well together.\"","Fred looked deeply into his eyes. He couldn’t tell what he was feeling. He thought for a moment before saying, \"Then you can only work with me. You can’t work with anyone else, even if they go looking for you.\"","He was afraid that Ye Wangchuan would find someone else for Ye Lan.","Ye Wangchuan saw through his thoughts and smiled. \"Don’t worry, I’m not that bored. Moreover, even if I help you, you might not be able to get my Auntie. Since she rejected you, it means that she has her own concerns... You can work hard, but the chances are not high.\"","Fred said nonchalantly, \"Since I like her, I’ll show my sincerity. If my sincerity can’t move her, I’ll bless and respect her choice.\"","Ye Wangchuan glanced at him and stopped speaking.","He was not the kind of person who would sell his aunt for a small favor.","Fred could tell that Ye Lan was interested in him, and Ye Wangchuan could naturally tell that his aunt’s heart had already softened.","However, Ye Lan’s previous marriage had not been pleasant; her husband died early, and her only daughter met a bad person and died young.","Ye Lan was used to being alone for so long and supported more than half of the Ye family.","She was also known as the Eldest Miss in Beijing.","In addition, she took care of her grandson for her daughter. Even though Ye Lan was not old, she took good care of herself and dressed valiantly and independently...","She never really gave the good men a chance, nor did she give herself a chance.","Until Fred...","Ye Lan rejected him, but she also treated him differently.","At the very least, this was the first time Ye Wangchuan had seen her eating with a suitor. Moreover, she had introduced him to Ye Wangchuan without any reservations. Although Ye Lan had introduced Fred as a \"friend\" she had met overseas, this \"friend\" was already special.","This time, he came to Fred for help and also to create an opportunity for the two of them.","As for whether Ye Lan and Fred could reach the end in the future... He would not get involved. It was up to his aunt to decide if she wanted to take that step.","The black car was still moving steadily.","Ye Wangchuan leaned back in his seat. \"Then show your sincerity to move her and help me with a small favor...\""]},{"number":3889,"title":"Chapter 3889: We Detained Them Legally and Reasonably","paragraphs":["In the manor.","Shadow arranged for the servants to make tea and bring it up.","He specially placed a cup in front of Qiao Nian. He thought that she would not dare to touch anything here and did not expect her to drink it without another thought.","Shadow choked and put a cup of tea in front of Luo Fei with a straight face, saying in a deep voice, \"Team Leader Luo, your tea.\"","Unlike Qiao Nian, Luo Fei was not used to acting alone. He took the cup cautiously and thanked him. \"Thank you.\"","Shadow straightened his back. \"It’s no trouble.\"","He served tea only to them. As for the IPA people who came with Luo Fei, they were served tea by the servants.","Luo Fei’s brothers did not expect things to turn out like this. They didn’t know what to do for a while.","They couldn’t find a suitable opportunity to ask Luo Fei. They could only suppress their temper and sit in their seats, drinking water in frustration.","Their gazes frequently landed on Luo Fei, hinting to him to let everyone know what they should do next...","However, every time Luo Fei met their gazes, he would bring the cup to his mouth. He did not dare to look them in the eye at all.","Because now that he knew what Qiao Nian had prepared, he really could not tell his brothers.","What could he say?","Could he tell everyone that Sun had arranged for people outside and was ready to blow up this place at any time?","Wasn’t this a joke?","Luo Fei was impatient from drinking the tea. One moment, he looked at Qiao Nian, and the next moment, he looked outside uneasily. He was worried that Qiao Nian would blow him up, but he was also worried that Fred would come too quickly.","He thought about it and still wanted to resolve the crisis by himself. So, he put the teacup on the table, suddenly stood up, and said to Shadow, \"Actually, we came here today to ask for two suspects. Let’s each take a step back and make things easier...\"","Shadow lowered his eyes and rejected Luo Fei’s request. \"The person in charge of the IPA will be here soon. Leader Luo, you should sit down and wait for him.\"","\"No, I...\" Luo Fei wanted to say something. What should he be waiting for? The lethal weapons? Wait for the missiles to fly over everyone’s heads?","Shadow did not understand it that way. He thought that Luo Fei was trying to scare him because he felt guilty. He interrupted him righteously. \"The IPA brought evidence to us. Leader Luo is not afraid of the person in charge. Unless... your evidence is fake? The criminal is someone else?\"","As he said this, he inadvertently glanced at Qiao Nian, who was sitting there calmly playing with her phone.","Qiao Nian felt his gaze, but couldn’t be bothered by him. She was focused on playing Tetris on her cell phone.","The signal here was indeed not good.","Only the official cell phones could connect to the signal in the manor. Cell phones brought by outsiders like them could not access it.","Fortunately, Qiao Nian did not have to go online. She just played her own puzzle game.","Luo Fei saw Shadow looking at Qiao Nian a few times, but Qiao Nian sat there lazily and refused to look at him. He became even more anxious, afraid that he would anger her.","\"You can check the evidence’s authenticity!\" Luo Fei stepped forward to block Shadow’s line of sight and said firmly, \"We showed you the evidence, but you refused to hand over the suspects. Do you have a valid reason? Unlawful detention is also a crime...\"","Shadow was well-prepared and did not fall for his trick. He said calmly, \"Those two broke into the manor illegally. We need to check if they stole anything. As long as it’s within 24 hours, it will be reasonable and legal. The IPA can’t do anything about it.\""]},{"number":3890,"title":"Chapter 3890: Luo Fei Is About to Die","paragraphs":["Luo Fei choked.","Shadow continued, \"Also, Leader Luo did show us the relevant ’evidence’, but we want the procedures.\"","He looked at Luo Fei with contempt, showing the arrogance in his bones. \"After all, the Empress’s identity is special. It’s not something that anyone can investigate just because they want to. If they want someone, they can come and ask for them!\"","He was just short of pointing at Luo Fei’s nose and saying, \"Your level is not high enough!\"","However, the meaning between the lines revealed a sense of superiority, vividly displaying the meaning that he did not say out loud.","This was the common arrogance of the reclusive families!","Luo Fei’s face turned green, red, and white. He clenched his fists tightly to control his emotions so that he would not quarrel with Shadow.","The IPA’s people couldn’t take it lying down upon seeing Luo Fei being humiliated. Their expressions were filled with anger.","However, Shadow did not take them seriously and said coldly, \"The Empress is still resting upstairs. Please wait a little longer.\"","Luo Fei was so angry that his shoulders shook. He wished he could stop him from leaving.","Having just finished clearing another round, Qiao Nian lowered her cell phone and raised her eyelashes slightly. Her black eyelashes were long and cold, and her black eyes looked at the arrogant and domineering person.","\"How much longer do we have to wait?\"","Silence.","Shadow was very rude to Luo Fei and the others, but he did not dare to be rude to Qiao Nian.","He fell silent.","Luo Fei was originally furious, but when Qiao Nian suddenly interrupted him, his scalp tightened. He thought of the missiles that could fly over his head at any time.","He instantly forgot his anger and quickly tried to smooth things over. \"Ahem, Q-Qiao Nian. Forget it, we’re already here...\"","Qiao Nian glanced at him and gave him face, not wanting to probe further.","Luo Fei’s scalp went numb. Afraid she would be unhappy, he smiled obsequiously. \"...It should be soon.\"","He even forgot about the ’hate’ from before. He side-eyed Shadow until the corners of his eyes cramped. \"Right?\"","Shadow frowned at him before reluctantly nodding. \"Mr. Fred is on his way.\"","Luo Fei heaved a sigh of relief. He turned to the girl and said, \"Look, I told you!\"","\"Team Leader...\" The other IPA people couldn’t understand what he was doing. Just now, if not for the team leader stopping her from asking, Qiao Nian would have asked.","Why was he still more anxious than the reclusive families’ people?","Someone looked at him hesitantly. \"A-Are you alright?\"","Luo Fei glared at him fiercely. He really wanted to ask, \"What can happen to me?\"","However, he knew why the others were looking at him with such strange expressions. If he didn’t know the inside story, he would probably also think that he was crazy.","Yet, he couldn’t tell everyone the truth.","Luo Fei didn’t know what to say and could only keep it to himself.","\"I’m fine.\"","The matter urged by Luo Fei was left unsettled.","Shadow went upstairs to check on Nie Qingru and see why she had not come down from her room.","Only the people from the IPA and the servants coming from time to time to serve tea and water were left in the extravagantly decorated hall.","They didn’t know each other and could only look at each other in silence.","Luo Fei wanted to persuade Qiao Nian. However, even if there was no one here, he knew that surveillance cameras were everywhere.","Their every move was definitely under their noses.","As the person in charge of the region, he would not make a fool of himself at this place.","Luo Fei could only endure it. His body was honest, and he stole a few glances at Qiao Nian from time to time."]},{"number":3891,"title":"Chapter 3891: Fred Still Doesn’t Know About Sister Nian and Master Wang’s Relationship","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian gave him face and lowered her head to get through another stage in her game. Her cold and slender fingers swiped the screen methodically, showing that she was not flustered at all.","She was the calmest person here, as if she were just visiting her relatives during the new year.","Luo Fei swallowed his saliva, and his heart skipped a beat. He worriedly looked at the girl playing Tetris and did not know what to do.","Seconds ticked by.","Neither Nie Qingru nor Shadow came down again.","Nie Qingru seemed to want to give Luo Fei and Qiao Nian an opening gambit, using her actions to express her contempt for Luo Fei’s status.","Based on her identity, Luo Fei’s status as the person in charge of the IPA in this region was indeed not enough.","But Qiao Nian was here too.","She still had her own way.","It could be seen that she was relying on Qiao Nian’s \"weakness\" to slight them. It was obvious that she wanted to torture Qiao Nian first!","...","An hour later.","The black Lincoln slowly drove through the carved iron gate and entered the manor.","It was Fred’s first time coming here. He tilted his head to look at the fountain’s greenery. He couldn’t help but sigh. \"These people in the illegal district are so rich.\"","Ye Wangchuan only glanced at the environment indifferently before retracting his gaze. He casually tidied his cufflinks and lazily replied, \"They’re alright.\"","Fred glanced at him with a complicated expression and muttered, \"I almost forgot that you’re also a rich person. Those businesses of yours in Continent F...\"","As the international person-in-charge of the IPA, Fred’s old habit acted up again. He wanted to give these big bosses some pointers.","Ji Lin had already parked the car steadily in front of the beautiful building. At this moment, he turned around and said to the two of them, \"Master Wang. Sir. We’re here.\"","Halfway through his sentence, Fred realized that he had forgotten what he had wanted to say. He subconsciously replied to Ji Lin, \"Ah, we’re already here?\"","\"We’re already here.\"","Ji Lin unbuckled his seatbelt and got out of the car to open the door for them.","Ye Wangchuan pushed the door open and got out of the car without help.","Fred was a little slower. Ji Lin opened the door for him. He thanked him and stepped firmly on the ground, looking at the glorious European-style building in front of him.","The building was built like a luxurious medieval castle, surrounded by mountains and rivers. The design of more than ten floors emphasized the owner’s status.","\"Tsk.\" Fred was not a materialistic person. Looking at the building in front of him in shock, he sighed and said, \"Looking at this place, I finally understand why so many people would do anything for wealth and status... The temptation of money and status is too great!\"","He thought that Ye Wangchuan didn’t know Nie Qingru’s secret, so he turned to him and said, \"You don’t know yet, right? The reclusive families’ Empress is a ruthless person. Back then, to obtain the Privy Council’s support, she did not even let her own daughter off...\"","Ji Lin had already returned to Ye Wangchuan’s side. He looked as Master Wang gently raised his eyelids and replied as if he did not know anything, \"Is that so?\"","Fred thought that he really did not know. Before people came out, he excitedly shared this secret gossip with them.","\"It’s true.","\"I was in Continent F at that time. I heard from my colleague that the scientist died very tragically. Not even her corpse was left behind.","\"That scientist’s background is not small. She was dedicated to charity and was a good person. Her friends were all extraordinary, but she left at such a young age.\""]},{"number":3892,"title":"Chapter 3892: Is That Your Girlfriend?","paragraphs":["\"Furthermore, the person in charge of commanding that operation was the Empress.\"","Fred sighed. \"That’s why I said that money and power make people lose themselves. Even among parents and children, many people look past that kinship for money.\"","Ye Wangchuan did not mind. \"It’s just the law of survival in the jungle.\"","\"Yeah.\" Fred sighed and let it go.","To put it bluntly, humans were high-level animals.","The nature of animals was deeply embedded in their genes. On the grassland, there was only a difference between the strong and the weak. There was no kinship to speak of, and there were many conflicts.","It was just that while humans had intelligence, they had learned shame and set a set of moral standards for themselves. Most people followed this standard of living.","Fred was in the IPA and had seen all kinds of people. Some truly did not act like humans... But no matter what, those were just special cases.","Most people would not use their daughters’ blood to pave their way to success like Nie Qingru.","\"By the way, how did your girlfriend know her?\" Fred suddenly asked.","Ye Wangchuan had mentioned this when he came to him for help. However, he had forgotten to ask this along the way... Nie Qingru’s identity was not ordinary. No matter what her character was, she was not someone ordinary people could come into contact with.","It was more likely for Ye Wangchuan to offend her.","This was because the two of them at least had a chance to interact.","But how did Ye Wangchuan’s girlfriend offend the cold-blooded Empress of the reclusive families?","Just as Fred asked curiously, someone walked out to welcome them.","\"Mr. Fred.\" Shadow came down from the second floor after receiving the bodyguard’s call. He did not expect to see two people with Fred.","He was very familiar with one of them, Ji Lin, who was active in Continent M all year round.","The other person was also an acquaintance—Ye Wangchuan!","Shadow’s expression changed slightly. His gaze was vigilant when he looked at Fred again. \"The Empress is inside. Please follow me.\"","No matter what, he had to at least bring him in first.","On the way, Shadow asked, \"Mr. Fred, why are you looking for the Empress?\"","Fred followed him in. No longer relaxed, his expression was now solemn. \"It’s for a business matter.\"","\"Sir, can you tell me?\" Shadow frowned. He had a bad feeling.","Fred ignored him and stepped into the hall.","Ye Wangchuan and Ji Lin followed behind the two of them unhurriedly. They did not care if Shadow greeted them and entered casually.","The moment they did, they bumped into Luo Fei, Qiao Nian, and the others.","Qiao Nian’s eyes met with theirs. She was silent for a second. Because the cube came too fast, in her moment of distraction, it shifted and hit the top of the screen.","Her cell phone rang at the right time.","—[Game Over]","This \"game over\" was especially loud in the silent hall. At the very least, it attracted Fred’s gaze, and he looked at Qiao Nian curiously.","He turned around and whispered something to the man.","Qiao Nian saw Ye Wangchuan’s smiling gaze land gently on her. She nodded and replied, \"Yes.\"","Others might not know what Fred had asked him, but Qiao Nian had learned lip-reading in the past.","She could tell from the shape of Fred’s lips that when he saw her, he immediately asked Ye Wangchuan, \"Is that your girlfriend?\""]},{"number":3893,"title":"Chapter 3893: Fred Was Clearly Schemed By Master Wang","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan replied, \"Yes.\"","Qiao Nian rubbed her ears and exited the game before standing up and walking over. \"Why are you here?\"","She walked up to Ye Wangchuan without hiding anything. Ye Wangchuan did not hide anything either and rubbed her fingertips. He lowered his head and looked focused. \"I heard from Mo Xi that you were here.\"","He admitted it quickly.","Qiao Nian frowned but did not say anything.","She did not like being reported on. That felt like being watched. However, strangely, since it was Ye Wangchuan, she did not feel so disgusted.","It was not a good place to continue this topic with him, so Qiao Nian did not dwell on it.","On the other hand, Luo Fei and the others grew nervous upon seeing Fred. Then, they saw Qiao Nian walk over and skillfully greet the people their boss had brought over. She spoke intimately... Luo Fei felt that his brain was not working well. Didn’t Sun say that she didn’t know their boss?","Luo Fei couldn’t figure out the current situation. He could only suppress his surprise, walk over, and greet Fred awkwardly, \"Boss.\"","\"Why are you here?\" Fred finally noticed his people. He was stunned and could not react for a moment.","Luo Fei wanted to say something, but hesitated. \"Didn’t you come with Sun’s friend...?\"","He was going to say \"boyfriend\", but he changed the address midway.","However, his words still caught Fred’s attention. His eyes widened in shock. \"Who are you talking about?\"","\"That... isn’t Sun’s friend?\" Luo Fei was also stunned. He looked into his eyes and touched his nose in uncertainty.","Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan were still standing together, seeming like a match made in heaven. Their auras were very much compatible. Even if outsiders didn’t know their relationship, they could tell that something was wrong.","Luo Fei was already very conservative in describing them as friends!","However, Fred’s facial muscles twitched, and he said expressionlessly, \"He’s a friend of the person you’re talking about, but I didn’t know that the person you’re talking about... is Sun.\"","Sun.","The top name on the IPA’s Illegal District Watchlist.","Compared to Tian Chen’s boss, Lu Zhi, who was gradually clearing his name and taking the standard corporate route, this person had a personality.","Back then, the Red Alliance was no smaller than Tian Chen.","Over the years, Tian Chen gradually expanded its influence to this point, while the Red Alliance maintained its people from the beginning.","Moreover, different from Lu Zhi’s clear goal and step-by-step style, the Red Alliance was much more casual.","Sun was much more mysterious.","Sun did not stay in the illegal district, nor did she participate in banquets. She rarely appeared at important occasions.","This way, it was much more difficult for the IPA to collect information on this big boss. Until now, the information they had was still what most people outside knew.","For example, Sun was a girl.","Sun was young.","Apart from the information that Sun had revealed a year or two ago, Fred did not have much more information.","He didn’t expect Ye Lan’s nephew’s girlfriend to be the big boss of the illegal district, Sun. And he, the person in charge of the IPA, had come all the way here to help her?","Fred couldn’t describe how he felt at this moment.","Ye Wangchuan had never mentioned Qiao Nian’s identity to him along the way, so he did not put too much thought into it."]},{"number":3894,"title":"Chapter 3894: What a Coincidence, You’re Not the First Person to Look for Me","paragraphs":["Now, everyone was here.","The arrow had no choice but to be shot.","Fred realized he had been set up!","If Ye Wangchuan had told him his girlfriend’s identity in the beginning, he might not have readily agreed to help...","However, everything was within the other party’s calculations.","He had fallen into the young man’s hands.","Fred’s expression was not good. He took several deep breaths, and his heart ached at being so easily tricked.","Luo Fei did not expect his information to be at odds with the boss’s. He also did not know what to say in this situation. \"I thought you knew.\"","Fred was poked in the heart again. He had no desire to speak at all. He ignored the topic and did not want to continue.","\"Why are you guys here?\"","\"Ah, we’re here for...\" Luo Fei was about to tell the whole story to get his help.","However, neither Shadow nor Nie Qingru gave him a chance.","Shadow saw someone coming down from the second floor and quickly interrupted their conversation. \"Mr. Fred, the Empress is coming down.\"","As expected, Fred was so distracted by the person coming down the stairs that he forgot to listen to Luo Fei.","No matter how anxious Luo Fei was, he knew that if he insisted, the reclusive families would definitely come after him.","He could only endure it with a heavy heart. Then, he secretly looked at Qiao Nian’s reaction.","Qiao Nian was already looking upstairs. Her beautiful face was calm.","\"Phew.\" Luo Fei secretly heaved a sigh of relief. He was glad that Qiao Nian was still calm and did not fall out with him.","He immediately looked at Fred worriedly again, anxiously looking for an opportunity to explain the current predicament to him.","Fred did not notice his anxious gaze and only looked as Nie Qingru came down the stairs.","She had already seen the people below and noticed that Ye Wangchuan and Ji Lin were also here.","Nie Qingru had many premonitions in her heart, but her expression remained unchanged. She raised her hand and adjusted her gloves, her demeanor noble. \"Mr. Fred.\"","\"Greetings, Empress,\" Fred said, giving her a gentlemanly bow.","Nie Qingru was of high seniority and status. She calmly accepted his etiquette.","When Fred straightened up, she smiled and asked him, \"Let’s sit down and talk. Would you like tea or coffee, Mr. Fred?\"","Next, she ordered the servants to make the arrangements.","Fred glanced at the servant walking over and did not intend to waste any time. He interrupted Nie Qingru bluntly, \"I’m here to discuss business with the Empress. I won’t be having a drink.\"","\"Oh?\" Nie Qingru raised her eyelids, and the smile faded from her lips.","Her face was cold and solemn, and she looked dignified.","\"What business do you want to discuss with me?\"","\"I’m here about the two suspects.\"","As soon as Fred finished speaking, Nie Qingru revealed a strange expression and sneered. \"What a coincidence. Many people came to my place today to look for people.\"","When Fred saw that Luo Fei was here and heard this, what else did he not understand? His expression did not change, and he steadily showed the notice with the IPA headquarters seal.","\"Empress, I hope you can cooperate with my work!\"","\"Tsk.\"","Nie Qingru obviously did not buy it. She ignored him and walked straight to the sofa. Then, she raised her hand and ordered a servant, \"Make me another cup of black tea.\"","\"Yes.\"","Sensing the serious atmosphere, the servant hurriedly went to do it."]},{"number":3895,"title":"Chapter 3895: You Didn’t Tell Me Your Girlfriend Is Sun","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru turned around and looked at Fred. No longer as polite, she said meaningfully, \"I don’t know when the IPA became so familiar with the Red Alliance that you are willing to take a ten-hour flight to help me.\"","Fred was speechless.","He was not familiar with the Red Alliance.","He wanted to woo the aunt of the boyfriend of the Red Alliance’s boss!","But how could he say that!","Fred’s silence implied that he had a good relationship with Qiao Nian. In Nie Qingru’s eyes, he became even more unfriendly.","Nie Qingru’s expression completely faded. \"It’s not that you can’t ask me for them, but those two broke into the manor, so I have to check if they stole anything before letting them go. If you want them, you can come and pick them up tomorrow morning.\"","At that time, Guan Yan and Qin Si would have become corpses.","Nie Qingru was not afraid that the IPA would pursue the matter.","Tomorrow morning, she would have other ways to solve this problem. For example, she would give the IPA a scapegoat, indicating that her subordinates had been ’too heavy-handed’ and accidentally killed the people.","That she didn’t know about this beforehand.","Nie Qingru knew that with her status, the IPA couldn’t do anything to her. Even if they knew she did it, they could only admit defeat!","Everyone present understood her intentions. Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes, and her gaze turned cold.","At this moment, Ye Wangchuan pinched her hand and comforted her silently, conveying the message: Let’s see how it goes.","Qiao Nian took a deep breath and suppressed her anger.","Fred regained his senses and dropped his polite expression. He looked at Nie Qingru seriously and emphasized again, \"Empress, I hope you can cooperate with our work!\"","Nie Qingru raised her head slightly. \"What if I don’t cooperate?\"","Her question was very casual.","It was a very soft sentence.","However, there was a sense of disdain.","On the way here, Ye Wangchuan had discussed with Fred that Nie Qingru might not give him face. He even pointed out a path for him.","He had thought that there was no need for that.","He did not expect his face to be slapped so quickly!","At this point, Fred could only use the trump card he had prepared in advance.","He handed a document to Nie Qingru.","\"Then take a look at this.\"","\"What is this?\"","Nie Qingru did not reach out for it. Her attitude was very unyielding.","\"I don’t have to look! It won’t change my mind.\"","Fred insisted. \"You’d better take a look.\"","Nie Qingru frowned before slowly reaching for the document. After a quick look, her expression changed drastically.","At first, she was only dissatisfied with Fred’s intentions.","Now, Qiao Nian clearly felt real killing intent emanating from her!","\"What do you want?\" Nie Qingru only read a few lines before stopping. She did not return the document to the other party.","As if he knew she would do this, Fred expressed his thoughts concisely, \"If you insist on not cooperating with the IPA, I can only hand this information to the international police and let them handle it.\"","Nie Qingru’s facial muscles tensed up. The look in her eyes revealed that she wanted to silence him. She slowly sneered. \"This is the illegal district. You came to me alone to show me this. Aren’t you afraid of an accident happening here?\"","The illegal district was a good place.","It was nothing new for the head of the IPA to die here.","As long as she did it cleanly and wiped away the traces afterwards, she could completely remove herself from responsibility.","At this moment, Qiao Nian spoke up. \"So you do know that this is the illegal district, not Continent M.\""]},{"number":3896,"title":"Chapter 3896: Sister Nian Knows How to Strike Where It Hurts","paragraphs":["Nie Qingru had only noticed Fred and had almost forgotten about her existence. Now that she was suddenly slapped in the face, a trace of anger flashed across her face, and she said angrily, \"I’m your grandmother, and you want to help outsiders deal with me?!\"","Qiao Nian dug her ears and asked impatiently, \"Do you only know how to use this sentence? Every time something happens, you say this to me.\"","Luo Fei, Fred, and the IPA people were petrified, as if struck by lightning, during their conversation.","Nie Qingru was Sun’s grandmother.","In other words, the Empress of the reclusive families was the grandmother of Red Alliance’s boss?","Fred quickly turned around and looked at Ye Wangchuan.","The man was extraordinarily handsome. The tailored windbreaker accentuated his upright figure. Just by standing there, he looked magnificent and noble!","He had told the handsome man about Nie Qingru’s secret just before they entered. This man even acted as if he didn’t know anything.","Fred couldn’t tell how many critical hits he had suffered today. He only felt that, as the person in charge of the IPA, he had been completely played.","He was completely crushed by his intelligence!","And such a terrifying person was the nephew that the woman he loved valued the most.","If he wanted to develop a future with Ye Lan, he still had to rely on his nephew’s help...","Fred thought again.","Perhaps Ye Wangchuan had understood the situation from the beginning and knew that even if he knew the truth, he would have to swallow his anger... So, to save unnecessary trouble, he did not make it clear to him from the beginning. He had grasped the hearts of people.","Fred’s heart sank. Besides \"terrifying\", he couldn’t find a suitable adjective to describe the shock Ye Wangchuan had given him in a short time.","Luo Fei was also shocked.","It was just that he knew very little and participated very little.","In his eyes, it was shocking enough that Qiao Nian was Sun. He would just laugh it off if he heard something even more shocking.","He quickly adapted.","\"So you want to help them deal with me?\" Nie Qingru was still unwilling to give up.","Qiao Nian pulled down her baseball cap and put her hands in her pockets. She did not mind kicking her in her sore spot. \"Actually, when you didn’t admit that Qin Si and Guan Yan were with you in the beginning, I might have still considered it. I was worried that you had transferred them away in advance.\"","She looked up. \"But to show that you’re better than me, you didn’t even have the most basic vigilance. You just told me that they’re still in the manor. Then there’s no need for me to be cautious, don’t you think so? My dear... grandmother.\"","Nie Qingru’s face was ashen as she stared at her. \"You’re just a few people. If I don’t let you go, you won’t be able to leave either!\"","Qiao Nian knew she would say this, so she did not stop at all. \"Yes, so I arranged for someone to prepare a backup outside.\"","This time, Nie Qingru was not the only one shocked.","Shadow and the IPA were shocked.","Only Luo Fei, who knew the inside story, and Ye Wangchuan, who knew Qiao Nian well, did not overly react.","The others were in disbelief. They didn’t believe that Qiao Nian would go so far.","She looked at Nie Qingru’s changing expression and slapped her in the face. \"You said that this is the illegal district, but you didn’t say who has the final say here.\"","This was the illegal district, a place where the Red Alliance and Tian Chen had the final say!","At the very least, it wasn’t Nie Qingru’s turn to have the final say!","Shadow could tell that Nie Qingru was about to lose her temper. He immediately stepped forward and warned her with a serious face, \"Sun, aren’t you afraid that none of us can escape?\""]},{"number":3897,"title":"Chapter 3897: Sister Nian Meets Guan Yan","paragraphs":["\"It doesn’t matter.\"","Qiao Nian returned his cold gaze and said calmly, \"The worst outcome is that everyone dies together. I’m not afraid of death, but what about you?\"","Shadow was speechless.","He wasn’t afraid of death, but of Nie Qingru’s safety.","Nie Qingru had finally gotten to where she was today. If she wanted her to perish together with Qiao Nian, she would definitely have to consider whether it was worth it.","Therefore, Qiao Nian \"not being afraid of death\" actually blocked all the reclusive families’ retreat routes.","Even if they weren’t sure if Qiao Nian was bluffing, no one dared to gamble.","**","Nie Qingru didn’t stay to deal with the rest of the matters. She handed everything to Shadow. \"Since I’ve given way, I hope you can keep your promise and not pursue the matter.\"","Fred knew that it was not easy for the Empress to give in, so he agreed readily. \"Of course.\"","Nie Qingru took one last deep look at Qiao Nian, as if she wanted to tear her apart and imprint it in the depths of her mind. Then, she turned around and went upstairs without looking back.","Shadow immediately arranged for someone to bring Guan Yan and Qin Si out and asked Qiao Nian and the others to wait outside.","Soon, a few mercenaries brought them over.","Qin Si was fine. He only had some superficial injuries. His handsome face was green and red, and he looked unsightly. However, from the way he walked, it could be seen that he was not seriously injured.","Guan Yan was in a much worse state.","If she had not been supported by the people on both sides, she probably would not have been able to stand, let alone walk.","Her clothes had long turned bloody. The dark red blood clots were dried and cracked. It was a shocking sight. The whip marks on her wrists and neck were still visible...","Qiao Nian’s expression changed.","Luo Fei was scared out of his wits and quickly pacified her. \"Sun, it’s fine as long as she’s released.\"","Ye Wangchuan pinched her softly, too, but did not say anything.","Qiao Nian suppressed the blood rushing to her temples and the urge to kill. Then, she looked at Shadow coldly and pursed her lips. \"I’ll remember your hospitality!\"","Shadow complained in his heart, but he knew that what he did was what he did.","Hence, he only replied indifferently, \"We received the same treatment in your hands, right?\"","Qiao Nian did not defend herself. At least she had not done anything to Singh and the others. She wasn’t the same kind of person as Nie Qingru and Shadow, who would do anything to suppress her.","She only looked at Guan Yan, who was walking over, and asked with restraint, \"Are you alright?\"","\"Boss.\" It was rare for Guan Yan to call her that. She forced a smile. \"I’m not dead.\"","Seeing that she still had the energy to joke, Qiao Nian knew that her situation was not life-threatening. Her expression improved a little.","She went forward to help her. \"I’ll bring you back.\"","Qin Si was faster than her and already held Guan Yan’s right arm, saying stubbornly, \"Try again and see if you’ll die.\"","F*ck, did he want me to die?","Guan Yan wanted to retort, but when she looked at his bruised face, she subconsciously endured it. It was rare that she did not argue with him.","Qiao Nian saw their reactions. She touched her ears and retracted her hand, tactfully not inserting herself into the conversation, and let Qin Si take care of Guan Yan.","She turned around and pulled her baseball cap down, then looked at the others and said, \"Let’s go back.\"","Fred had suffered a lot today. He looked at her strangely. He couldn’t look at Qiao Nian as if she were a little girl anymore.","Luo Fei couldn’t wait to leave. He called out to the others. \"Let’s go, let’s go.\""]},{"number":3898,"title":"Chapter 3898: Guan Yan Is Fine","paragraphs":["Guan Yan was seriously injured.","Qiao Nian and the others did not return to the Red Alliance. They sent her to the hospital for a full-body checkup.","Initially, Guan Yan did not agree, but she could not dissuade Qiao Nian.","She reluctantly cooperated with the doctor and completed all the examinations. Soon, the doctor came out with the data report and handed it to Qiao Nian, saying earnestly, \"The patient’s external injuries are serious. Fortunately, her internal organs are not injured, so as long as the external injuries are treated well, she will be fine during this period. However, as the saying goes, ’It takes a hundred days to recover from a serious injury’. You definitely won’t agree to be hospitalized. Then, you have to take good care of her at home. Don’t let her do anything. Don’t let her raise her hands to take things from high places.\"","Qin Si immediately went forward to ask, \"Doctor, can you write me a memo so that I can follow it?\"","The doctor looked at him and understood their relationship. He turned around and started typing on the keyboard. \"Wait for me. I’ll write it down for you.\"","Qin Si was very polite. \"Thank you, doctor.\"","The doctor knew young people well. He chuckled and said, \"It’s okay. Just take good care of your girlfriend as I’m writing. I guarantee that she will be alive and kicking again after three months.\"","...","Qin Si stayed inside to talk to the doctor, so Qiao Nian took the test report and went out.","Fred, Ye Wangchuan, Ji Lin, and the others were all outside.","Tattoo Arm and the others from the Red Alliance were also present.","When the people from the Red Alliance saw Qiao Nian coming out alone, they immediately surrounded her and asked:","\"Sun, how is Sister Guan Yan?\"","\"Sun, is Sister Guan Yan alright? What did the doctor say?\"","\"Sun, what did the doctor say to you?\"","Everyone talked at once, making Qiao Nian’s head hurt. She handed the report to one of them. \"Look at it yourself.\"","\"What are you waiting for? Quickly take a look at Sister Guan Yan’s situation!\" The person who received the report was immediately surrounded by the others. Everyone couldn’t wait to know about her situation.","Qiao Nian pushed them away and walked out to take a breather.","She happened to see Fred talking to Ye Wangchuan in the aisle. The two of them were talking about something, and their expressions were solemn.","Fred, in particular, was frowning. It seemed he was quite angry.","Qiao Nian thought about how Fred had helped her in the manor just now. Logically speaking, she should go over and thank him and see what he needed.","Hence, she walked over. \"Mr. Fred... Thank you for your help earlier. Let me know if there’s anything I can do for you.\"","Fred shut his mouth when Qiao Nian approached and did not argue with Ye Wangchuan. He only watched as the number one person on his illegal district list greeted him. There was a sense of conflict.","Faced with such a young and beautiful girl who was younger than him and a junior that Ye Lan liked, even if Fred had complaints in his heart, he was too embarrassed to make things difficult for Qiao Nian.","Hence, he covered his mouth with his hand and coughed dryly to ease the awkwardness. \"You’re too polite.\"","Qiao Nian nodded, her eyes calm and steady. She did not care about his polite words and said directly, \"I owe you a favor this time. If you need me or need anything, just let me know. I’ll do it as long as it’s within my means.\"","Guan Yan was very important to her, and Qin Si was also her friend.","Their safety was more valuable to her than anything material, so she had no problem with whatever Fred asked her in return."]},{"number":3899,"title":"Chapter 3899: Treat It as a Meeting Gift from an Elder","paragraphs":["Speaking of this...","Qiao Nian’s eyes flashed as she thought of something. She looked up at him. \"Before that, I have another question for you. Can you help me answer it?\"","\"Go ahead.\" Fred relaxed a little.","Qiao Nian looked at him and asked, \"What did you show her to force her to agree to let them go in the end?\"","Fred guessed that Qiao Nian would definitely ask him about this later and did not intend to hide it from her. He smiled, revealing his bright teeth, and pouted at the person beside him. \"It’s Wangchuan. He got a report on Di Xicheng’s suspected illegal deeds over the years. It lists many businesses and actions that Di Xicheng used Nie Qingru and the reclusive families to tread on the gray line.","\"As long as I hand this information to the international police, Di Xicheng will definitely be put on the wanted list. She probably didn’t want Di Xicheng to be targeted by the international police, so she chose to give in... Sigh , I really didn’t expect the Empress of the reclusive families to have such a weakness. She’s willing to do this for an irrelevant person.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, he realized that he had said something wrong. He quickly looked at Qiao Nian and waved his hand to explain. \"That’s not what I meant. I just...\"","How could he forget the relationship between Sun and the Empress?","Their relationship was complicated. Fred didn’t know how Sun treated the Empress, but at least he knew she definitely would not like what he said.","Just as he was feeling awkward and did not know how to explain, the girl casually raised her baseball cap and said nonchalantly, \"It’s fine. Just say whatever you want. I don’t mind.\"","That being said, how could Fred go on?","He simply changed the topic and gracefully mentioned what Qiao Nian had just said. \"By the way, you said that you wanted to thank me.\"","As expected, Qiao Nian looked up at him. \"Yes.\"","Fred smiled, patted Ye Wangchuan’s shoulder, and said gently, \"Actually, you don’t have to be so polite with me. I’m considered half an elder to you. It’s normal for an elder to help a junior. Take it as a greeting gift from me.\"","Qiao Nian did not understand for a moment. She frowned and subconsciously looked at Ye Wangchuan, asking him with her black eyes: What does he mean?","Ye Wangchuan received her gaze and touched the bridge of his nose with his slender fingers. Then, he explained softly, \"Fred is wooing my aunt.\"","Silence.","Qiao Nian was rarely surprised, but she really could not control her expression at this moment. She looked at the person in charge of the IPA in shock.","Fred and Auntie Lan?","The corners of Qiao Nian’s mouth twitched. She forced a smile and looked at the mature and serious man. \" Ahem . Good luck.\"","Fred smiled. \"Haha, I’ll work hard.\"","Since both sides had Ye Lan as a lubricant, Qiao Nian finally relaxed. She chatted briefly with Fred.","Fred was already very curious about her. Firstly, Qiao Nian was the number one person on his illegal district list. There was very little information about her on the IPA.","Secondly, he was also puzzled as to how a person from Beijing could be related to the illegal district and even create an existence like the Red Alliance at such a young age.","Later on, he heard that Qiao Nian was not from Beijing at first. She was studying in a high school in a small place outside Beijing, Rao City, remotely controlling the Red Alliance.","Fred’s horizons were broadened, and he sighed inwardly at how terrifying geniuses were.","...","It was already evening when the doctor washed and bandaged Guan Yan’s wound.","Due to Guan Yan’s special status and the recent chaos in the illegal district, Qiao Nian did not let her stay in the hospital. After the doctor treated Guan Yan’s wound, the group returned to the Red Alliance headquarters."]},{"number":3900,"title":"Chapter 3900: Master Wang Is Thinking For Sister Nian","paragraphs":["As someone from the IPA, it was not convenient for Fred to stay with them. Ye Wangchuan personally sent him to the hotel to check in.","After Fred entered the elevator, Ye Wangchuan got into the car and prepared to go back.","Ji Lin drove the car.","They had not rested well for a few days. Ji Lin drove smoothly and steadily. On the way, he looked at the tired expression on the man’s face through the rearview mirror.","He said, \"Master Wang, Old Master called again to ask when you’re going back.\"","Ye Wangchuan pressed a hand between his eyebrows. He closed his eyes and rested. His voice was hoarse. \"What did you say?\"","Ji Lin was very experienced. \"I said that you still have things to settle outside. The date of your return is uncertain.\"","\"Yes,\" Ye Wangchuan replied softly.","Ji Lin observed his expression through the rearview mirror before continuing, \"Uh, but Old Master was very angry. He said a few unflattering words about you and even said that if you didn’t go back soon, he would call Miss Qiao...\"","Old Master Ye’s original words were: If that young brat doesn’t come back soon, I’ll call Nian Nian to see what he’s doing!","It turned out that in Old Master Ye’s heart, Ye Wangchuan had not returned for so long because he was busy with something outside, and because of that, even his precious granddaughter-in-law did not have time to come back.","Ji Lin only found out later that Master Wang had taken the blame for himself in front of the elders in Beijing. Even the Jiang Family thought that Master Wang had something to do outside and could not return.","Old Master Jiang indirectly asked Old Master Ye a few times. Then, Old Master Jiang couldn’t sit still and kept calling the people around him to urge them.","\"Master Wang, you should find time to bring Miss Qiao back.\" Ji Lin couldn’t help but try to persuade him. It was mainly because if Ye Wangchuan did not go back, his impression in front of the elders would definitely be greatly reduced.","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes. \"She doesn’t have time... Besides, something happened to Guan Yan. Let’s wait a little longer.\"","Ji Lin knew there was no point in trying to persuade him anymore. He shut his mouth and drove quietly through the night to the Red Alliance headquarters.","**","In the room.","Qiao Nian came out after showering, wiping the water off her hair with a towel.","She heard the commotion below and knew that Ye Wangchuan and Ji Lin had returned. She lowered her eyes and thought for a moment before putting down the towel and going downstairs.","Downstairs, she saw Ji Lin carrying many bags, and he greeted her. \"Miss Qiao.\"","Qiao Nian looked at the bags and asked curiously, \"What are you holding?\"","Ye Wangchuan unbuttoned his cufflinks and rolled up the edge of his sleeve elegantly, revealing a strong and fair wrist bone. It was beautiful.","\"I’ll make you a hotpot tonight.\"","\"Hotpot?\" Qin Si appeared out of nowhere, smiling at the mention of hotpot. \"Master Wang, you finally understand. I’ve been saying it for a few days, but you didn’t agree. I thought you didn’t want to eat it.\"","Ye Wangchuan’s taste was light, and he was indeed not interested in hotpot.","However, Qiao Nian liked it. His ability to cook authentic hotpot was improving. Qin Si heard that he had even looked for Zhang Yang’s friend, who ran a hotpot restaurant and learned a secret recipe from the chef just to cook for Sister Qiao.","Apart from being envious, Qin Si had to admit that Master Wang often showed off his affection in front of them.","However, he was thick-skinned and could afford to deal with it, so he shamelessly made a request. \"Master Wang, about that... Guan Yan is injured and can’t eat spicy food. Can you make a clear soup pot for her?\"","Ye Wangchuan rolled up his sleeves and raised his eyebrows at him. \"You’re my chef?\""]}]);
